window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3801,"title":"Chapter 3801: The Demon King With A Headache","paragraphs":["Chapter 3801: The Demon King With A Headache","Editor: Henyee Translations","Li Jinnian, who had already opened the car door, paused for a moment. He turned around and looked at Li Hao calmly. “Li Hao, there’s no need to waste too much time on me. Nothing in the Li family has anything to do with me.","“Rather than wasting time on me, why don’t you find out if the old master plans to bring Li Jun and Li Qin back to the country?”","“What do you mean?” A second ago, Li Hao was still wearing a mask-like smile. Now, his face turned cold. He stared at Li Jinnian intently, trying to see something. “Do you know something?”","“I don’t know anything, but I can make guesses after thinking about it. Now, the old madam has been working hard for her children’s family business her entire life. Now that her son has passed away, she’ll be helping her grandson and granddaughter.","“So, Li Hao, the person you should be afraid of isn’t me.”","Li Jinnian opened the car door, closed it, started the engine, and drove off.","It wasn’t that he didn’t play schemes. He just didn’t want to play such schemes.","However, if it concerned the Fu family, he didn’t mind playing them.","After receiving the reminder, Li Hao stood in the twilight and stared at the car that was driving away. Even after the car disappeared, he stood there for a long time without moving.","Li Jinnian had given him an important reminder.","Although Uncle had passed away, Uncle’s son and daughter were still around. Now, the old madam... would indeed come up with a plan for her grandchildren.","A sinister look flashed past Li Hao’s face. He pursed his lips and stood there for a while before smiling again. Then, he turned around and went back into the house.","Li Jinnian, who had rushed back to Dangui Garden, heard the old man’s happy laughter the moment he opened the door. “Don’t worry about me. I’m in good health. It doesn’t matter if you don’t come back for the new year. I won’t be alone during the new year.","“I have my old comrades, colleagues, and students... They’ll all come. It’ll be very lively around me.”","The old man’s laughter influenced Li Jinnian. Needless to say, he was talking to his cousin, Ye Jian.","The old man was very understanding that Ye Jian couldn’t come home for the new year.","His granddaughter had her own path to walk. As her grandpa, he would definitely support her fully.","When he saw his grandson coming in, the old man changed the topic to Zhou Niannian. “Your cousin brought a woman back today. She’s a police officer. She graduated from the police school less than half a year ago. She’s a lively young lady. I like her very much.","“Does your cousin like her? Hahaha, he definitely likes her. If not, why would he bring her home for me to meet? However, your cousin didn’t take the initiative and didn’t even invite the young lady in. Uncle Fu invited the young lady in. Your cousin didn’t even know that he should pour a glass of water for her.","“I’m worried. If he doesn’t take the initiative, when will he be able to woo that lady? Jian, you have to have a good chat with your cousin. Get him to take the initiative. He shouldn’t become a bachelor.”","Li Jinnian took the receiver helplessly and explained to Ye Jian, “It’s not like what Grandpa said. I have nothing to do with Zhou Niannian.","“She came to the house today because she suspected that I was a fake soldier. She needed to confirm my identity. That’s why she followed me home. It’s not like what Grandpa said.”","Ye Jian was smiling on the other end of the line. “But Grandpa likes her very much. After hearing what Grandpa said, I feel that she’s an interesting policewoman. Cousin, you’re a bit boring. It’s better to find an interesting girlfriend.”","Zhou Niannian. The name sounded interesting. It was even rarer that the two old men approved of her.","Based on the two old men’s judgment, it would definitely be good if the two became a couple.","“You’re going to be sent to the company now, right? Perform well in the company and don’t worry about your family matters. Also, don’t kick up a fuss.” Li Jinnian sensed that Ye Jian was also excited and decisively changed the topic."]},{"number":3802,"title":"Chapter 3802: Marriage","paragraphs":["Chapter 3802: Marriage","Editor: Henyee Translations","Until now, Li Jinnian had no intention of finding a girlfriend. There were no females in his military unit. Hence, the old master was a little anxious.","If Li Jinnian were out in society, the old master wouldn’t be worried that such an outstanding man like him wouldn’t be able to find a girlfriend. However, in the army where it was full of male soldiers, the old master was a little worried.","His grandson... suffered a lot when he was young. He didn’t have his parents to take care of him. After his stepmother married into the family and gave birth to a son and a daughter, his family didn’t have a place for him anymore. After he entered junior high, he wouldn’t even go back home. When the old master’s wife was still alive, she would often bring Li Jinnian back to stay for a while.","At that time, Li Jinnian was really like a hedgehog. Who would have thought that his cold and silent grandson was a fierce wolf cub in the past?","The old master felt that his grandson and granddaughter suffered a lot when they were young. Now, his granddaughter had Xia Jinyuan, who doted on her, and the Xia family’s love. He could feel at ease knowing what Ye Jian’s future would be like.","With his grandson, having a father was the same as not having one. When he was young, no one loved him. Now that he had grown up, he didn’t have anyone to accompany him. How could the old master feel at ease?","The young lady who came to visit him today had wide eyes. There was not a trace of sorrow in her eyes. The moment he saw her, he knew that her family was happy and she was doted on. If his grandson were to date such a young lady, she wouldn’t be out of his league. That was because he would be lucky to have her.","He truly thought so from the bottom of his heart. The old master had never voiced any of it out to Ye Jian or Li Jinnian.","The words in his heart were bitter. He just needed to suffer alone. There was no need to drag the younger generation to suffer with him.","Although the old man didn’t say anything out loud, his two intelligent grandchildren knew about it.","Ye Jian said softly, “Cousin, if you really like someone, you should go after her. Grandpa hopes that there’ll be a woman who loves and understands you by your side.","“Grandpa can rest assured on my side. However, there’s no news from you, so he’s worried. Look at how Grandpa keeps calling her ‘Niannian’. I think she’s not bad. She’s a good lady.","“Grandpa Xia has also said that the young lady is very good. It depends on whether you have the ability to woo her. Do you want to give it a try? It’s alright if you haven’t wooed a woman before. There’s a first time for everything.","“Besides, there’s no such thing as love at first sight. If you feel that the other party is not bad and that she’s your type, then that’s good enough. That’s why you feel your heart palpitating. That’s how you become a couple in the end.","“If you don’t go anywhere after coming back from the military unit, how can you meet a woman who makes your heart flutter?","“Zhou Niannian must have something special about her to be liked by the two old men. I’m sure that Grandpa didn’t misjudge her. Cousin, give it a try. I’m not saying that you have to get together with Zhou Niannian. What I mean is that you can try to get along with her.”","Ye Jian knew that their grandfather was worried, so she took the chance to persuade her cousin.","Li Jinnian kept rubbing his temples. He had never thought about relationships before. However, after hearing what the old master said and being persuaded by his cousin, he couldn’t help but look at marriage seriously.","He was 29 years old...","He was already 29 years old.","After Li Jinnian ended his call with Ye Jian, he sat on the sofa for a long time without coming back to his senses. It was indeed time to consider marriage."]},{"number":3803,"title":"Chapter 3803: Sour, Sweet, Bitter","paragraphs":["Chapter 3803: Sour, Sweet, Bitter","Editor: Henyee Translations","However, with his profession, how could ordinary ladies bear with it?","Only his cousin, Ye Jian, could bear with it.","Xia Jinyuan hadn’t appeared for almost a year, but his younger cousin was still able to walk her own path. She never complained or gave up because of this. Only a woman like his younger cousin could persevere...","When Xia Jinyuan came back, he would have to learn from him and ask him how he managed to woo his cousin.","As for Zhou Niannian...","Li Jinnian didn’t have any thoughts, and neither did Zhou Niannian.","However, fate was magical. Even if nothing blossomed the first time, it was uncertain whether anything would blossom in the future.","When the old man came out of the kitchen, his grandson was still sitting on the sofa alone. Under the faint light, he seemed to be isolated from the outside world. He looked alone.","The old man heaved a long sigh in his heart. His footsteps alerted Li Jinnian, who was thinking about something. He hurriedly got up to help the old man.","Uncle Fu had already prepared dinner. Amidst the aroma of the dishes, Li Jinnian placed his chopsticks on the table and scooped some rice. He started chatting with the old man at the dining table.","When the meal was about to end, the old man said to him, “Your cousin can’t come back to the capital city for the new year. Why don’t you go to Nanguang to see your sister? She hasn’t been home for a long time. I wonder how she is now.”","Li Jinnian remembered his vacation and nodded without thinking.","When it was late at night, Li Jinnian asked casually, “Cousin has already returned to the Fu family, but the people outside don’t know. Do you have any arrangements?”","He meant to ask when would the people outside know that Old Master Fu’s granddaughter had returned home?","“Your uncle and cousin don’t seem to want other people to know about this. Let nature take its course.” The old man lying on the bed and preparing to sleep looked at his grandson kindly. He patted the back of Li Jinnian’s hand with his skinny hand and said gently, “Jinnian, don’t get involved in some things. Your uncle and I know what to do.","“Don’t just think about us. You have to think about yourself too. I have your uncle, your younger cousin, and my grandson-in-law to take care of me in the future. You can rest assured.","“I have the same thing to say about family matters. Don’t worry about it. Serve the country well and walk every step steadily from now on. Find a woman who can make you happy and warm. That’s all.”","As it turned out, according to the original plan, Ye Jian’s identity would be announced at the old man’s birthday celebration this year. However, Old Master Li wasn’t very well-behaved, so Mr. Fu and the old man discussed it. They decided not to specially announce Ye Jian’s identity to prevent it from affecting her.","Now, every step Ye Jian took was solid. She didn’t need any identity. She was able to stand firmly in the military unit with her own capabilities. In that case, it didn’t matter if she revealed her identity or not.","Li Jin nodded to show that he understood.","He didn’t want to reveal Ye Jian’s identity either. The Li family wasn’t very well-behaved. Li Chuhai’s power overseas was quite powerful. Once Ye Jian’s identity was revealed, with the methods and strategies of the old master of the Li family, he might start a war with his cousin.","If they really wanted to announce it, they would have to wait until all the foreign forces on Li Chuhai’s side were eliminated.","Xia Jinyuan, who hadn’t shown his face for a long time... What mission was he on?","If Li Jinnian remembered correctly, he disappeared within a few days after Li Chuhai was executed. Could it be that he went overseas to get rid of Li Chuhai’s overseas forces?"]},{"number":3804,"title":"Chapter 3804: Good Days","paragraphs":["Chapter 3804: Good Days","Editor: Henyee Translations","Li Jinnian’s logical reasoning was extremely strong, and he was very careful. He actually deduced why Xia Jinyuan went overseas. He only guessed it in his heart and didn’t tell anyone.","Ye Jian didn’t know that Li Jinnian would be arriving in Nanguang soon and would enter the military unit to visit her. During the afternoon break, Ye Jian was ‘caught’ by the company commander. She was called over to the company to greet the visiting soldiers from the arts regiment who had brought along an exciting program.","“We’re all a bunch of rough men. The female soldiers from the arts troupe are delicate. If we raise our voices a little, we’ll scare them. Two years ago, a battalion commander scared the female soldiers and they ended up spraining their ankles because his voice was a little loud. At that time, the regimental commander glared at us and told us that we can forget about watching the female soldiers’ performance in the future.","“The regimental commander is ruthless and means what he says. In the past three years, no female soldiers from the arts troupe came to perform. The ones performing during the New Year’s Welcome Gala were all male soldiers and the soldiers’ wives.","“When they return, you and Ding Ling can treat them well. With you guys around, I can rest assured. At least our loud voices won’t scare the female soldiers into twisting their ankles again.”","The company commander told Ye Jian about the ‘tragedy’ three years ago. He only had one goal—to ensure that the female soldiers performed normally.","It couldn’t be helped. The gender ratio in the military unit was severely imbalanced. Every time there was a festival, all the men would reveal their emotions, especially the single soldiers. It could be said that every time the female soldiers from the troupe came, their gazes... were almost sincere.","If the female soldiers made eye contact with them, that would be amazing. They would become happy and shy. However, if they really had to speak to the female soldiers... they would be frightened!","They were all satisfied with just one look. They didn’t dare to look for too long.","It was almost the end of the year. They missed their parents, their wives, their children, and their girlfriends... They might seem tough normally, but as the new year approached, their hearts were full of yearning. No matter how difficult the training was, it couldn’t stop them from missing their family, loved ones, and children.","Soldiers were humans too. The military uniform gave them a mission that allowed them to keep their emotions away easily. However, humans would be weak sometimes. It was inevitable.","At this moment, they needed consolation. The New Year’s Welcome Gala was the greatest consolation for the soldiers.","There were performances to watch and touching conversations to listen to. They were able to receive concern when they were at their weakest. They could feel the concern from the military unit. They would then pat their chests and carry their guns. With their heads raised and their chests puffed out, they were soldiers who bled but didn’t cry!","Although this was Ye Jian’s first time being sent to the company, she was not unfamiliar with the life of a grassroots company. When she was in Fujun Town, she often trained and lived with the soldiers in the company. She understood why the soldiers valued this New Year’s Welcome Gala that included female soldiers from the arts troupe.","A few days ago, when Ye Jian came over with Ding Ling, they were treated as ‘treasures’ and were warmly welcomed. That was when they knew that even their company’s secretary... was a male soldier!","No wonder the male soldiers and the company commander were looking forward to this.","The female soldiers from the arts troupe were still rehearsing in the hall. The moment Ye Jian and Ding Ling entered the hall, they saw a few male soldiers who had also been brought over. They were setting up tables and chairs. Just like what the company commander said, they were so obedient that they didn’t even have the guts to raise their heads and peek at the female soldiers on the stage.","When they were on the training ground, they were so energetic and lively. At this moment, they all became shy.","Ye Jian’s gaze landed on the stage. A dancing figure instantly caught her eye. She saw Xia Jinyuan’s cousin, Zhou Yijin, and... Du Jiayi, who was standing beside the regimental commander, Du Kaiwei."]},{"number":3805,"title":"Chapter 3805: Like A Bear","paragraphs":["Chapter 3805: Like A Bear","Editor: Henyee Translations","In the first month of this year, Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan went back to the Xia family to meet Zhou Yijin. Later, because of an urgent mission, she didn’t manage to bid farewell to the elders of the Xia family and left in a hurry.","She still remembered Zhou Yijin. She just didn’t know if Zhou Yijin still had any impression of her. After all, they hadn’t seen each other for almost a year.","Previously, she knew that Zhou Yijin was in the Nanguang Military District’s arts troupe. She didn’t expect to meet her in a grassroots company.","Ye Jian planned to greet her later.","Ding Ling looked at the female soldiers dancing lightly on the stage and said enviously, “They’re so agile. Their figures are so slender. They look as light and soft as a feather.","“I heard that they need to control their appetite. They can’t eat too much. If they eat too much, they won’t be able to jump. However, it’s quite tiring for them to rehearse every day. Tsk, if it were me, I wouldn’t have the patience to jump around every day. I might as well run a few rounds on the training ground.”","There were specializations in every profession. The other party were female soldiers from the arts troupe. They naturally had their own specialties. If not, how could they be called ‘military arts soldiers’?","Ye Jian smiled and said, “The gala will only be held tomorrow. You can try it with them today and experience what it’s like to be a military arts soldier.”","“Hehe, forget it. I’m afraid that I might be able to perform some military boxing.”","As Ding Ling spoke, she started laughing. After she finished laughing, she said, “What do we need to help with? The male soldiers have already arranged the tables and chairs. We can’t help them much. Why did the company commander ask us to come over?”","They came here purely to greet the female soldiers from the arts troupe. After all, it was easy for female comrades and female students to interact with each other. They would be able to talk quickly too.","They weren’t like the male soldiers. Before they came, they laughed and said that they wanted to take a photo with the female soldiers. In the end, they couldn’t say anything even after arranging the tables and chairs for so long.","Cowards, they were all cowards!","The company commander brought two male soldiers in and prepared to hang the colored lamps and silks. When he saw that the single battalion commander in his camp was working harder than the male soldiers, he was furious. He was really angry!","What f*cking cowards!","That 30-year-old man didn’t even have a girlfriend, yet he didn’t know how to grasp the opportunity that was created for him. The angry company commander raised his voice and said, “Ye Jian, bring our battalion commander to the stage to hang the lanterns!”","Putting aside whether the soldiers from the art troupe were frightened or not, as the person involved, Ye Jian was.","His voice was really... extraordinarily loud!","When he shouted, she felt as though the entire auditorium was about to be lifted.","Also, did the company commander call the wrong person?","She was asked to bring the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion to the stage to hang the lights, but shouldn’t the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion bring her to the stage to hang the lights?","Ye Jian’s heart skipped a beat when she was suddenly called out. She turned her head and saw the company commander striding toward her.","“The battalion commander of our 3rd Battalion is still single. Last time, his 70-year-old mother even specially asked our political commissars if they could help to settle his marriage. We, the political commissars, patted our chests and agreed.","“Look, it’s almost been a year. The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion is still single. Before the arts troupe came, the other political commissars pulled me into the office and talked to me earnestly. They implied that as a company commander, I’m not qualified enough. I can’t even settle my soldier’s own marriage. Now that I have the chance, I have to fight for the 3rd Battalion. I can’t disappoint the mother of the 3rd Battalion’s commander.”"]},{"number":3806,"title":"Chapter 3806: Where Can You Run?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3806: Where Can You Run?","Editor: Henyee Translations","The company commander was from Nanguang. He spoke very stiff and awkward Mandarin. His enunciation was unclear, but the amazing thing was... even the soldiers in the team could understand what he said, including Ye Jian.","Ye Jian realized that she understood everything.","Ding Ling heard this and turned her head to the side. She clenched her fists, trying her best to suppress her laughter.","‘Don’t laugh, don’t laugh. Do your best, Ding Ling. You must bear with it!’","The company commander probably knew that his Mandarin was a little bad. After he finished speaking, he asked Ye Jian worriedly, “Do you understand?”","“Yes, I understand. I’ll do it now.” Ye Jian nodded. She accepted such an honorable mission.","To put it bluntly, they needed a female soldier like her to bring the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion, who was shy when he saw women, to interact more with the soldiers of the art troupe. Maybe he would find someone he got along with.","It was better to get to know more women!","The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion was also frightened by the company commander. It wasn’t that the company commander’s voice scared him. It was just that... he was scared at the thought of hanging the lights on the stage.","What a joke!","Let him go on stage?","Definitely not!","Run!","In front of his company commander who dared to order him around, the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion didn’t even think about whether the fellow was overstepping his authority. He maintained his serious expression and said to his soldiers, “Continue. I’m going out to do something.”","He had to remain serious. If not, the soldiers would see that his face was burning up!","Fortunately, his face was tanned. If not, they would have been able to tell.","There were two folds on the soldiers’ epaulet. They were all veterans, so they knew that the battalion commander was embarrassed. They lowered their heads and laughed. “Battalion Commander, why are you running away? They won’t eat you. The company commander wants you to go on stage. Go on, go on!”","“Are you asking for a beating?” The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion glared at the soldiers. Before the company commander came over, he turned his head and rushed toward the door.","“Stop, Battalion Commanders of the 3rd Battalion!” The company commander, who was walking with Ye Jian, had been keeping an eye on him. When he saw this, he shouted again, causing the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion to freeze on the spot.","Ye Jian’s heart was shaking. She wondered if the audacious company commander would be punished by the battalion commander afterward.","On the stage, Du Jiayi thought that she heard it wrong.","Ye Jian?","Why was she still hearing names that displeased her in the Nanguang Military District?","Hearing that, Du Jiayi immediately looked over. The moment she looked over, her face darkened.","She didn’t hear it wrong!","It was Ye Jian, the one who made her unhappy and competed with her to show off in front of the male soldiers. This woman thought that she was very impressive! She investigated Ye Jian for a long time after that but couldn’t find any information on her. Du Jiayi only knew that Ye Jian was a military school student.","When the snow mountain collapsed back then, Ye Jian didn’t cooperate with Du Jiayi, so Du Jiayi hated her. Later, because of Xia Jinyuan, she met Ye Jian again. Du Jiayi became even more certain that Ye Jian was a scheming woman who was unscrupulous and wanted to rely on someone.","“Brother, why did she come to your military unit? Why haven’t I heard you mention it before?” Du Jiayi’s gaze turned dark as she questioned her brother. “Why did your company accept such a military school student?”","“Who is it?” Du Kaiwei didn’t understand who she was talking about. He raised his head and looked ahead. He saw a company commander below him walking over with Ye Jian, a student from the military school.","“It’s Ye Jian. Why did she come to your military unit? Didn’t you investigate her? Why did you accept her so easily?”","Du Jiayi’s words reminded Du Kaiwei of where he had heard the name ‘Ye Jian’ before.","He had heard Du Jiayi and Madam Li mention her before."]},{"number":3807,"title":"Chapter 3807: What Misunderstanding","paragraphs":["Chapter 3807: What Misunderstanding","Editor: Henyee Translations","As for Ye Jian, Du Kaiwei remembered that she seemed to have something to do with Ye Zhifan from the Southern Province. Their surnames were both Ye... Could it be that Ye Jian was Ye Zhifan’s daughter who nearly tricked her way into marrying into the Du family?","If that was the case...","“She’s Ye Zhifan’s daughter?” Du Kaiwei frowned as he confirmed with Du Jiayi. If that was the case, no matter how outstanding Ye Jian was in other aspects, she couldn’t stay in the military unit because of her character. He would add something to the file.","“She’s not his daughter. She’s his niece. Ye Ying is Ye Zhifan’s daughter. However, it doesn’t matter. Everyone in that family has the same character. They go around swindling people.” The look of disgust on Du Jiayi’s face deepened.","Ye Jian and Ye Ying were the same. Both of them wanted to climb up the social ladder and marry into a wealthy family. There was no news of Ye Ying, so she must have been dealt with badly. However, she always ended up meeting Ye Jian coincidentally. Her good mood was ruined again.","It turned out it was his niece, and it was not the same person.","Du Kaiwei’s tightly furrowed brows finally relaxed. It was good that it wasn’t the same person.","Seeing the disgust on his sister’s face, Du Kaiwei frowned again and said in a low voice, “Jiayi, Ye Jian is Ye Jian and Ye Ying is Ye Ying. You’re being biased.","“Also, Mom doesn’t have a good temper now. She’ll say things that are unfair and unpleasant to hear. You should know how to make judgments by now. How can you have a prejudice against Ye Jian just because she’s Ye Zhifan’s niece?","“If there’s really something wrong with Ye Jian, her school wouldn’t have given her such a high evaluation. She has been in the company for a few days, and her performance is very good. There’s nothing bad about her. Jiayi, do you have a misunderstanding about Ye Jian?”","Overall, Du Kaiwei was a good person. Protecting his own people was his forte. He protected his soldiers very well. Although he was a narrow-minded person who liked to bear grudges, his character was generally passable.","Ye Jian was his soldier now. When Du Jiayi said that Ye Jian was bad, he didn’t blindly listen to her. He could differentiate between right and wrong and believed that Ye Jian was not bad. He had his own judgment and wouldn’t be easily influenced.","Du Jiayi pursed her lips and stopped talking. She didn’t just have a prejudice against Ye Jian. However, she knew her brother’s personality. He was very protective. He wouldn’t allow outsiders to say that his family was bad. In the same way, he also wouldn’t allow other people to say that his soldiers were bad—not even his biological sister.","Forget it, she wouldn’t talk to him anymore. As long as Ye Jian was in his regiment, he wouldn’t help her.","Besides, Ye Jian didn’t have any conflicts of interest with her. She would bear with it for the time being.","If she dared to offend her like before, heh, she shouldn’t be blamed for not showing mercy!","A vicious look flashed past Du Jiayi’s eyes. She didn’t complain to Du Kaiwei anymore. She raised her chin slightly in the direction of the female soldiers who were still rehearsing and said in a low voice, “I’ll go and take a look at their rehearsal. There are still a few movements that they haven’t perfected.”","Du Jiayi didn’t want to say anything else and found an excuse to leave.","When Du Jiayi’s gaze swept over while she was on stage, Ye Jian had already noticed it. On an occasion like this, Ye Jian believed that Du Jiayi wouldn’t do anything rude given her prideful personality.","Even so, Ye Jian didn’t feel at ease when she saw the woman’s gloomy gaze. Also, now wasn’t the time to fight with Du Jiayi. At the same time, The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion wasn’t looking too good.","The company commander, who had disregarded hierarchy and ordered the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion to stand still, saw that the battalion commander’s expression was a little dark and cold. Sweat started appearing on his forehead. Just now, he shouted loudly with an aura that disregarded the battalion commanders. Now, he was a little frightened."]},{"number":3808,"title":"Chapter 3808: Chapter 3807 - 3808: The Cowardly Company Commander","paragraphs":["Chapter 3808: The Cowardly Company Commander","Editor: Henyee Translations","The company commander, who was a little short of breath, asked Ye Jian secretly, “Should I not have ordered the battalion commanders of our 3rd Battalion just now... to stop where he was. Did I cause trouble just now? That roar just now, I had learned it from the political commissars. I just wanted to follow along.","“Alas, I can’t help it. I have a good relationship with the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion. We’re old friends. When I get married, he’ll even be my best man.”","Ye Jian and Ding Ling, students who hadn’t entered the military unit, looked at each other quickly. As it turned out, it wasn’t that the company commander was afraid. It just came as a belated reaction!","Also, the two of them learned something. Sometimes, one couldn’t be old friends with one’s superiors. It might backfire.","Now, their company commander had found himself in such a situation.","“You can say that this is an important task entrusted to you by the government. You can’t disobey the orders of your superiors. Then, ask for forgiveness from the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion.” Ye Jian saw that the company commander was still wiping the sweat off his forehead and continued in a low voice, “Also, you can say that you’ve been good friends for many years and couldn’t bear to see him without a wife yet, which is why you disregarded the hierarchy for a moment.”","The company commander’s good friend, Old Tie of the 3rd Battalion, had already walked over. The company commander quickened his pace and smiled as he walked over. Then... his stomach was punched by the iron fist of the 3rd Battalion’s commander.","“Company Commander, why did you ask me to stop?” The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion, who was facing Ye Jian and smiling, revealed his white teeth. He spat out the words from his gritted teeth, “You’re bold. How dare you order me around? Those who don’t know might think that you’re a battalion commander and I’m a company commander.”","“I’m just doing my duty. I don’t dare to let down the political commissars. That’s why I was given permission to momentarily overlook ranks when it comes to your marriage. It’s only limited to your marriage.”","The company commander, who got punched in the stomach, felt bitter. He didn’t want to shout either. It was the battalion commander’s fault for trying to run away.","The moment he tried to run away, he ruined the plan!","The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion didn’t blame the company commander. He knew that his old comrades were doing this for his own good. But wasn’t this... embarrassing?","“I’ll settle the score with you later.” As he spoke, the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion punched the abdomen of the company commander again. Hearing the other party gasp a few times, the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion felt much more comfortable. “The regimental commander and his sister are over there. Bring two students and greet the regimental commander.","“Let the two female students stay here and let the male soldiers disperse. They’re all a bunch of cowards. Just now, a female soldier had a problem and voiced out, but those good fellows ended up stuttering! How embarrassing!”","‘Aren’t you the same?’ That was what the company commander said in his heart. However, what he said was something else, “The male soldiers can leave, but you can’t, or I won’t be able to answer to the political commissars. I shouted at you too. You can’t let me shout for nothing. Let the two female students bring you onto the stage.”","“Ye Jian, Ding Ling, come over quickly! Bring the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion over to help.”","“Yes!” Two crisp and clear voices sounded at the same time. The two people who had been watching the entire process between the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion and the company commander sneaked over.","For the sake of the battalion commanders’ marriage, the company commander must have been so worried that his hair nearly turned white.","Moreover, he might get beaten up at any time.","In the end, the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion didn’t escape. He was brought to the stage.","The regimental commander, Du Kaiwei, couldn’t help but find it funny when he saw the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion blushing. “Why are you acting like a teenage girl?”","“The company commander must be anxious. If not, how could he dare to order you to stop? If you’re not satisfied, I’ll punish him for you.”"]},{"number":3809,"title":"Chapter 3809: Chapter 3808 - 3809: The Strength Of The Army Relies On The General","paragraphs":["Chapter 3809: The Strength Of The Army Relies On The General","Editor: Henyee Translations","Standing on the stage, the gaze of the battalion commander was either not focused or he was staring at the corner of the wall. He shook his head. “No need, no need. He was just very anxious. That’s why he dared to shout at me. Normally, this doesn’t ever happen.”","Hearing this, Du Kaiwei smiled at Ye Jian and Ding Ling. “Look at your battalion commander. I just said it casually and he took it seriously. I don’t have to worry that you’ll suffer if I assign the two of you to the 3rd Battalion. With him, a battalion commander who doesn’t have the airs of a leader, protecting you, none of you will suffer.”","For some reason, when Ding Ling heard this, she felt that something was wrong. However, she couldn’t tell what was wrong.","She didn’t dare to say anything and looked at Ye Jian.","Ye Jian understood what he meant, so she didn’t say anything either. She blinked at Ding Ling and maintained a faint smile on her face. She remained silent.","When Du Kaiwei saw this, he couldn’t help but narrow his eyes.","Student Ye Jian... was indeed interesting. She was a smart female student.","Ye Jian definitely wouldn’t say anything. As long as she opened her mouth, both sides wouldn’t have a good ending. The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion had to protect the company commander. As for Regimental Commander Du Kaiwei, he felt that the relationship between the battalion commander and the company commander was too good that it was inappropriate.","If she was asked who she thought was right and who was wrong, she would definitely say that the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion was right.","The power of an army relied on the general. The relationship between the subordinates and officers determined the cohesion, combat power, and teamwork of a military unit.","The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion had a good relationship with the company commander. When they were working, they had a clear hierarchy. When they weren’t working, they were good brothers. When they were working, they were harmonious. When they weren’t working, they were even more harmonious. This was one of the main reasons why the 3rd Battalion’s results were always at the forefront.","The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion nodded in approval when he saw Ye Jian merely smiling. He hadn’t interacted much with the two female students. They were under the responsibility of the company commander. But it wasn’t hard to see how good Ye Jian was whenever she was in front of him and he had the time to observe.","She had good comprehensive qualities and was smart.","That was right. If all the students were as strong as her, the basic-level company would not have to worry so much.","He smiled and said, “If they don’t train well and don’t cooperate with the grassroots company, I’ll be the first to not forgive them. I told the company commander that we can’t show mercy just because they’re female soldiers. There should be no difference in how we treat our male soldiers.”","As he spoke, the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion suddenly raised his hands and pointed at the stage that he had been looking at. “Ye Jian, go to the stage and take a look. A female soldier has already waved at you several times.”","Ye Jian turned her head to look. It was none other than Zhou Yijin, whom she thought wouldn’t recognize her.","Ding Ling didn’t want to stay behind alone. Seeing that Ye Jian was about to leave, she immediately said, “Regimental Commander, Battalion Commander, Ye Jian and I will go over and take a look.”","Since she asked, they would definitely have to agree.","“Go ahead. If they need any help, try your best to help them. Also, the one in the middle who isn’t wearing a military uniform is my younger sister. She used to be the backbone of the arts troupe. She only retired two years ago.”","Du Kaiwei nodded, and the two of them left.","“These two female students are quite interesting. Do you have any thoughts of keeping them? If you have any thoughts, you can talk to me.” The moment the two of them were left alone, Du Kaiwei started chatting with the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion.","The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion replied seriously, “One is a commander and the other is a technical soldier. It’s not suitable for them to stay. There’s no role suitable for them. There are no more empty slots in my camp either. It’s a waste of their talent to let them come over.”"]},{"number":3810,"title":"Chapter 3810: Chapter 3809 - 3810: Superior And Inferior","paragraphs":["Chapter 3810: Superior And Inferior","Editor: Henyee Translations","Du Kaiwei couldn’t help but laugh at his serious reply. “Hahaha, if the two were to join, they’ll surely be promoted to company commander in a short time. By then, your company commanders will have to vacate his position. How can you bear to let him go?”","It was impossible for that to happen.","Among the three battalions, the 3rd Battalion was the most powerful. Some time ago, there was news that the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion might be promoted to the deputy regiment. This made Du Kaiwei vigilant.","This time, he saw the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion mingling with his company commander. Even when the company commander ordered him to stop, he wasn’t angry. Du Kaiwei didn’t say anything, but he planned to have a good chat with the 3rd Battalion’s battalion commander.","It wouldn’t be bad if the company commander could vacate his position.","To the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion, the reason why his military achievements were not bad was because of their team spirit. He was not obsessed with their military ranks. He didn’t feel the need to put on airs to show his status. There was really no need for that!","He understood that his troops were the core of everything.","As for the regimental commander, he was a good person who treated his soldiers well too. Although he was a little petty sometimes, it wasn’t that he was difficult to get along with. The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion spoke up for the company commander and changed the topic. “Regimental Commander, there’s no need to rush my marriage matters. Look at the female soldiers. They’re all soft and tender. They’ll suffer if they end up with soldiers like us. I’ll just go back to my hometown and lead a sincere and reliable life.”","“There’s no use telling me about this. Let’s talk to the political commissars. In my opinion, you might as well find someone in the military unit. You guys can understand each other, and it’ll be easier to communicate.” After he finished speaking, Du Kaiwei raised his wrist and looked at the time. “I have a meeting in the afternoon. I won’t stay any longer. Text me if there’s anything.”","“Okay!” The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion nodded.","Then, he heard Du Kaiwei say, “Take care of my sister. She hasn’t been in a good mood recently and has a childish temper. Please bear with her.”","This wasn’t a problem. In the past, they had all seen the temper of the regimental commander’s sister. She looked fine at first, but they could never know if her expression would change in the next second.","After making the arrangements, Du Kaiwei didn’t stay any longer and walked out of the auditorium. Du Jiayi didn’t notice that her brother had left. At this moment, her gaze landed on Ye Jian.","She actually knew Xia Jinyuan’s cousin, Zhou Yijin!","What kind of ability did Ye Jian use to be able to talk and laugh with Zhou Yijin?","No, that’s not right. Zhou Yijin was so arrogant. Even she was rendered helpless a few times in front of Zhou Yijin. Why was Zhou Yijin talking and laughing with someone like Ye Jian?","What was the relationship between Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian?","How did Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian meet?","The difference between them was too big. It was impossible for the two of them to have anything to do with each other. How did they meet?","Du Jiayi didn’t think that Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian were boyfriend and girlfriend at all. She and Madam Li had a strong concept of family status. How could a military family like the Xia family let a military school student enter their family?","It was impossible.","“She’s looking at me again. I regret greeting you in front of her now. If she makes things difficult for you because of me, it’ll be my fault.”","Du Jiayi’s gaze caused Zhou Yijin’s expression to turn a little cold. She was definitely related to Xia Jinyuan by blood. When her face turned cold, Ye Jian could vaguely see Xia Jinyuan’s shadow between her eyebrows. Ye Jian couldn’t help but feel dazed."]},{"number":3811,"title":"Chapter 3811: Chapter 3810 - 3811: Pretend","paragraphs":["Chapter 3811: Pretend","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Yijin’s attention was all on Du Jiayi, who kept looking at her. She didn’t notice anything amiss with Ye Jian. However, Ding Ling could tell that Ye Jian was in a daze. She used her shoulder to gently nudge Ye Jian and whispered, “What’s wrong with you? What’s your connection with the regimental commander’s sister? What does she have to do with you? Why did this girl say that the regimental commander’s sister will deliberately make things difficult for you after she sees the two of you talking to each other?”","Ding Ling, who didn’t know the inside story, was at a loss. She didn’t understand why Zhou Yijin said what she did.","Ye Jian, who was nudged by her, came back to her senses after going into a daze due to Zhou Yijin’s coldness. She replied to Ding Ling calmly, “I know Yijin. Yijin and Du Jiayi seem to have a small misunderstanding. That’s why Yijin is worried that Du Jiayi will hold it against me.”","“I don’t think that’ll happen. No one can be so narrow-minded, right? You don’t have any grudges with the regimental commander’s sister. How could she hold a grudge against you? She’s the regimental commander’s sister, after all. There’s no need to be like that. Don’t think too much. Tell your friend not to think too much either.”","Ding Ling had never seen Du Jiayi’s narrow-mindedness. Hence, she didn’t think that she would bear a grudge.","Ye Jian didn’t explain much. Only Du Jiayi knew if she held any grudges with her. If she really did, there was nothing Ye Jian could do.","At least, in her eyes, she didn’t have any grudges with Du Jiayi.","They only met a few times in total, and she didn’t know where the conflict came from. Now that she thought about it, she found it funny that Du Jiayi hated her for no reason.","The reason why Du Jiayi hated her was because she was one of the few who defied her.","Ye Jian looked at Du Jiayi quietly. One was good at shattering peace, and the other had a clear conscience. When the two of them faced each other, no sparks could be seen. There were only dark fluctuations where their gazes met.","Du Jiayi held the arm of a female soldier with both hands and gritted her teeth secretly. She didn’t understand how a powerless military school student dared to compete with her.","Could it be that... she wasn’t aware of her identity?","This possibility flashed past her mind. Du Jiayi couldn’t help but tighten her grip. She used too much strength. It was so tight that the female soldier who was grabbed by her couldn’t help but gasp softly. It was a little painful.","“I’m sorry, did I scratch you?”","Du Jiayi reacted immediately and apologized gently. Her image outside had always been magnanimous, restrained, and cheerful. Her elegance that was cultivated by Madam Li all year round could indeed make people think that she was such a woman.","Elegant, intellectual, outgoing, magnanimous, and reserved. This was Du Jiayi’s usual image.","Her timely apology made this female soldier, who had only entered the regiment for a year, feel embarrassed. “It doesn’t hurt, it doesn’t hurt. It’s my fault. I didn’t stretch just now. I’ll warm up again.”","Look, Du Jiayi liked this girl’s character so much. She would admit it whether she was right or wrong. Du Jiayi didn’t need to explain herself further. Why did some people have to go against her?","Forget about Zhou Yijin. She came from a good family too, so Du Jiayi could understand her temper. However, why did Ye Jian, who came from a village, dare to go against her?","If she really didn’t know her identity, there was a need to remind her!","Du Jiayi had always been proud of her family background and identity."]},{"number":3812,"title":"Chapter 3812: Chapter 3811 - 3812: Gaining Benefits","paragraphs":["Chapter 3812: Gaining Benefits","Editor: Henyee Translations","Letting go of the female soldier’s arm, Du Jiayi walked toward Ye Jian. Today, she had to introduce herself properly so that Ye Jian wouldn’t think she was all that just because she knew Xia Jinyuan.","No, Ye Jian didn’t just know Xia Jinyuan. She knew Li Jinnian too.","She... was benefiting from two men?","Du Jiayi stopped in her tracks. The smile on her face deepened, and her almond-shaped eyes turned cold.","When she took another step, Du Jiayi’s footsteps became lighter. The way she looked at Ye Jian became more and more hostile.","She kept staring at Ye Jian, making Zhou Yijin misunderstand that Du Jiayi hated Ye Jian because of her.","She wasn’t someone who would suffer losses. It wasn’t that she hadn’t experienced how powerful Du Jiayi was, but she didn’t feel afraid at all. She didn’t in the past, and it was even more impossible for her to feel afraid now.","When she saw Du Jiayi walking over, she blocked Ye Jian behind her and glared at her coldly.","Du Jiayi fell backward in anger.","In the past, when she was in the same team as Zhou Yijin, the latter was the only one who dared to go against her. She thought that Zhou Yijin would mature after not seeing her for a year or two. In the end, she was still the same as before. She hadn’t improved at all.","Facing Zhou Yijin’s cold glare, Du Jiayi smiled elegantly in response.","“She’s pretending again. It’s disgusting,” Zhou Yijin muttered. She looked at the person walking over and whispered to Ye Jian, “She’s coming toward us. Cousin-in-law, don’t talk. Leave it to me. I’ll let her reveal her true colors in a second.”","She protected Ye Jian and spoke softly. Ding Ling, who was standing at the side, didn’t hear what she said. When she saw Du Jiayi walking over, Ding Ling whispered, “Why does it feel like a leader patrolling? Is the regimental commander’s sister the leader of the arts troupe?”","“What leader? She retired a long time ago,” Zhou Yijin replied. Then, she said to Ding Ling, “Can you help us adjust the stage background? The male soldiers don’t really have a good sense of aesthetics.”","This meant that she wanted to send Ding Ling away. Ding Ling looked at Ye Jian and saw Ye Jian nodding slightly at her. Then, she smiled and said, “Okay, you guys can talk first. I’ll come over later.”","Ding Ling, who left, was still at a loss. She didn’t understand what was going on. She just felt that something was amiss.","The moment she left, Zhou Yijin spoke faster to Ye Jian, “Sixth Brother said that we have to take good care of you. Cousin-in-law, don’t worry. With me around, Du Jiayi can’t do anything to you.”","“Such a woman is very hypocritical. She pretends all day long and even calls herself a lady. Others say she’s elegant. I want to laugh when I hear that. Would a real lady act like her? A real lady should be like Sister Wei.","“Hehe, Cousin-in-law, you’re not a lady either. You’re a soldier,” she added.","Du Jiayi didn’t pay much attention to Ding Ling as she had never spoken to her before. When she saw Zhou Yijin talking to Ye Jian so intimately, she quickened her pace and walked over.","Standing in front of Zhou Yijin, Du Jiayi smiled elegantly and said, “Yijin, long time no see. You’re still the same as before. You haven’t changed at all.”","These words didn’t sound wrong, but Zhou Yijin knew Du Jiayi well. Hearing this, she smiled faintly and replied, “I haven’t changed, but you’ve changed a lot. You’re better at pretending, acting, and putting on airs than before.","“Why? Did you regret leaving the regiment? Is that why you came back and pretended to be the leader? Do you wanna teach us?”"]},{"number":3813,"title":"Chapter 3813: Chapter 3812 - 3813: People Like Ye Jian","paragraphs":["Chapter 3813: People Like Ye Jian","Editor: Henyee Translations","As soon as Zhou Yijin opened her mouth, Du Jiayi was so angry that her mouth turned crooked. Ye Jian could clearly see the corner of her mouth twitching. It was obvious that she was having a hard time holding it in.","“Yijin, why is your misunderstanding of me getting deeper? Alas, it’s like what Principal Zhou said when we were having dinner last time. You’re still a child.","“Is Commissioner Ye’s health alright? Last time, I had a meal with my dad and Principal Zhou. I heard from Principal Zhou that Commissioner Ye suddenly fainted some time ago. Our family was shocked when we heard that. Yijin, is Commissioner Ye better now?”","Those who could eat with Zhou Yijin’s parents were not ordinary people. Du Jiayi introduced her parents and told Ye Jian her identity.","Every time she spoke, she would glance at Ye Jian from the corner of her eyes, waiting for Ye Jian to reveal a look of surprise that would satisfy her.","Unfortunately, Ye Jian, who was too calm, didn’t do as she wished. She didn’t even look at Du Jiayi. She was just looking at Zhou Yijin, who was protecting her like a little chick.","Du Jiayi’s heart skipped a beat. It was like a fish bone was stuck in her throat. She felt uncomfortable.","Du Jiayi didn’t know why she cared so much about her background and why she wanted to suppress Ye Jian so badly. Du Jiayi didn’t understand why she had such a mentality in front of Ye Jian.","She didn’t understand why every time she saw Ye Jian, she felt a sense of danger. This sense of danger seemed to tell her that if she didn’t do anything to Ye Jian, she would become the biggest threat to her sooner or later.","In the face of Ye Jian’s calmness, Du Jiayi, who felt a sense of danger, couldn’t help but tighten her hands. She pursed her lips slightly.","Zhou Yijin was smart, but she didn’t expect Du Jiayi to say this because she wanted Ye Jian to know how powerful her family was. Although she didn’t understand what Du Jiayi meant, she could tell that Du Jiayi was showing off.","Hearing this, she pursed her lips and smiled. “Du Jiayi, what are you trying to show off? Are you trying to show off that you’re qualified to eat with my parents or that my parents are qualified to eat with Staff Officer Du?","“That’s enough. Don’t pretend to be magnanimous in front of me. I know what kind of person you are. As for me, I’m sure you know what kind of person I am. Don’t be so polite with me. It’s tiring!","“There’s no place for you in the arts troupe anymore. You don’t have to point fingers at us. Goodbye.”","Every sentence was merciless. It was as if she was taking off Du Jiayi’s beautiful and hypocritical mask and letting people know what kind of person she was.","Du Jiayi was already cold because of Ye Jian’s calmness. A cold look flashed past her eyes. She had already let bygones be bygones, but Zhou Yijin didn’t give her any face.","Taking a deep breath secretly, Du Jiayi tried her best to make her voice sound gentle. “Yijin, is there a need to be so hostile between us? My parents and your parents are friends. As their children, can’t we get along well?","“You can even get along well with someone like Ye Jian. Our families are of equal status, and we can see each other often in the capital city. Why do we have to quarrel whenever we see each other?”","Someone like Ye Jian? Someone like Ye Jian?","Zhou Yijin smiled brightly when she heard this. Her smile lasted for a few seconds before it turned cold. Her gaze was like a cold arrow that shot over. Du Jiayi had a bad feeling."]},{"number":3814,"title":"Chapter 3814: Chapter 3813 - 3814: What A Trick","paragraphs":["Chapter 3814: What A Trick","Editor: Henyee Translations","Du Jiayi had a bad feeling. She wanted to stop Zhou Yijin from speaking, but it was too late.","Facing someone she didn’t like, Zhou Yijin said with a faint smile, “Du Jiayi, your arrogance is an eye-opener for me. How did you become like this? Don’t you feel like a clown? You keep making a fool of yourself in front of people who know you. Du Jiayi, I don’t even know if you’re really smart or just pretending to be smart.","“Take care of yourself, Miss Du Jiayi...” As she spoke, Zhou Yijin held Ye Jian’s arm. “This is my guest. She represents me. You’d better watch your mouth. If not, you’ll regret it one day.”","Du Jiayi was furious, but she had to maintain her status in front of Ye Jian. Also, there was the arts troupe behind her. She cared about her image, so even though she was furious, she maintained a smile on her face. “Yijin, she doesn’t belong to the same world as you. Let me remind you too. People are evil. Be careful not to be used.","“Alright, since you don’t like it when I say these things, I won’t say anything else. I’ll be staying at my brother’s place for the next few days. If you have the time, you can come and play with me. Goodbye, Yijin.”","She raised her chin slightly and nodded. Finally, she left elegantly in her high heels.","The temperature in Nanguang was high. Du Jiayi was wearing a camel-colored cashmere coat with loose dark brown straight pants and a pair of delicate high heels. She looked tall and elegant. When she turned... Ye Jian felt that Du Jiayi was breathtaking.","Du Jiayi, who had turned around, didn’t look as elegant as her back view. The smile on her face turned cold in an instant, revealing a sharp ruthlessness. In order not to let anyone see how bad her expression was this time, she walked past the stage and walked down.","The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion and a few male soldiers were setting up the stage. When he noticed Du Jiayi walking down the stage, he handed the streamers to the soldiers and jumped down.","He had promised the regimental commander that he would take care of his sister. He needed to make good on his word.","Zhou Yijin had already followed Ye Jian to the side to speak. “Cousin-in-law, are you going to study in a company? I thought I heard wrong when that lieutenant shouted your name just now. I didn’t expect it to be you.","“That’s good. When I go back, I can tell the old master and the old madam that I met you here. Originally, our team went to another place. I don’t know why we were transferred here at the last minute. Hehe, Cousin-in-law, you’re really fated with our family. We can still meet even in this situation.”","Without Du Jiayi around, Zhou Yijin was indeed like a child just like what her father said. She was only a little childish in front of her family. In front of outsiders like Du Jiayi, her aura was as cold as Xia Jinyuan’s aura.","Ye Jian smiled as she looked at Zhou Yijin, who had protected her. She reached out her hand and tidied her collar. Smiling, she said, “I’ll be studying here for the entire winter vacation. I can’t go back until school starts.","“What about you? When are you going back? Will there be a holiday? Will you go back to the capital city to visit the old master and the old madam?”","Not wanting the two of them to talk about Du Jiayi, Ye Jian naturally changed the topic to Zhou Yijin’s family. Zhou Yijin raised her neck slightly and smiled. “There’s no holiday this year. After the performance here, we still have to go to Yun Province. We can’t rest until the Lantern Festival.”","This time of the year was the busiest time for the arts troupe. They would bring exciting performances to the soldiers who were guarding the border defense."]},{"number":3815,"title":"Chapter 3815: Chapter 3814 - 3815: Is She Easy To Bully?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3815: Is She Easy To Bully?","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Yijin was also concerned about her family. When she saw that Ye Jian was like her, she revealed her plans. “There’ll be around 20 days of vacation. I’ll go back to the old residence to visit the old master and the old madam. I can even go to Dangui Garden to visit the old master.","“Cousin-in-law, let’s take a photo together later. I’ll edit the photo and show it to the old madam. What do you think?”","Ye Jian had no objections. Zhou Yijin was very happy when taking out her camera and asking her comrades to help them take a photo. Du Jiayi’s gaze turned colder as she looked at the two of them taking a photo happily.","What scheme did Ye Jian use to make Zhou Yijin so intimate with her? They were so intimate that they were no different from sisters.","If she hadn’t investigated Ye Jian secretly a few years ago and found out that she was born in a small village and had a martyr for a mother, she would’ve thought that Ye Jian was Zhou Yijin’s sister. Ye Jian was just a wild girl who grew up in the countryside!","Ha, she was looking forward to the day when Zhou Yijin realized that Ye Jian was just currying favor with Li Jinnian. Ha, she would definitely regret not listening to her advice!","The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion didn’t want to accompany Du Jiayi. When he walked over, although the other party didn’t show any obvious resistance, he could see the impatience in her eyes.","Hence, he asked the soldiers to send Du Jiayi back to the residence. As for him, he didn’t fall in love with her like the political commissars hoped he would on such a good day today.","Du Jiayi, who was so angry her stomach hurt, thanked the battalion commander politely and left the auditorium in her high heels.","When Zhou Yijin saw her leaving, she pursed her lips slightly and whispered to Ye Jian, “Cousin-in-law, be careful when you see this woman in the future. She’s two-sided. She’ll smile at you when she’s facing you, but when she turns around, you won’t know what kind of expressions she’ll have on her face.","“She kept staring at you just now. I think I implicated you. Cousin-in-law, I’m sorry. I shouldn’t have greeted you in front of her.”","Zhou Yijin was actually two and a half years older than Ye Jian. However, she didn’t feel any pressure when she addressed Ye Jian formally. She spoke smoothly and didn’t feel that she was younger than Ye Jian at all. It was quite natural for her to call Ye Jian ‘Cousin-in-law’.","Xia Jinyuan had reminded her that she needed to protect Ye Jian. Zhou Yijin remembered it in her heart and didn’t dare to forget it. She even thought that she had the responsibility to protect her cousin-in-law.","Du Jiayi’s appearance made Zhou Yijin feel unhappy. That was why she kept Ye Jian behind her and used her actions to tell Du Jiayi that she would protect Ye Jian. She wanted to see who dared to be impudent.","Also, Zhou Yijin didn’t know about Ye Jian’s secret identity. When Xia Jinyuan said that, she thought that Ye Jian was just an ordinary military school student. She was worried that Ye Jian would be bullied when she met someone like Du Jiayi.","Ye Jian was touched and amused by Ye Jian’s protection.","She didn’t know what Captain Xia said to his relatives, but she could feel that all the Xia youngsters thought that she was easy to bully.","Was she easy to bully?","Did she have the word ‘honest’ written on her face?","No!","It was all because Xia Jinyuan sent a hundred-word message to all his relatives before he carried out his mission. He said that he wouldn’t be able to contact the outside world for a long time after returning to the military unit. Now that Ye Jian was his girlfriend and his future wife, he needed his relatives to take good care of her... The message was more than a hundred words. When Zhou Yijin received the message, she took it as her responsibility."]},{"number":3816,"title":"Chapter 3816: Chapter 3815 - 3816: Happily","paragraphs":["Chapter 3816: Happily","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian, who received Zhou Yijin’s concern, smiled and said, “She didn’t glare at me because of you. I got to know her a long time ago, and we have some grudges between us. I didn’t take any of that to heart, but she still remembers it all until now.","“It’s probably because she didn’t manage to vent her anger at that time. She must have been feeling frustrated. I think she had always wanted to find an opportunity to vent her anger. However, I didn’t give her a chance to do so, and she didn’t want to leave an unreasonable impression on others. That’s why she doesn’t like me. It has nothing to do with you.”","Ye Jian didn’t want to see Zhou Yijin blame herself. Hence, she took the initiative to say that she and Du Jiayi had grudges between them. She said, “Your cousin knows about it too. He reminded me to be careful of Du Jiayi. He even told me about her past. Don’t worry, Yijin, I know everything.”","“Sixth Cousin-in-law, you didn’t make up this story to comfort me, right? You... really have a grudge against her? Where did this grudge come from?”","Zhou Yijin didn’t believe it.","“It’s true. I have no reason to lie to you. We’ve met a couple of times.”","“Alright, I believe you. Sixth Cousin-in-law, if you meet Du Jiayi in the future, don’t cower. Just retort back at her like me. That’s the only way she’ll know that we’re not easy to bully.","“You’re my cousin-in-law. Besides me and the rest, you also have the support of Old Master and Uncle Fu. The most direct way to let her know that we’re not easy to offend is to use our identity to suppress her.”","Zhou Yijin’s words were very skillful. She was saying that Ye Jian was different from the past, and she didn’t make Ye Jian feel uncomfortable because of her reminder.","In the past, Ye Jian didn’t have anyone to rely on. That was why Ye Zhifan and his family bullied her so much. Now, it was different. She had many supporters and loved ones behind her. If she met anyone who made things difficult for her, she wouldn’t have to face them alone anymore. People would stand up for her.","That was what Zhou Yijin meant.","Ye Jian felt warmth in her heart. She hugged Zhou Yijin, who treated her so well. “Hurry up and rehearse. I’ll hang the stage lights and ribbons with the others. I’ll wait for your exciting performance tomorrow night.”","Ye Jian pushed Zhou Yijin gently. Her smile was bright and beautiful like the blooming flowers in March. In the blink of an eye, she displayed the playfulness of a flower in summer. It was an extremely pleasant sight to behold. Her low and gentle voice had an indestructible toughness. “Look at how she needed to calm down. I bet she can tell that I’m not easy to bully.”","That was true. Only then did Zhou Yijin feel at ease. She hugged Ye Jian back and smiled. “Sixth Cousin-in-law, let’s meet again tonight. I’ll send you the message my cousin sent to all of us. It’s very touching! Only then did I know that he’s so good at doting on girls. Sixth Cousin-in-law, you’ll get to have your happily ever after.”","There was no woman who didn’t want her boyfriend to dote on her. When Zhou Yijin read Xia Jinyuan’s message, she felt a little envious.","Ye Jian didn’t know about that. Hearing that, her heart trembled slightly.","Her Captain Xia had done many things for her secretly without her knowing. From the age of 16 to the age of 21, he took care of her meticulously for seven years.","She was really happy to have him. In this world, only he could give her happiness."]},{"number":3817,"title":"Chapter 3817: Chapter 3816 - 3817: Frightening","paragraphs":["Chapter 3817: Frightening","Editor: Henyee Translations","The last time she spoke to Jiaxin, she said that she hadn’t seen Wu Yue for ten months and nine days. Her roommates were all secretly guessing if she had fallen out of love. Even Jiaxin herself nearly thought that she had fallen out of love. She even asked Ye Jian if she and Captain Xia often experienced this. Did they feel wronged? Did they feel tired? Did they feel like they had been abandoned?","At that time, Ye Jian only replied with one word, “No.” She had never felt that she had fallen out of love or been abandoned. She had never felt wronged or tired. She had never felt that way.","Even though there was no news of him, she could always feel his meticulous concern. They had not seen each other for 11 months and 16 days, but she never felt that he had left her for a long time.","It was as if their separation happened yesterday. She could still feel the warmth between her fingers from when she last touched his handsome face. It was warm. It was always warm even without him by her side.","Hence, she knew that her happiness would last. As long as he was still around, she would be happy enough!","She nodded heavily and promised Zhou Yijin that they would meet tonight no matter how late it was.","Zhou Yijin, who was smiling, immersed herself in her work. Ye Jian and the rest decorated the entire auditorium in a festive manner.","As for the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion, he didn’t experience the sparks of love that the political commissars hoped for. After asking the soldiers to send Du Jiayi back to her building, he didn’t even enter the company auditorium and went for training.","The company commander took the lead and ran for ten kilometers.","After the evening training ended, the company commander sighed and said to Ye Jian, “The battalion commander’s marriage is a huge problem that our entire battalion needs to solve urgently. If you have any ladies to introduce to him, you can be a matchmaker. I was chased around by a drug-detection dog for ten kilometers today and almost collapsed.”","Ye Jian’s company had always cooperated with the border defense armed police officers. The People’s Liberation Army faced the outside world while the armed police faced the inside. The two companies were not very distant from one another. Sometimes, they would even have basketball competitions. The drug-detection dog that had chased the company commander hadn’t been trained, so the battalion commander had already shown mercy on account of their many years of relationship.","Otherwise, if a fully-trained drug-detection dog had been released, the company commander would not have merely collapsed from being chased. He would have been knocked down and bitten until he was half dead.","Ye Jian’s heart trembled when she heard this. She would rather be chased by a human than a drug-detection dog that knew human nature all too well.","“I was just telling the political commissars that if things really don’t work out, they should introduce the regimental commander’s sister to the battalion commander. The political commissars didn’t say anything about that. I wonder if they need to consider how to mention it to the regimental commander.”","Ye Jian, who was walking properly, tripped. The company commander said, “Be careful.” Ye Jian replied, “I’m fine.” She only tripped because she was shocked by the company commander’s words.","Introduce... Du Jiayi to the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion? Heck no!","After pondering for a moment, Ye Jian said gently, “The regimental commander’s sister should have a boyfriend, right? Also, the regimental commander seems to be from the capital city. The battalion commander is from Nanguang. Their customs are different, and their food preferences are different too. It won’t be easy for them to get along.”","...","“What you said makes sense. Marriage isn’t just about two people. It involves their two families too. However...” The company commander took off his training cap and wiped the hot sweat off his forehead. Nodding thoughtfully, he said, “I don’t think he’s worthy. The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion is more compatible with a sincere and down-to-earth woman. The regimental commander’s younger sister... is too much of a princess. That won’t work.”","Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief. The thought of introducing Du Jiayi to the battalion commander... was really scary!"]},{"number":3818,"title":"Chapter 3818: Chapter 3817 - 3818: The Longer You Live The More Miserable You Become","paragraphs":["Chapter 3818: The Longer You Live The More Miserable You Become","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian, whose heart rate was still a little messed up, heaved a sigh of relief. She naturally communicated with the company commander and asked, “Company Commander, you only told this to the political commissars. You didn’t tell anyone else, right?”","“Hahaha, no, no. When I saw the political commissars’ expressions turning dark, I knew I had to stop joking around. Now, I can tell that the political commissars didn’t answer me at that time not because they were considering it but because they wanted to teach me a lesson.”","Perhaps he understood what Ye Jian meant, so the company commander couldn’t help but laugh. “Alright, we’ll settle the marriage of the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion somehow. Go back and rest.”","“I still have to meet my friends. I’ll return to the dormitory on time before the bell rings.”","“Are you meeting the female soldier from the troupe? Hurry up and go. There’s still half an hour before the bell rings. Make sure to come back before then. If not, there won’t be any hot water.” The company commander waved his hand. He used his cap to fan his sweaty forehead as he strode away.","Under the lamppost in front, Du Jiayi had heard the conversation between Ye Jian and the company commander clearly. With her phone in her hand,s he ended the call with her friend. The screen of the phone flashed with blue light before disappearing.","“Ye Jian, your methods are really impressive. I want to learn a few moves from you.” When Ye Jian was about to walk closer, Du Jiayi walked out from the shadows of the lamppost. There was a cold smile in her eyes as she looked at Ye Jian disdainfully. “Your methods of climbing up the ladder have become your strongest ability. You’re really impressive.","“The last time I saw you, you weren’t with Xia Jinyuan. You were with Li Jinnian. How did you coax him to accompany you to the hospital? Ye Jian, how are you so capable?”","Du Jiayi, who was standing under the lamppost, revealed an arrogance that she didn’t show during the day. Even her posture was a little arrogant.","At this moment, she was being her real self.","During the day, she put up appearances as she shuttled through the crowd every day. People mistook her for an elegant, intellectual, outgoing, and magnanimous noblewoman.","No matter who she met, she would be able to switch between the day and night. No one would be able to see any flaws.","Facing Du Jiayi’s sarcasm, Ye Jian’s reaction was as normal as usual.","“Miss Du, your judgment of me is prejudiced. I don’t have any tricks up my sleeve, and I don’t have the capability that you mentioned. I feel ashamed of myself as compared to you.”","She replied calmly. She wasn’t angered by the other party’s words.","If she was really angry, that would be what Du Jiayi wanted.","Her calmness made the coldness in Du Jiayi’s eyes sharpen. “You two sure are cousins. You have the same eloquence and the same underhanded methods. You both want to marry into a wealthy family by relying on your good looks. Ye Jian, you and Ye Ying disgust me.”","It made her want to never see them again!","“It takes one to know one. Your appearance makes me feel disgusted too.” Ye Jian didn’t choose to say any more. She would simply retort with the words she was given. How good was that? There was no need to think about it.","“Don’t be smug for too long. Xia Jinyuan isn’t so easy to fool. If he knows that you hooked up with Li Jinnian, do you think he’ll let you off just because you’re a woman? Heh, he’ll let you climb as high as you can so that you’ll fall as hard as you can!","“You want to barge into a world that you shouldn’t and even dream of staying... Since you saved me once, I’ll remind you out of goodwill. There’s only one outcome for you if you barge into our world. The longer you live, the worse it’ll be!”"]},{"number":3819,"title":"Chapter 3819: Chapter 3818 - 3819: Good Man","paragraphs":["Chapter 3819: Good Man","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian narrowed her eyes. Under the light, her narrowed eyes were curved like a little fox’s eyes. They were full of energy and slyness. “What does your world have to do with me? What does it have to do with you that I know Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian?","“Since I saved you before, Miss Du, let me remind you out of goodwill. The two of us should walk our own paths and not interfere with each other too much.","“Also, if I remember correctly, isn’t Cousin Li Jinnian your cousin too? Why don’t you respect him at all?”","...","What?!","Cousin Li?","She was shameless enough to acknowledge Li Jinnian as her cousin?","Du Jiayi was really shocked. She didn’t expect Ye Jian to call Li Jinnian, who was as cold as a cold-blooded animal, Cousin.","And Li Jinnian agreed?","Ye Jian saw that she was in a daze and smiled slightly. She walked past her...","“Ye Jian, you’ve really broadened my horizons.” Du Jiayi’s sneer came from behind. “Cousin Li? I really have to congratulate you. The day of your downfall is nearing. Li Jinnian is my cousin, but my grandfather doesn’t like him. Our entire family doesn’t like him. So, what’s the use of getting close to him?”","Cousin Li?","Hahaha, hahaha... Didn’t Ye Jian know that Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian’s relationship was very ordinary? Hahaha, Cousin Li. She really wanted to know what Xia Jinyuan’s expression would be when he found out.","She could tell Zhou Yijin tomorrow. As Xia Jinyuan’s cousin, how would Zhou Yijin treat Ye Jian when she found out tomorrow?","Du Jiayi was looking forward to it.","Du Jiayi was different from Ye Ying. Ye Ying was blind and arrogant. She didn’t have many tricks up her sleeve, but she thought that she was capable. She also struggled keeping her temper in check.","As for Du Jiayi, she wasn’t blindly arrogant. She knew her abilities and methods. When she dealt with things, she knew how to make use of everything. She could control her temper and was good at dealing with people she didn’t like.","Ye Jian had never let down her guard against Du Jiayi.","Her sneer made Ye Jian smile even more. It was alright. Captain Xia already knew about this.","Ye Jian rushed to the auditorium to meet Zhou Yijin with light footsteps.","When she went over, Zhou Yijin and the other female soldiers from the art troupe were still rehearsing. Ye Jian sat below the stage and watched quietly until the end.","At around 9:30 pm, the day’s rehearsal ended. Ye Jian finally saw Xia Jinyuan’s message to Zhou Yijin.","“I’m not the only one who received it. We all got it. Sixth Cousin is so thoughtful. In the past, Sixth Cousin wasn’t so thoughtful. He only changed after meeting you.","“Old Master and Old Madam always say that you and Sixth Cousin are a match made in heaven. Every item has its vanquisher. You’ve made my cousin restrain his roguish aura a little.","“Sixth Cousin-in-law, do you think I can find a boyfriend like Sixth Cousin? I think it’s very difficult. There are too few good men. Sixth Cousin-in-law... Sixth Cousin-in-law...”","Ye Jian stared at the message word by word, not hearing any of Zhou Yijin’s words.","All her thoughts were focused on the message.","Gradually, her vision turned blurry, and the tears in her eyes got heavier.","Tears welled up in her eyes. She wanted them to go away."]},{"number":3820,"title":"Chapter 3820: Chapter 3819 - 3820: The Affectionate Captain Xia","paragraphs":["Chapter 3820: The Affectionate Captain Xia","Editor: Henyee Translations","The message was very long. It took three texts to send everything. Ye Jian’s vision was already blurry as she read Xia Jinyuan’s message to his relatives again.","[I’m worried because I won’t be able to stay by her side for too long. Hence, I hope that my relatives can take care of her. I hope that you can treat her as your real family member and dote on and protect her. Your Little Six will be extremely grateful.","[I feel sorry for going away so often. I’m worried that I’ll make things difficult for her, so I’ve always wanted to make it up to her. I hope that my relatives can understand my painstaking efforts and take care of Ye Jian for me.","[My girlfriend, Ye Jian, was born into all kinds of hardships. I once promised her a happy and stable life. Sometimes, when I’m not by her side, I’ll worry that she won’t be able to take action in time when she’s in trouble. I can only beg my family to help me take care of her and prevent her from suffering, which is why I’m writing this. —Little Six.]","Coupled with the punctuation, there were a total of 173 words. Every word was filled with his silent concern for her. Every word revealed his deep love for her. The 173 words were filled with affection. Ye Jian, who was holding her cell phone, started crying unknowingly.","Her Captain Xia... never said any words of love in front of her. He didn’t even make any solemn vows. He never said anything and only acted secretly.","Her tears accidentally dripped onto the phone screen. As the tears came streaming down, Zhou Yijin shut her mouth silently.","She wanted Ye Jian to see the message. She wanted Ye Jian to know how good her sixth cousin was.","The last time Sister Wei chatted with her parents, her father suddenly said, “Little Six hasn’t contacted Little Ye for months. Will it affect their relationship?","“To young people, one day apart feels like three years. It’s normal for them to quarrel and break up. I’m a little worried about Little Six.”","Sister Wei had said that she was a little worried too. She even said that all women wanted their boyfriends to accompany them more. For instance, she was almost 40 years old, but she still hoped that Hou Zi could accompany her more.","But Sixth Cousin simply wasn’t in a position to regularly accompany Sixth Cousin-in-law. If one day, Sixth Cousin-in-law really couldn’t persevere, what should her cousin do?","Zhou Yijin remembered the conversation between Xia Yiwei, Aunt Xia, and Uncle Xia. From that day on, she resolved to show the message to Ye Jian so that she would know how much Xia Jinyuan loved her.","In this world, Ye Jian would never be able to find a man who loved her as deeply as Sixth Cousin. She would never be able to find another one like him again!","“Sixth Cousin-in-law, Sixth Cousin has his own difficulties. I’m showing you the message because of my selfishness. I hope that you can understand Sixth Cousin’s situation. Although he can’t accompany you, his heart has always been with you.","“When Eldest Cousin received the message, he even sent it to all of us. He said that he didn’t expect Little Six, who was the best among his brothers, to become the most infatuated man.","“Sixth Cousin-in-law, I know that Cousin hasn’t contacted you for almost a year. Please persevere. I believe that Sixth Cousin, who can’t contact you right now, must be thinking about you at this moment. As long as he comes back, he’ll definitely contact you immediately and accompany you properly. He won’t leave your side for 24 hours after he comes back.”","Zhou Yijin spoke softly. At this moment, she seemed as soft and delicate as cotton, making people feel warm and comfortable.","Ye Jian used her fingers to wipe away her tears on the phone screen. She forwarded the message to her phone.","How could she blame him?","Captain Xia was the man who loved her deeply. How could she bear to blame him?","Captain Xia was such a good person. Captain Xia was the only one who was willing to be with her for the rest of his life. How could she give up on him? How could she not persevere?"]},{"number":3821,"title":"Chapter 3821: Chapter 3820 - 3821: This Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 3821: This Life","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Yijin saw her sixth cousin-in-law’s tears dripping down like crystals. She wasn’t crying out and just kept silent. Zhou Yijin’s eyes started to tear up as well.","She felt that the relationship between Sixth Cousin-in-law and Sixth Cousin was indescribable. It made her deeply envious of the two of them. She felt that even though they had not seen each other for a year, their relationship didn’t fade because of the distance. Instead, it was like an old wine that got more mellow the more it was brewed. It was so mellow that there were no impurities.","This kind of love... made her very, very envious.","As it turned out, there was such pure love in this world. From the start to the end, the two of them had never had any misunderstandings. They didn’t quarrel because of each other’s interference and didn’t feel wronged because the other party couldn’t understand them.","Sixth Cousin-in-law and Sixth Cousin had always been harmonious. During their limited time together, they would make use of the time to love each other and make up for the regrets.","They wouldn’t quarrel or misunderstand each other because of other people. They wouldn’t slowly erase their relationship because of this.","She still remembered that Fifth Cousin had once asked Sixth Cousin how their relationship was. Both of them were so outstanding and had many admirers. How should they deal with that problem? If the other party knew about it, would there be a misunderstanding? Would they quarrel? Would they make each other unhappy?","Sixth Cousin didn’t even think about it before answering with a smile, “I don’t even spend enough time with Ye Jian. How can I quarrel with her because of other people and make her unhappy?","“We’ll only make the best use of our time to love each other. Every time we meet, we’ll only love each other more. We just want to treat each other better. A prodigal lover like you won’t know that love is stronger than gold and that love is better than wings.","“Ye Jian and I will only love each other deeply during our interactions. So what if we have admirers? What do they have to do with us? The person we love loves us deeply too. Misunderstandings and arguments won’t exist between us. We don’t even want to waste our time on such things.”","Fifth Cousin was flabbergasted when he heard that. He didn’t say anything for a long time.","Even though Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan were a loving couple, before they got married, it was normal to assume there would always be people interfering with them. There would be misunderstandings and arguments. They might even break up.","There was no need to mention Sister Wei and Brother-in-law Zi. The two of them had broken up many times. One moment, they said that the other party was immature. The next moment, they said that the other party didn’t understand them. Their dating life was like sitting on a small boat sailing on the sea. When the wind and waves blew, the small boat would flip and they would break up.","When the weather was good, the two of them would flip the small boat over again. They would get onto the boat and continue dating. To be honest, after listening to Sister Wei and Brother-in-law Zi’s love life, there was only one thing that came to mind—exhausting!","Sister Wei spent half her life in a relationship, and in the end, she still got together with Hou Zi and gave birth to twins. It was a miracle.","However, when Zhou Yijin heard about Sixth Cousin and Sixth Sister-in-law’s love history, especially after hearing what Sixth Cousin said to Fifth Cousin, she was extremely shocked.","At that time, she hadn’t met her sixth sister-in-law. However, she was already looking forward to meeting her sixth sister-in-law whom she had never met before.","When she saw her on the first day of the lunar month, it was not only her eyes that lit up. The entire family’s eyes had lit up as well. As it turned out, there was such a beautiful woman in this world. Fifth Cousin even wondered if he was blind to have found so many ordinary girlfriends in the past."]},{"number":3822,"title":"Chapter 3822: Chapter 3821 - 3822: The Best Love","paragraphs":["Chapter 3822: The Best Love","Editor: Henyee Translations","Today, Zhou Yijin finally knew that Sixth Cousin’s beloved woman loved him deeply too.","As it turned out, being in love with each other could be so shocking. Even if they didn’t spend every day together, didn’t sweet-talk each other, and didn’t make promises, as long as their hearts were together and they liked each other, they would still be in love no matter how far away they were.","This kind of love made her envious and touched at the same time.","“Sixth Cousin-in-law, why do you love Sixth Cousin so much? You haven’t seen him for almost a year. You haven’t even called him. There’s no news of him at all. Why are you still able to persevere? Why are you still able to walk forward without any hesitation?”","Zhou Yijin sounded sincere when she asked Ye Jian. It was as if she wanted to seek confirmation from Ye Jian so that she would have the courage to believe in love.","Her question made Ye Jian look up. A smile slowly bloomed on her tear-stained face. It was dazzling. She smiled and said, “Your sixth cousin has always been my source of light. Without my source of light, my hope in this life will disappear.","“Yijin, I won’t give up on him. I won’t blame him either. You said that his heart has always been with me. I’ve always known that. Your cousin is such a good person, and I was lucky enough to meet him. How can I bear to let him go? I must hold him tightly in my hand and keep him by my side.”","Ye Jian spoke gently. She looked at Zhou Yijin with dark eyes that were shining with the most beautiful and dazzling rays. They were as dazzling as the sun. Zhou Yijin was attracted by the colors in her eyes. She even had the illusion that the person her sixth cousin-in-law loved was her.","Actually, Ye Jian was just picturing Xia Jinyuan in her mind.","As a woman, Zhou Yijin’s heart trembled when she saw how bright and beautiful her cousin-in-law was.","When was a woman the most beautiful?","Zhou Yijin thought that a woman would be the most beautiful when she missed and believed in her lover.","A warm smile, a gentle voice, a loving gaze, and an affectionate gaze... Everything matched Sixth Cousin-in-law’s current appearance. She was so beautiful that it was frightening and suffocating.","Zhou Yijin was stunned by Ye Jian’s words.","Sixth Cousin-in-law was beautiful because of love. The beauty in her eyes wasn’t just stunning. It had become imprinted in her heart. Zhou Yijin would be stunned by that for the rest of her life.","She would not be able to meet a woman more beautiful than her sixth cousin-in-law in the future. She would not be shocked by her sixth cousin-in-law anymore.","Ye Jian didn’t know what Zhou Yijin was thinking and spoke slowly. She seemed to have seen the man she loved the most standing beside her and looking at her gently.","It looked like Ye Jian had been talking to Zhou Yijin, but in fact, she was just talking to Xia Jinyuan through Zhou Yijin’s figure.","The night wasn’t deep. The clear sky was dotted with cold stars. There was also a crescent moon shining down. The moonlight and starlight landed in Ye Jian’s eyes, making Zhou Yijin even more stunned.","“Why do I love your sixth cousin deeply? Because he loves me deeply. He’s given me so much and loves me so much. How can I not love him so deeply?","“So what if we haven’t seen each other for almost a year? He might not be by my side, but his heart has always been with me. Your sixth cousin has handed over the most important and beautiful things in his life to me. What reason do I have to give up?","“I won’t hesitate. Similarly, your sixth cousin won’t hesitate either. He said that we’ll grow old together. I yearn for a gentleman’s promise. In this life, with your sixth cousin around, I won’t develop feelings for anyone else. I won’t be able to see anyone else in the same light.”"]},{"number":3823,"title":"Chapter 3823: Chapter 3822 - 3823: The Best Version Of Them","paragraphs":["Chapter 3823: The Best Version Of Them","Editor: Henyee Translations","In the winter, the wind in Nanguang was a little cold. It was cold on her face, but Ye Jian’s heart was as warm as the sun. Her soft voice was filled with passion, and Zhou Yijin fell deeper into it.","“I met the best version of him and received his best love. Yijin, your sixth cousin and I got the best of each other and will continue walking this path hand-in-hand. I believe that you’ll meet someone one day and get the best love. You’ll spend the rest of your life together with that man.","“One day, when you meet the best man and have the best love, you’ll understand why your sixth cousin and I don’t ever feel a distance in our hearts despite being so far apart.”","After Ye Jian finished speaking, the tears on her face had dried up. Her eyes were as bright as water, without a trace of gloominess.","She didn’t feel aggrieved because of separation and didn’t feel lost because of the distance. That was because her love with Captain Xia wasn’t something that other people could understand or see through.","Love did bring people’s hearts closer. However, they still had a common belief, a common goal, and a common responsibility. It was these things that allowed the two of them to get closer and love each other more deeply.","Captain Xia had once said, “As a soldier, I’m loyal to my country. As a man, I’m loyal to my woman.” Now, she could tell Captain Xia, “As a soldier, I’m loyal to my country. As a woman, I’m loyal to my man.”","They were loyal to their country; they were loyal to each other. This was the love between her and Captain Xia. It couldn’t be replicated.","Yijin would meet the best man for her and get the best love from him. That would be Yijin’s own love. It couldn’t be replicated either.","Everyone would have their own love, and their love couldn’t be replicated. That was how the romance of the world could be.","While she and Captain Xia were loyal to love, they would carry their guns and protect the country’s peace.","Zhou Yijin’s heart was palpitating. She looked into Ye Jian’s eyes that were as vast as the stars. She couldn’t extricate herself from them.","As it turned out... this was the love between Sixth Cousin and Sixth Cousin-in-law. It was so beautiful that her heart palpitated for a long time.","She met the best person and got the best love. They would spend the rest of their lives with the best person for them...","After returning to the dormitory, Zhou Yijin lay on the bed quietly. She kept recalling the scenes just now. Her heart was still palpitating because of Ye Jian’s words.","It was Sixth Cousin’s ‘luck’ to be able to find Sixth Cousin-in-law. As for Sixth Cousin-in-law, it was her ‘blessing’ to have found Sixth Cousin. The two of them would be happily together.","Zhou Yijin, who was lying flat on the bed, finally closed her eyes with a deep smile on her face.","She started to believe in love again after seeing the love between Sixth Cousin and Sixth Cousin-in-law.","She wanted to find a man she liked and have a love that she liked. She hoped that just like what her sixth cousin-in-law said, she would meet the best man for her one day and have the best love.","She would wait for this day to come.","It was late at night. Zhou Yijin, who was shocked by Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian’s love, smiled and fell asleep sweetly.","After returning to the dormitory, Ye Jian didn’t sleep. She covered herself with the blanket and kept looking at the message on her cell phone screen. As she looked at it, she smiled again. The next time she looked at it, she started crying. The third time... Ye Jian stuck the screen of the cell phone to her lips, closed her eyes, and planted a deep kiss."]},{"number":3824,"title":"Chapter 3824: Chapter 3823 - 3824: Cousin Is Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 3824: Cousin Is Here","Editor: Henyee Translations","The kiss that landed on the phone screen seemed to allow her to feel as though she was kissing the man she loved deeply. Her lips didn’t leave the phone screen for a long time.","In the end, Ye Jian fell asleep with her cell phone in hand. She didn’t even know when she fell asleep. She only knew that the next day, when she woke up, Ding Ling pointed at her eyes and reminded her vaguely, “Your eyes are a little swollen. You didn’t sleep well, right? I’ll get a cold towel for you to press it on your eyes.”","Ye Jian cried too much last night. Her eyes were swollen from crying.","Ding Ling didn’t ask Ye Jian why her eyes were swollen. She knew that it was the result of crying at night.","As it turned out... the omnipotent Ye Jian would cry when she was sad too. Ding Ling looked at Ye Jian, who was applying the cold press to her eyes and thought to herself. She just didn’t know why Ye Jian had cried.","Ye Jian naturally wouldn’t tell Ding Ling why she was crying. She rarely mentioned her personal matters to her close friend, An Jiaxin. She wouldn’t mention them to Ding Ling.","But!","When she saw her cousin staring coldly at her swollen eyes, Ye Jian, who was under tremendous pressure, took the initiative and told Li Jinnian the details obediently before he could ask.","It couldn’t be helped. Her cousin’s gaze was as sharp as a blade. The pressure was too great. If she didn’t tell him the truth, she might not be able to get away from it.","Li Jinnian thought that his cousin had suffered in this place. Who knew that... it was because she was so touched by Xia Jinyuan’s hundred-word message? That was enough to make her cry all night.","“One... message made you cry for a long time? When did you become so sentimental?” Li Jinnian, who didn’t know anything, felt that it was... unbelievable.","What kind of message made his strong cousin cry for a long time?","He couldn’t understand it at all!","Ye Jian thought for a moment and passed the phone to her cousin who didn’t know anything. “Captain Xia sent this message to all his family members. I didn’t know about it until last night. So... I was touched.”","Last night, her emotions came suddenly. She was touched by the care and concern in the message. Her tears flowed out uncontrollably. She even cried in front of... Zhou Yijin.","Ye Jian felt embarrassed when she thought about it. Now that she was talking about it, her fair cheeks were slightly red. She felt a little embarrassed.","Li Jinnian didn’t plan to look at the cell phone at first. But for some reason, he ended up taking it.","Hence, Ye Jian was stunned.","She thought that her cousin, who wasn’t interested in these things, wouldn’t look at her phone!","In the end... he really took her cell phone and looked at it.","Li Jinnian took the cell phone and saw the shock in Ye Jian’s eyes. Raising the cell phone, he teased, “Why? You don’t want to show it to me? Were you testing me?”","“No, no...” Ye Jian shook her head. She was afraid that Li Jinnian would notice something. She nodded heavily. “It’s nothing. You can go ahead and take a look.”","“But Cousin, you’re not allowed to laugh after you read it.”","“Am I a person who laughs a lot?” Li Jinnian opened the locked screen of the cell phone. His slender fingers moved across the buttons and he quickly entered the message box. Then, he saw the tree texts.","He looked at the number displayed. It was unfamiliar. It wasn’t Xia Jinyuan’s phone number.","“It’s Zhou Yijin’s phone number. She’s Aunt Xia’s daughter... The message is a little long. There are three texts,” Ye Jian reminded him softly.","One message was split into three texts. There were too many words. Li Jinnian started from the first text."]},{"number":3825,"title":"Chapter 3825: Chapter 3824 - 3825: Humble Guidance","paragraphs":["Chapter 3825: Humble Guidance","Editor: Henyee Translations","How did Xia Jinyuan court his cousin?","He needed to learn from him.","One message was enough to make his cousin, who wasn’t a crier, cry until her eyes were swollen the next day. This message might be able to let him see some clues.","Li Jinnian opened the message and read it carefully.","Ye Jian stood quietly and waited for him to finish reading.","There was a hint of relaxation in his cold expression. Ye Jian, who was also meticulous, seemed to have understood something in an instant.","His cousin was like an unattainable mountain... Could it be that he had the intention to fall in love?","Could it be because of Zhou Niannian?","Or was he persuaded by Grandpa’s words?","Thinking about this, Ye Jian couldn’t help but smile.","If that was the case, that would be great. Their grandpa’s greatest wish was about to come true.","Li Jinnian read the hundred-word message three times. Every time he read the message, he would finish in less than ten seconds.","After reading it for the first time, Li Jinnian looked at his younger cousin who was standing obediently beside him, and his eyebrows twitched.","He looked at Ye Jian, and Ye Jian looked at him. Then, she blinked. Li Jinnian raised his eyebrows again. After that, he returned the first text and read the message from beginning to end once more.","Thus, Li Jinnian read the hundred-word message that Xia Jinyuan sent to his relatives three times and memorized every word.","The cell phone was returned. Li Jinnian pursed his lips slightly. There was still a hint of emotion in the depths of his heart. It wasn’t because of the person who sent the message. It was because... his cousin was touched.","Could it be that all women liked this kind of care?","Thinking about it... Xia Jinyuan did a good job. Not only did he care about his younger cousin, but he also mobilized the entire family to care for his younger cousin. Looking at the words he used, his attitude was sincere. Xia Jinyuan cared about his younger cousin a lot.","However, to be honest, Li Jinnian wasn’t touched by the message.","“So, that’s why you were so touched that you ended up crying. Not bad, he treats you well.” Li Jinnian, who admitted that Xia Jinyuan was not bad, nodded and said something very superficial. He wasn’t touched, so he couldn’t say much else.","Ye Jian took the cell phone and nodded. Her voice was gentle as she said, “He’s not by my side, but he always cares about me in ways that I can’t see. Cousin, I’m very touched.”","“Yes, it’s good that you’re touched. This means that this message is definitely useful. There’s an arts banquet tonight. I’ll sit beside you and we’ll watch it together,” Li Jinnian said calmly. He then talked about something else. “Grandpa misses you. He’s worried that you won’t be used to Nanguang, so he asked me to come and see if you’re having any difficulties.","“If you have any difficulties, you can tell me directly. Although my relationship with Du Kaiwei is only average, I get along better with him compared to the others. If you have any difficulties, I can mention them to him.”","The topic suddenly changed. Ye Jian couldn’t help but laugh. Her cousin... was afraid that he would be asked about his personal matters. That was why he changed the topic immediately.","“I don’t have any difficulties. I’m just here to learn. It’s just a winter vacation. It’s not difficult at all.” Ye Jian didn’t want to owe anyone a favor because of this. She was fine. Why did she need to let her cousin interact with the Du family?","Du Jiayi... didn’t respect her cousin at all. If Du Jiayi knew that her cousin went to look for Du Kaiwei because of Ye Jian, she would definitely kick up a fuss.","Li Jinnian didn’t insist."]},{"number":3826,"title":"Chapter 3826: Chapter 3825 - 3826: Marriage","paragraphs":["Chapter 3826: Marriage","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was a topic that Li Jinnian came up with to change the topic. The main point was still the old man.","Ye Jian asked about the old man again. Li Jinnian answered her questions one by one, saying that his health was good, his appetite was good, and his mental state was good... In short, everything was better than before.","Because of Ye Jian’s return, the old man’s quiet life was injected with new vitality. It pulled the old man back from the dark and allowed him to continue living. Li Jinnian looked at his cousin, who was smiling brightly too, and a faint smile appeared in his cold eyes.","“Grandpa’s health is good now. I hope that you can find a girlfriend after this. On the phone, Grandpa said he hoped that you could find a woman quickly and introduce her to him. Cousin, you have to work hard.”","In the end, they still talked about Li Jinnian’s marriage.","Li Jinnian glanced at Ye Jian and smiled slightly. He replied calmly, “I’m not in a hurry. With you around, Grandpa is happy enough.”","“Even if you’re not anxious, Grandpa is. You can’t keep delaying it. If you don’t look for her, that good lady will be snatched away by another man. I’m not the one saying this. It was Grandpa who said it.”","Ye Jian smiled as she spoke. For once, she was the one urging others to get married.","She even smiled and said, “Actually, it’s quite a headache to be urged to get married, but Grandpa told me that I have to complete my mission successfully. Cousin, suffer some grievances first and bear with it. I don’t want this to happen either.”","“Where did you learn this? You’re so glib-tongued now.”","Li Jinnian was amused by her. He couldn’t help but raise his hand and flick Ye Jian’s forehead with his slender fingers. “You know that I’m aggrieved but you don’t know how to hold your words back. You’re even rushing me along with Grandpa. I think you just want to watch the show.”","“No, no. I really hope that you can find a gentle, kind, and cute woman for yourself. Cousin, let me give you some advice. Your personality is so cold that others don’t even know if you’re happy or sad. You absolutely can’t go looking for a woman who’s dignified, virtuous, smiles without showing her teeth, and has a quiet temperament.”","The thought of what she was going to say next made Li Jinnian’s eyebrows jump a few times. His intuition told him that it would make him even more resigned.","He could have stopped her from continuing, but when he saw the bright smile on Ye Jian’s face, Li Jinnian couldn’t bear to stop her.","The smile on Ye Jian’s face got deeper. Her clear and crisp voice was pleasant to the ears. “I’m worried that if you find such a woman, the two of you will just stare at each other on your date and you won’t talk for the entire day.”","As expected, it wasn’t something pleasant to hear. Li Jinnian couldn’t help but laugh.","Sometimes, his younger cousin was really a silly girl.","Wasn’t his cousin aware that if he really found a woman one day, the concern he showed her would be reduced because he would have to spend his efforts on the woman by his side?","Just like what Xia Jinyuan said, his cousin had suffered too much. Now, he just wanted to make up for it. This was the sentence Li Jinnian acknowledged the most in Xia Jinyuan’s hundred-word message. It was also because of this sentence that he knew how much Xia Jinyuan loved his cousin.","‘Silly girl, I also want to make up for the hardships you suffered when you were young so that you can be happier and enjoy more. You’re now asking me to get a girlfriend? Although I did waver for a moment, it’s still no match against my desire to treat you better.’","It was best for things to remain as they were."]},{"number":3827,"title":"Chapter 3827: Chapter 3826 - 3827: Smart Aleck","paragraphs":["Chapter 3827: Smart Aleck","Editor: Henyee Translations","The reason why Li Jinnian felt that things were good now was actually very simple.","He didn’t have to divert his attention to care about another woman. He didn’t have to guess what the other woman was thinking. He could give all his concern to his younger cousin who had helped their grandfather to get back on his feet. This kind of interaction allowed him to warm his heart. It allowed him to feel that there were no more regrets regarding his original home that lacked warmth.","Every few steps, the siblings would look at each other and smile. From afar, Du Jiayi could see the closeness between them. They had to have some sort of relationship.","After a few clicks, Du Jiayi sneered with disdain. She had used the camera in her hand to take a few photos of the cousins.","The photos were so well-taken that the old master even framed one up and placed it on his nightstand beside the bed. Every night, before he slept, he would take the photo frame to look at his grandson and granddaughter.","The subtle sound didn’t escape the ears of the special forces siblings. They looked in the direction of the sound almost at the same time. Li Jinnian only saw the back of a woman in a red coat but didn’t recognize her.","Ye Jian recognized who it was at a glance.","As for the clicking sound she heard just now, she had also heard it when she was taking photos with Yijin yesterday. It was the sound of a camera shutter.","Secretly taking photos of her and her cousin?","Ye Jian narrowed her eyes. What was Du Jiayi trying to do?","“Whose family is she? Why is she taking photos here?” Li Jinnian didn’t recognize her at all. Taking photos was prohibited in military restricted areas. Even if she was a soldier’s family, she should abide by this prohibition.","When Ye Jian heard this, she knew that her cousin’s relationship with Du Jiayi, who was related to him by blood, was really ordinary. It was so ordinary that he couldn’t recognize her at all.","“Du Jiayi. I don’t know where she came from, but it looks like she doesn’t plan to leave for the time being.” Ye Jian smiled. She didn’t let Du Jiayi affect her mood. “She took photos of us just now. I think the photos will look good after they’re developed. I’ll ask her for them later.”","When Li Jinnian heard Du Jiayi’s name, he wasn’t interested in asking any more questions. He only replied, “Let me mention this to Du Kaiwei. His family isn’t abiding by the rules of the team. As the regimental commander, he has the responsibility to settle this matter.”","Although the cousins had only known each other for less than three years, they were very similar when dealing with certain matters.","They wouldn’t let their mood be affected because of someone they weren’t interested in.","The cousins didn’t take the photo incident to heart at all. However, Li Jinnian had the intention to kick Du Jiayi out of the company.","Du Jiayi was so happy that her footsteps were exceptionally light. The frustration she felt last night in front of Zhou Yijin and Ye Jian was gone.","Why did Ye Jian refer to Li Jinnian so affectionately? Hahaha, so that was how it was!","She was indeed a little naive. She thought that Ye Jian was just trying to get close to Li Jinnian. Who knew that Ye Jian was even trying to get close to Li Jinnian’s body!","Shameless!","To climb up the social ladder, she was willing to sell her own body. This kind of person really disgusted Du Jiayi!","Wasn’t Xia Jinyuan very powerful? Didn’t he hate scheming women?","Did he become blind this time?","He actually thought that Ye Jian was a good person and even introduced her to Zhou Yijin. He was really blind."]},{"number":3828,"title":"Chapter 3828: Chapter 3827 - 3828: You’re An Eyesore","paragraphs":["Chapter 3828: You’re An Eyesore","Editor: Henyee Translations","When she returned to the capital city, she would develop the photos and show them to Aunt Xiao. At that time, she would ask Aunt Xiao to expose Ye Jian’s fake nature. At that time...","The more Du Jiayi thought about it, the more excited she became. At that time, Ye Jian wouldn’t be the only one who would be embarrassed. Xia Jinyuan, Li Jinnian, and of course, the Xia family, would all be embarrassed as well!","She wouldn’t be leaving Nanguang with nothing. She actually managed to capture such an interesting scene.","‘Wait and see, Ye Jian. Let’s see if you’ll still be able to remain calm. Are you still hoping you’ll stay in the military unit after graduation and climb up to the higher echelons? I, Du Jiayi, will let you endure the feeling of being trampled into the mud.’","Du Jiayi would let Ye Jian understand the consequences of offending someone she shouldn’t.","Du Jiayi pushed open the door of the auditorium, revealing an even more dignified smile. Her every move was so natural and elegant, like the most beautiful flower in bloom among thousands of flowers. She attracted the attention of countless people.","Du Jiayi enjoyed the feeling of being stared at. The more people looked at her, the more elegant she became. She enjoyed being stared at and the amazement in their gazes.","Li Jinnian accompanied Ye Jian outside the auditorium without entering. He didn’t want to see Du Jiayi because he didn’t want Ye Jian to hear Du Jiayi’s harsh words as that might make his younger cousin sad.","Hearing this, Ye Jian stopped pushing the door and turned to look at Li Jinnian, who was standing behind her. Her eyes narrowed slightly. “Cousin, being silent will only make people like Du Jiayi push their luck. Sometimes, we need to let her know that being silent doesn’t mean that we’re easy to bully.”","Li Jinnian’s jaw tightened when he heard her words. However, he felt warmth in his heart.","After a while, Li Jinnian nodded softly. His voice was dry and trembling.","When Du Jiayi saw Ye Jian entering the auditorium alone, the contempt in her eyes deepened. Look, Ye Jian was afraid that she would be discovered and didn’t dare to let Li Jinnian come in with her.","Du Jiayi wondered if her cousin had seen her.","Her eyes flickered slightly. She stopped taking photos and handed the camera to a soldier from the art troupe. “Go take a few photos. I’ll go over it later.”","“Oh, okay.” The soldier hurriedly held the camera in his hand and looked down. Just as he was about to ask how to use it, Du Jiayi had already left.","Ye Jian, who came in from the back door and walked to the podium, glanced at Du Jiayi, who was leaving in a hurry. A trace of coldness flashed past her indifferent eyes.","She subconsciously turned around, wanting to go out the back door to stop Du Jiayi. After taking a few steps, she slowed down. Her cousin wanted to accompany her to the auditorium, but he left because Du Jiayi was there.","It wasn’t that it was inconvenient for her cousin. It was just that Du Jiayi, who wasn’t even polite to him in the company, was present. He was worried that Du Jiayi would say harsh things. He was worried that she would be sad when she heard them, so he used the excuse that it was inconvenient.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but bite her lower lip. In the end, she retracted her footsteps and turned around to walk toward the stage.","Since her brother didn’t want her to see Du Jiayi, she wouldn’t go looking for her. She didn’t want to embarrass her cousin.","Outside, Du Jiayi caught up with Li Jinnian and chased after him aggressively. Then, she stopped him with a cold smile. “Cousin, where are you going in such a hurry? Don’t tell me you walked away when you saw me because you don’t want to pay me any attention, just like when we were young?","“Cousin, you’re really the same as before. We don’t even know how to interact with you.","“You’re still the same as before, making us feel that we’re an eyesore to you.”"]},{"number":3829,"title":"Chapter 3829: Chapter 3828 - 3829: Snarky","paragraphs":["Chapter 3829: Snarky","Editor: Henyee Translations","Du Jiayi had never been polite to Li Jinnian. That was because when she was young, Second Old Madam Li had pointed at Li Jinnian and said to her, “Jiayi, you have to remember my words. Li Jinnian is an annoying fellow. He wants to snatch everything good from you.","“He’ll snatch your delicious snacks now, and he’ll snatch the things Grandpa will be leaving for you in the future. He’ll also snatch your siblings’ things!”","When Second Old Madam Li taught Du Jiayi these words, Du Jiayi was only five years old. However, it was the right time to teach her. It was the easiest time to lead a child astray.","From then on, Du Jiayi remembered every word, especially when Second Old Madam Li said, “You must remember not to treat the fellow who’ll snatch your things nicely. You must let him know how powerful you are so that he won’t dare to snatch your things in the future. Also, you can snatch the good things in his hands too, do you understand?”","As it turned out, as long as she was a little fierce and domineering, she would be able to scare Li Jinnian, who wanted to snatch her things away. She would be able to get more and better things. She would also be able to get the good things that originally belonged to Li Jinnian.","Du Jiayi had always been doing this and had tasted the sweetness of victory.","Every time she made a fuss, everyone, including her uncle, would stand beside her and reprimand Li Jinnian for not giving in to his younger cousin. Every time, Li Jinnian would have no choice but to give her the thing in his hand. No matter what it was, even if she didn’t like it, she would get it as long as she made a fuss.","If she got what she liked, she would keep it. If she didn’t like it, it didn’t matter. She could do whatever she wanted with it.","In any case, the adults wouldn’t pursue things with her because she was still young.","Li Jinnian was much more unlucky than her. Every time, he would be scolded until he had no choice but to lower his head and apologize to her. Every time, she would get her grandmother’s approval and get good things from her.","Later on, as Li Jinnian got older, she got older too. No matter how much she quarreled, it didn’t work. Li Jinnian would just ignore her and walk around her when he saw her, not giving her a chance to attack.","However, the more she thought about it, the more she wanted to see his angry expression.","Unexpectedly, Li Jinnian became smarter after he entered junior high. He didn’t even return home after he started school. He would go to the Fu family’s residence during the holidays and wouldn’t return to the Li family’s residence at all. She couldn’t find any chance to bully him.","Every time she thought about it, she felt that it was a pity that Li Jinnian wasn’t easier to bully.","Even as she got older, Du Jiayi didn’t think there was a problem with her past behavior. Instead, she knew that without Li Jinnian, her family and her uncle’s family would inherit more of Old Master Li’s assets.","Among them were... the countless antiques that Grandpa collected when he was a warlord. Grandma said that these antiques were all monopolized by Grandpa. Those who were chased out by Grandpa wouldn’t even get a teacup.","Now, all the antiques were in Grandpa’s hands. Any one of them was priceless.","Du Jiayi was glad that she knew how to snatch things from Li Jinnian since she was young. This caused Old Master Li to hate his biological grandson more and more. It was also because of this that she would say sarcastic words every time she saw Li Jinnian.","Instead of realizing that her actions were wrong, she thought that she was doing the right thing.","Now that she had stopped Li Jinnian, she wasn’t afraid at all. She even raised her chin and said sharp words with contempt.","This was the reason why Li Jinnian didn’t want Ye Jian to see this."]},{"number":3830,"title":"Chapter 3830: Chapter 3829 - 3830: Wait And See","paragraphs":["Chapter 3830: Wait And See","Editor: Henyee Translations","However, he wasn’t the Li Jinnian from when he was young. Facing Du Jiayi’s disrespect, his face was cold and his eyes were dark. He thought of Ye Jian’s reminder.","He was silent not because he was afraid or weak. He was silent because he didn’t want to face these people. He just wanted to leave as soon as possible so that he wouldn’t waste his time.","His younger cousin was right. Sometimes, silence could make some people push their luck.","Li Jinnian, who was no longer silent, looked at Du Jiayi coldly. “You are an eyesore to me. You’ve always been an eyesore to me since I was young.”","His gaze was cold and vicious. Du Jiayi was caught off guard, and her heart skipped a beat. She was obviously frightened.","However, this reaction made Du Jiayi angry. She snorted coldly and lowered her voice to prevent others from hearing her. “How dare a fellow who’s hated by his family talk to me like this?”","She was still as unreasonable and hypocritical as before.","Li Jinnian felt very embarrassed to be arguing with her here. His cold voice didn’t hide his disgust for her. He said slowly, “An ignorant person is indeed not worthy of talking to me. Every word is a waste of my time.”","Perhaps it was because Li Jinnian had always been silent in front of Du Jiayi’s harsh words before, but this sudden retaliation stunned Du Jiayi. She was in disbelief.","What did she just hear?","She actually heard Li Jinnian saying that she was ignorant and didn’t deserve to talk to him? She even saw the deep disgust on his face!","At first, she wanted to make things uncomfortable for Li Jinnian, but she ended up getting angry. She had never been treated like this before. Even Ye Jian, whom she hated, didn’t have the guts to say such things to her!","“Li Jinnian, you’d better apologize to me. If not, I’ll tell Grandpa to stop you from ever entering the Li family’s house! Also, do you know what I took just now? Heh, I took a few photos of you and a woman who wants to rely on her body to climb up the ranks...”","Du Jiayi didn’t say anything worse because she saw the unconcealed killing intent in Li Jinnian’s eyes. He wanted to kill her. He really wanted to kill her.","At this moment, Du Jiayi was stunned. She immediately stopped herself from saying worse words.","She had always known that when Li Jinnian was angry, he wouldn’t be as agitated as thunder. Instead, he would be like a turbulent undercurrent in the depths of the sea. On the surface, it looked normal, but it was actually turbulent.","But did he dare to kill her?!","Du Jiayi sneered. There was a hard look in her eyes. Although her breathing wasn’t smooth, her words were still clear. “I’m not so easily intimidated. You want to kill me? Ha! Li Jinnian, do you dare? You...”","This time, Du Jiayi couldn’t speak at all. Li Jinnian had already grabbed her neck with one hand. There was something extremely cold between his fingers pressing against the aorta on her neck.","Would she die here?","Fear filled her mind instantly. Her arrogant eyes were filled with unprecedented fear.","At this moment, Du Jiayi finally understood that Li Jinnian wasn’t scaring her just now. He would really kill her!","“From now on, don’t let me hear you say anything disrespectful about Ye Jian again. Du Jiayi, I have countless ways to deal with a person. Car accidents, fires, backwaters... I’ll make sure that you’ll die a silent death.”","Li Jinnian’s back was facing the surveillance cameras. Although he was warning Du Jiayi, from the surveillance footage, they seemed to be in an intimate position. Du Jiayi couldn’t help but tremble when she heard him."]},{"number":3831,"title":"Chapter 3831: Chapter 3830 - 3831: Resistance? No Way","paragraphs":["Chapter 3831: Resistance? No Way","Editor: Henyee Translations","Releasing his hand, Li Jinnian took a step back and stood in front of Du Jiayi for a while before turning to leave.","Since he dared to do this, he had a way to make sure no one knew about it. He wasn’t afraid of being discovered.","At first, Du Jiayi thought that he was just trying to scare her. She didn’t expect to have a narrow escape with death. Du Jiayi clutched her neck and coughed violently.","After her coughing fit, she took deep breaths. She stared at the tall figure that was leaving. At that moment, there was not only fear in her eyes but also coldness.","He wanted to kill her. He really wanted to kill her just now.","Just because she said that Ye Jian was trash, he wanted to kill her!","Her knees were weak, and she couldn’t stand properly. She could only squat down and couldn’t stand back up for a long time.","A soldier walked past her and asked, “What’s wrong? Do you need help?”","“No, I’m alright.” Du Jiayi covered her head and replied. Her voice was a little cold as she rejected the soldier, making him embarrassed. She seemed to be venting her anger on others.","She soon regretted what she said. She raised her head and smiled politely. “I’m sorry. I encountered something unpleasant just now. I’m fine. I don’t need your help.”","She seemed to be... the regimental commander’s younger sister. The soldier hurriedly waved his hand and left without asking any more questions.","Du Jiayi, who still had lingering fear in her heart, stood up. She didn’t immediately take a step. After a long time, she heaved a sigh of relief. As the coldness in the depths of her eyes gradually surfaced, a sinister smile appeared at the corner of her mouth.","Du Jiayi was stunned by Li Jinnian’s killing intent. Her smile got deeper and deeper. Her gaze on Li Jinnian’s back was as if it had been laced with the coldest poison.","Du Jiayi was very smart. She didn’t chase after Li Jinnian because she knew that even a rabbit would bite when it was anxious.","Since he said that there were thousands of ways to kill her, she believed that he had thousands of ways to kill enemies on the battlefield. However, was it possible to use the tactics on the battlefield on her?","He was already a lieutenant colonel at such a young age. His rank and qualifications meant that he was in the main regiment. This wasn’t a rank and qualification that ordinary lieutenant colonels could have. This proved that Li Jinnian was an elite in the navy unit.","Li Jinnian, who had been ostracized by his family since he was young and didn’t even like his biological father, had already mixed into the elites of the regiment. Yet, he still said that there were hundreds of ways to kill her. How ridiculous!","Did he still want his future?","Du Jiayi didn’t take Li Jinnian’s warning to heart. However, she knew that Li Jinnian was no longer the Li Jinnian that she could bully as she pleased.","This man was mature and strong now. He had the courage to fight with his family. If she treated him like before, the scene that shocked her today would happen again.","“You want to kill me? Let’s see who’s stronger!” Du Jiayi muttered in a low voice. She turned around and returned to the auditorium elegantly as usual.","There was no hurry. As long as her grandma was still around and her grandpa was still in charge of the Li family, she would have enough chances to teach Li Jinnian a lesson.","If she didn’t have the ability to deal with Li Jinnian personally, she could use them to teach Li Jinnian a lesson.","Would Li Jinnian dare to resist when his elders were suppressing him?","Resisting would only make him suffer more punishments, just like when he was young!"]},{"number":3832,"title":"Chapter 3832: Chapter 3831 - 3832: So Many Scenes","paragraphs":["Chapter 3832: So Many Scenes","Editor: Henyee Translations","Du Jiayi had never been a coward. Second Old Madam Li taught her that ‘kids who cry can have sweets’. Old Master Li taught her to know when to advance and retreat and conserve her strength. Madam Li taught her to ‘make a move after planning and subdue the enemy with one strike’. She had been using what she learned, and everything had been going smoothly.","She managed to eliminate some eyesores that she didn’t like and suppress many opponents who wanted to resist. In the end, they all lost to her.","Everything was as she wished. Everything was in her hands. It was like this in the past, and it would be the same in the future!","Li Jinnian, Ye Jian... Wait and see. With the photos, there was no need for her to do anything. Someone else would act on behalf of her!","Du Jiayi returned to the auditorium with a sinister smile. Since she wanted to deal with Li Jinnian, who dared to kill her, what was she waiting for?","It would be too late if she waited for him to return to the military unit before taking action.","This was because he hadn’t gone to the military unit yet and could still be called back to the Li family by their grandfather!","The sound of high heels clicking could be heard. The soldiers in the auditorium didn’t notice her leaving and returning. However, Ye Jian had been paying attention. She heaved a sigh of relief when she saw Du Jiayi returning with a dark and cold expression as if she had been angered.","Could she assume that her cousin didn’t keep quiet this time?","Du Jiayi entered the auditorium and kept looking for Ye Jian, Ye Jian had retracted her gaze, but Du Jiayi still found where Ye Jian was standing.","After passing a few rows of seats, Du Jiayi walked toward Ye Jian.","She was a few centimeters shorter than Ye Jian. However, Ye Jian was wearing training boots and she was wearing 10cm-high heels. She was five centimeters taller than the 168cm Ye Jian. In addition, she walked closer deliberately. When she looked at Ye Jian, she had a condescending aura.","She sized Ye Jian up with disdain and sneered, “Ye Jian, do you really want to enter the Li family? Do you think that with your looks...”","She raised her hand and made an impolite gesture. “Do you think you can enter the Li family with your looks? Aren’t you thinking too highly of yourself?”","Ye Jian raised her eyebrows slightly and smiled. “Miss Du, have you been planning to enter the entertainment industry recently? I’m surprised that you’re putting on so many performances.","“You think too highly of yourself... I really don’t have that intention at all. Wanting to enter the Li family? Sorry, I’m not interested.”","Du Jiayi giggled as if she had heard a joke. Her laughter was elegant.","“Stop pretending, Ye Jian. I know you don’t mean what you say. I really want to laugh. Tsk tsk tsk, I really underestimated you. I didn’t expect you to hook up with Li Jinnian so quickly and make him protect you so much.”","She deliberately walked closer because she didn’t want other people to hear what she said. Her words and her aura were two extremes. Those who didn’t know better couldn’t imagine that the elegant Du Jiayi would say such mean words.","“Do you really think that you can achieve your ambition by seducing Li Jinnian? Do you think you can enter the Li family’s door?”","“I’m related to Li Jinnian. His grandpa is my grandpa. Our grandpa has always doted on me. As for Li Jinnian, he hasn’t been liked by the elders in his family since he was young. His grandpa has never treated him well either. Ye Jian, do you think that you can climb up the ladder if you hook up with Li Jinnian? Don’t think too highly of yourself.”"]},{"number":3833,"title":"Chapter 3833: Chapter 3832 - 3833: Who Will Be A Joke","paragraphs":["Chapter 3833: Who Will Be A Joke","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ever since he was young, he had never been... liked by the elders in his family. Old Master Li never treated her cousin well either. Ye Jian’s calm expression turned dark because of those words.","As it turned out, her cousin was the same as her when he was young. He suffered from the coldness of the elders in his family. She was still fine. She wasn’t related to Ye Zhifan’s family by blood.","However, her cousin was different. Everyone in his family shared the same bloodline. Why did her cousin get neglected by his closest relatives?","Ye Jian couldn’t help but purse her lips.","She only felt sorry for her cousin because he was neglected when he was young. In Du Jiayi’s eyes, Ye Jian’s reaction held another meaning. Ye Jian had found out that even if she got close to Li Jinnian, she wouldn’t be able to marry into the Li family, so she was dealt a huge blow.","Du Jiayi’s frustration was swept away. Her voice wasn’t so cold anymore and sounded clear. “That’s enough to make you dispirited? You’re quite pitiful. You tried your best to climb up the social ladder like Ye Ying, but you’re luckier than Ye Ying. At least you managed to cling onto Li Jinnian. Unlike Ye Ying, who didn’t get anything and ran away dejectedly without daring to show her face as that’ll only embarrass herself.","“Do you think that Li Jinnian will get you what you want? Besides his surname, what else does Li Jinnian have? Nothing!","“But even if the Li family treats him like he doesn’t exist, his surname is still Li. It’s just that you’ll never be able to marry into the Li family.”","Du Jiayi felt that she had finally won a round. She looked at Ye Jian with pity in her eyes. The corners of her mouth were pursed tightly. She was in a very good mood. She glanced at Ye Jian arrogantly and swayed her slender waist slightly. Then, she walked toward the soldier holding her camera with a dignified expression.","When she left, she was holding a roll of film.","It was already nighttime when Du Kaiwei found out that Du Jiayi had taken photos in the military unit. When he contacted her, Du Jiayi had just gotten into the private car sent by the Li family to fetch her.","“Li Jinnian told you? Brother, I’ve been in the military unit for a few years. How could I not know the rules? Don’t worry, apart from intimate photos of Li Jinnian and Ye Jian, there’s not a single photo of the military unit.”","“You want the film? Sure, I’ll send it to you tomorrow afternoon. Li Jinnian has always been targeting me since I was young. You know that, so why do you believe everything he says?","“I just need one photo of Li Jinnian and Ye Jian. I’ll send the rest over. There’s no use keeping them anyway. Let’s not talk about this anymore. I’m going to visit Grandpa and Grandma. I’ll hang up first. Goodbye.”","In the morning, she was still in Nanguang. At night, she came to the capital city with a scheming look in her eyes. Du Jiayi hung up the phone and said to the chauffeur, “Uncle Liang, drive faster. I really want to see Grandpa and Grandma now.”","She really wanted to see her grandpa as soon as possible. She really wanted to tell her grandpa about Li Jinnian and Ye Jian. She couldn’t wait to see how Li Jinnian would be scolded by her grandpa when he called him back.","Oh, no, no.","Scolding him was a small matter. She wanted to see her grandfather whip Li Jinnian with the real horsewhip. It would be good if he was whipped until his flesh split open!","This was Du Jiayi’s true nature.","That night, when Ye Jian and Li Jinnian were watching the arts banquet seriously, Du Jiayi was sitting in the Li family’s living room. She told Old Master Li everything she saw and her speculation."]},{"number":3834,"title":"Chapter 3834: Chapter 3833 - 3834: White Lotus","paragraphs":["Chapter 3834: White Lotus","Editor: Henyee Translations","She had the ability to distort the truth, and she knew what Old Master Li hated the most. First, she chose to talk about Ye Jian’s background. Ye Jian came from a mountain village. She used some unknown method to force her cousin, Ye Ying, out of the university entrance examination and got into the military school herself. These two things already violated Old Master Li’s taboo.","He hated it when a person was scheming. A woman should be docile. Even if she had some small schemes, she couldn’t let others see through them.","It was a good thing to be scheming. However, if she schemed until others saw her as a joke, she would be stupid!","Then, he heard Du Jiayi say that Ye Jian used her beauty to cast her net widely. She had an ambiguous relationship with many unmarried young masters from wealthy families in the capital city. This violated another one of Old Master Li’s taboo.","Second Old Madam Li added fuel to the fire. “What should we do? What should we do? Jinnian has been protected too well by his family since he was young. He doesn’t know how evil people are. Since he’s in the military unit, he doesn’t know how complicated society is. Many women with evil intentions want to marry into wealthy families.","“Old Master, what should we do? Jinnian is not close to his family. If we remind him to be careful, he might blame us. What should we do? I, I, I... I’m so anxious that my hands are trembling.”","As she spoke, she remembered to put on a scene. In order to let Old Master Li know that she was really panicking, Second Old Madam Li even placed her hand on the back of Old Master Li’s hand. Du Jiayi admired her when she saw this.","The person she respected the most wasn’t her mother. The person she respected the most was her grandmother, who made her grandfather think that although she was scheming, she wasn’t going overboard.","A woman like Grandma was a winner.","Old Master Li wouldn’t fly into a rage when he was angry. At his age, it wasn’t suitable for him to lose his top. That would be harmful to his health.","Glancing at his wife, Old Master Li said calmly, “Jinnian hasn’t been well protected by his family. He knows that not many people in his family are sincere to him. I heard from Jiayi that Ye Jian is good at coaxing people. If you had been willing to let go of your prejudice against your sister and accept Jinnian back then, this wouldn’t have happened.”","Second Old Madam Li’s expression froze. She retracted her hand and lowered her head to wipe her tears silently.","At this moment, she couldn’t open her mouth anymore. The more she said, the more she would blame him.","Seeing that her grandmother was being criticized, Du Jiayi hugged Old Master Li’s arm and said, “Grandpa, you can’t say that about Grandma. I heard that First Grandma made Grandma kneel in the snow for an entire day back then. It was First Grandma who broke Grandma’s heart first. You can’t be unreasonable.","“Grandma is worried that Eldest Cousin will be deceived. Now, you’re telling Grandma off. Grandpa, you’re unreasonable.”","“Alright, you little girl. You only know how to feel wronged for your grandmother. Hurry up and let go. My old bones can’t withstand your shaking. My bones are about to fall apart.” In the face of his granddaughter’s adorable act, Old Master Li didn’t say much about his wife. He had to leave his wife with some dignity in front of the younger generation.","“I’ll take care of the matters regarding your eldest cousin. As for you, you can’t tell anyone. As for her knowing the child of the Xia family, develop the photos and give them to me. Don’t get involved in this matter. I know what to do.”","Du Jiayi didn’t want to agree. All she wanted to see was Li Jinnian’s misfortune. If she couldn’t interfere, how could she do that?","“But...”","With just that one word, she received a warning look from Second Old Madam Li, who was wiping her tears. The old master had spoken. Even as the woman by his side, she didn’t dare to say anything, let alone his granddaughter."]},{"number":3835,"title":"Chapter 3835: Chapter 3834 - 3835: Difference Between Family And Friendship","paragraphs":["Chapter 3835: Difference Between Family And Friendship","Editor: Henyee Translations","After receiving the warning, Du Jiayi closed her mouth reluctantly. Fine, she would stop talking about Li Jinnian and Ye Jian for now. But she should be able to talk about her relationship with Li Jinnian.","“Alright, I won’t talk about Cousin and Ye Jian. However, there’s another very important thing I have to tell you. After I mentioned Ye Jian, Cousin felt that my words were too harsh and thought that I was framing her on purpose. He even raised his hand and strangled me. Grandpa, he wanted to kill me because of an outsider. You have to make him apologize to me.","“If not, I’ll feel wronged. I was clearly reminding him for his own good. In the end, not only did he not appreciate it, but he even wanted to kill me. Grandpa, I was really close to being killed by him.”","Hearing this, Second Madam Li gasped and stood up anxiously. “Did he hurt you? Hurry up and let me take a look. How can your cousin be so heartless to you for an outsider? Jiayi, you have to tell the truth. You can’t malign your cousin!”","She stood up, warning her while also being concerned for her. It was hard to tell who she was biased against.","Old Master Li looked at his nervous wife and coughed softly. He said to the aggrieved Du Jiayi, “Your cousin is cold and not good with words. Although his relationship with you is average, he won’t kill you. Look, you’re still fine.","“Physical altercations can happen sometimes. Moreover, you’re cousins. It’s normal for you to bump heads with each other. If he really wanted to kill you, do you think you could’ve come back alive?","“You already said that your cousin is a lieutenant colonel and an elite of the military unit. If he really wanted to kill you, you wouldn’t have been able to escape.","“Alright, don’t treat the conflict between cousins as a huge matter. I still have something on. Talk to your grandmother.” Old Master Li didn’t give Du Jiayi any explanation. He stood up and treated what Du Jiayi thought was a huge matter as a small conflict between cousins.","Du Jiayi thought that she would be comforted and that her grandfather, who doted on her, would stand up for her. She realized that it wasn’t the case!","“Grandpa...”","If she didn’t achieve the effect she expected, Du Jiayi wouldn’t be willing to give up. She got up and wanted to pester him for a while more.","“Jiayi, your grandpa has something to settle. Come and talk to me.” Second Old Madam Li grabbed her granddaughter’s arm and forcefully pulled her back to the sofa.","Du Jiayi, who felt that she had gained nothing, refused to listen. Her eyes turned red instantly. She stretched her neck and cried in grievance. “Grandma, it’s not like what Grandpa said at all. Eldest Cousin clearly wanted to kill me. Look here, it’s still red. It’s still red!”","There wasn’t even a mole on her neck that was as fair as a swan’s neck, let alone any redness. Second Old Madam Li pulled Du Jiayi’s hand away from her collar and said with heartache, “I know that you’ve suffered grievances and that you’re not lying. But...","“Jiajia, since your grandfather said that it’s just a tussle between cousins, that means that it’s a tussle between cousins. If you feel wronged, think about your grandfather’s angry expression just now. Do you feel better now?","“Since you just want to make Li Jinnian’s life unhappy, remember not to be too greedy. There will always be progress. What you want to happen requires time. Once that day comes, you won’t remember feeling wronged. You’ll only feel that all your grievances were worth it.”"]},{"number":3836,"title":"Chapter 3836: Chapter 3835 - 3836: More Haste Less Speed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3836: More Haste Less Speed","Editor: Henyee Translations","After listening for so long, Du Jiayi still felt wronged. Her tears fell uncontrollably, and she sniffed from time to time. After a while, she cried until the tip of her nose was a little red.","Second Old Madam Li took out a piece of tissue paper and passed it over. Her kind voice was like a soothing classical song, comforting Du Jiayi’s heart that was suffering grievances.","“You’ve already achieved your goal tonight. We’ll take it slow next. The old master is already angry. Why are you afraid that Li Jinnian won’t be miserable? You just have to wait for Li Jinnian to be reprimanded by the old master. Calm down and stop thinking about making things worse for Li Jinnian. Your grandfather won’t like it.”","Second Old Madam Li comforted her granddaughter gently. Gradually, the grievances in Du Jiayi’s heart disappeared bit by bit. When she fell asleep, she was only a little bit aggrieved.","The next day, Du Jiayi was woken up by Old Master Li’s reprimanding of Li Jinnian on the phone. The grievance in her heart vanished. She was so happy that she lifted the blanket and got off the bed barefooted. She opened the door and wanted to run out...","The door opened. Du Jiayi stood at the door and didn’t run out anymore. Her expression showed her embarrassment. Her grandmother seemed to have been waiting for her outside.","“Jiayi, don’t I always remind you that more haste, less speed? You’re already an adult. Don’t you remember?” At the door, Second Old Madam Li, who was wearing an exquisite handmade cheongsam, stood quietly. One could still see the gentle smile on her young and beautiful face. She looked at her granddaughter calmly. “I’ve never seen your grandpa reprimanding his children and grandchildren. Where did your guts come from?”","“Grandma, I didn’t... You misunderstood me.” Du Jiayi was a little unwilling. She grabbed Second Old Madam Li’s wrist gently and shook it adorably. “I woke up from hunger. I woke up and planned to have breakfast.”","Who was Second Old Madam Li?","She climbed into Old Master Li’s bed at the age of 14 years old. At the age of 15, she gave birth to Li Chenglan. From a beggar, she became the mistress of a warlord family. From this, one could tell that her ability and methods were extraordinary.","How could she be fooled by Du Jiayi’s cute act? Also, the more a woman was like this, the more her man would pamper her. This was one of the things she taught her granddaughter.","It wouldn’t work on her now.","She slowly pulled her wrist back without any hesitation. Second Old Madam Li, who had a gentle smile on her face, raised her hand and tucked Du Jiayi’s long hair behind her ears. She said slowly, “Your grandfather already knows about Li Jinnian and the shady girl outside. Since he told you that you can’t interfere anymore, he’ll settle the matter properly. Just listen carefully and watch. Don’t let your thoughts wander.","“Old Master is old, but his heart and eyes aren’t. Li Jinnian’s surname is Li. No matter how much he doesn’t like him, you, a granddaughter of the Du family, have no say in these things. Do you understand?","“I’ve never done anything like this in my life. I hope you can learn from me and not do anything stupid. Old Master’s surname is Li, and Li Jinnian’s surname is Li too. Only the Li family can handle the Li family’s matters. No matter how close we are, we can forget about interfering. The old master knows this clearly.","“Last night, you said that Li Jinnian strangled your neck. Why didn’t Old Master say that Li Jinnian was in the wrong? Why didn’t he say that he wanted to speak up for you?","“No matter how out of line Li Jinnian is, you have no right to interfere, do you understand? Jiayi, remember what I said. This is my warning and advice for you.”"]},{"number":3837,"title":"Chapter 3837: Chapter 3836 - 3837: Anger","paragraphs":["Chapter 3837: Anger","Editor: Henyee Translations","In the Li family, the person who understood Old Master Li the best was the person beside him, Second Old Madam Li. Her advice was equivalent to telling Du Jiayi what perspective she should use to please Old Master Li.","However, at this moment, Du Jiayi didn’t take the advice to heart like last night. She held the old woman’s hand silently. She was angry at Second Old Madam Li for being so distant.","She lowered her eyes to hide the unwillingness in them. She made herself look weak and harmless.","“Think carefully about what I said. Tell me when you’ve thought it through. Go back to your room and tidy yourself up. Dress up beautifully before going downstairs. My granddaughter is so beautiful. You have to let everyone see it.”","She took care of herself meticulously, but her skin still lost its elasticity. She pinched Du Jiayi’s cheek intimately. Second Old Madam Li smiled and turned to leave.","She was wearing an exquisite cheongsam. It was impossible to tell that she was an old lady in her 70s. Even her daughter, Li Chenglan, who was only 15 years younger than her, was not comparable to her.","Du Jiayi slowly retreated into the room and fell heavily onto the bed. She grabbed the bedsheet tightly with both hands until it was about to tear.","In the end, it was because her surname was Du and not Li. Her grandfather didn’t treat her as a part of the family. As for the grandmother who doted on her... it was the same thing!","In their eyes, the Li family was their real family. She, on the other hand, was an outsider!","Du Jiayi gritted her teeth in hatred. She only wanted to go back to the Du family now. She wanted to go back to her real home as soon as possible. She didn’t want to stay with the Li family at all!","The Li family was a family with the surname Li. They had nothing to do with her!","No matter how much she liked her grandpa, at the crucial moment, her grandpa was still on Li Jinnian’s side. He wasn’t on his granddaughter’s side at all.","Hmph, she had figured it out!","Who was Du Jiayi? She was nothing. And it was all because her surname was Du!","Downstairs, Old Master Li was still scolding Li Jinnian. On the other end of the phone, Li Jinnian placed his phone in his pocket without listening to it.","He only managed to get one night of rest. Now, he was preparing to leave and return to the capital city.","Ye Jian couldn’t leave. She could only send him to the entrance of the company camp.","“Take care of yourself. Contact me if anything happens.” Li Jinnian, who was standing at the entrance of the camp, adjusted Ye Jian’s training cap. There was a hint of gentleness on his handsome and cold face. “Grandpa has me to accompany him, so don’t worry.”","Ye Jian nodded lightly. She didn’t retract her gaze until Li Jinnian walked to the entrance of the camp and left on a bus.","Zhou Yijin and a few other female soldiers from the arts troupe left the company immediately after the banquet last night. Ye Jian didn’t even have the time to say goodbye to Zhou Yijin face-to-face. She only received a message from her saying: [See you next time.]","The next time they met... Ye Jian wondered when they would meet again.","After getting into the car, Li Jinnian took out his phone from his pocket and looked at the screen. The scolding was still ongoing. He pursed his lips and placed the phone beside his ear.","“Although you’re not close to your family, you can forget about bringing a shady woman back to the Li family! Li Jinnian, you should have a limit to your disputes with your family. Don’t go overboard. Do you understand?”","Li Jinnian didn’t answer. Old Master Li reprimanded him, “Did you hear that?”","Old Master Li wouldn’t have thought that Li Jinnian didn’t hear a single word he said."]},{"number":3838,"title":"Chapter 3838: Chapter 3837 - 3838: Emergency Gathering","paragraphs":["Chapter 3838: Emergency Gathering","Editor: Henyee Translations","Li Jinnian opened his mouth calmly and said a few words, “Ye Jian is not an indecent woman. I won’t bring her back to the Li family, don’t worry.” These were the only words he had to say. “I don’t know what Du Jiayi said to you to make you so angry.","“I just want to tell you that what you’re worried about will never happen. If you’re teaching me a lesson because of this, I believe you know my attitude. Please don’t mention something that’s unlikely to happen again.","“I’m sorry, I still have something on. I’ll hang up first. Goodbye.”","Li Jinnian finished speaking with a cold expression. He didn’t give Old Master Li a chance to question him again. As soon as he finished speaking, the call was cut off. The old man’s voice disappeared completely.","The car had already left the company behind. Li Jinnian, who was sitting at the back, supported himself with one hand and straightened up slightly. He turned around and looked at the back of the car.","Ye Jian was nowhere to be seen. She was nowhere to be seen.","Ye Jian had already immersed herself in training. She patrolled the mountains with the border guards and climbed rocks and walls to check the signals of the communication towers.","At night, she and Ding Ling had wet hair. They leaned over their desks and wrote the training report for the day. After the winter vacation ended, they had to bind the daily report into a book and leave a photocopy of it in the grassroots company. The original copy would be brought back to the school.","At 4:30 am on New Year’s Day, Ye Jian and the rest, who were still sleeping, were woken up by the urgent alarm. Everyone gathered at their fastest speed.","A new mission was issued. The higher-ups had instructed them to temporarily patrol the various stations and escort the people who were returning to their hometowns to celebrate the new year.","This was the first time the company received such a mission. Within an hour, all the soldiers memorized the number of trains and the time of departure of each train.","They were even given maps of the stations. They had to memorize the location of the ticketing center, the various procedures, and even the location of the bathrooms.","Not only that, but they also had to remember the buses and their routes... They had to remember them so that they could answer the passengers who came to ask questions.","The soldiers didn’t even wash their faces or brush their teeth. They took the information that was sent over and started memorizing it crazily. It was time to see who had the strongest memory retention.","Besides the soldiers on sentry duty and the soldiers from the cooking team, all the soldiers in the company were sitting in the cafeteria. They were eating steamed buns with one hand and flipping through the information with the other.","No one felt that it was very difficult. There were a few people in a team, so they split the information into parts for each person to memorize. It was a reasonable division of labor. Time and efficiency were perfectly integrated.","Ye Jian, Ding Ling, and the other 28 soldiers formed a large group. The large group was divided into five smaller groups. Each group had six people. The six of them divided the work clearly, and they each memorized the information they had been assigned. At 6:30 am, everyone got into their teams and set off for various points.","Today was the 28th day of the month,close to the Spring Festival. There were three teams on duty at the train station. Ye Jian, Ding Ling, and the other six people were assigned to the main train station."]},{"number":3839,"title":"Chapter 3839: Chapter 3838 - 3839: Amazing","paragraphs":["Chapter 3839: Amazing","Editor: Henyee Translations","When they arrived at the train station, there was a sea of people. The people were all happy to return to their hometown for the new year. They carried their luggage on their shoulders and in their hands. Items were also strapped to their chests and backs. They came and went just to board the train back to their hometown.","Ye Jian and the rest got down from the vehicle and gathered immediately. Then, they took on the mission that was given at the last minute.","For the next two days, they were extremely busy with a lot of things to do. People kept asking them questions and rushing over to tell them what they had lost. There were even people who fainted and people who suddenly fell sick. From the 28th to the 30th of the month, Ye Jian was so busy that she didn’t even have time to drink water.","“No. 1, No. 1. A passenger needs to go to Flower City Building. Which bus should he take...”","“Route 232.” Ye Jian, who had the codename ‘No. 1′, answered accurately.","“Roger, roger.”","“There are passengers who need to go to Guang’an Road. Which bus should they take?”","“Bus No. 79. They can get down from Shenghui Building,” Ye Jian, No. 1, replied.","Every time a passenger asked Ye Jian how to take the bus, Ye Jian would be able to answer them accurately. The soldiers in her team then realized that when they were memorizing the information, Ye Jian had memorized all the information.","There were many bus routes in the train station... and she remembered all of them.","Ding Ling, who was standing with Ye Jian, was dumbfounded. She remembered everything? She got everything correct!","How did she remember all that? How did she manage to memorize so much information within two hours?","Did she have a computer for a brain?","Ding Ling was astounded. The soldiers in her team and the soldiers in the other two teams were astounded too.","Ye Jian could easily answer all the questions about the train number and the time. Her answers were all 100% correct. The three teams of soldiers on duty at the train station were astounded.","During the short break, the three groups of soldiers met and looked at Ye Jian with admiration.","The soldiers’ walkie-talkies shared the same channel with the armed police and policemen on duty in the entire train station. Thus, it was not only the soldiers who knew that there was a female comrade with a superb memory; the others knew about her too. She was able to answer everything passengers asked without making any mistakes.","Ye Jian knew the lines of all the train stations, the bus routes, the roads nearby, the landmarks, and the best path to take.","It was simply... amazing!","“How did she do it? She hasn’t made a single mistake.”","“That’s impossible. She was assigned to the grassroots company by the National Science University during the winter vacation. At most, she should only remember the city map of Xiang City. It’s impossible for her to remember the city map of Nanguang Province.”","“She knows the bus and train routes. She knows the schedule of all the trains, like which trains are late and how long the delay will be. Tell me... How does she know?”","“I guess... she just memorized everything.”","...","How strong must one’s brain be to memorize everything?","“There are a few old police officers in our police station who are like her. The provincial city map is in their minds. They’ll be able to give you an answer faster than if we were to check it ourselves.”","“Well, you said so yourself that they’re old police officers. She’s different. She got here not long ago.”","“I guess it all boils down to memory retention.”","The resting police team discussed Ye Jian for a long time. The armed police team was the same. They were all amazed by Ye Jian’s brain structure. Her memory was so good!"]},{"number":3840,"title":"Chapter 3840: Chapter 3839 - 3840: It’ll Be Hard To Keep Her","paragraphs":["Chapter 3840: It’ll Be Hard To Keep Her","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone wanted to know why Ye Jian’s memory was so good. Ye Jian, who was resting, smiled and replied to the soldiers who were waiting for her to explain, “I usually like to memorize numbers, maps, and so on. I find it very interesting.”","The soldiers felt that she wasn’t telling the truth.","However, they all knew that she really relied on her memory. Besides that, there was no other way.","Ye Jian was very calm. After resting, she went back to her duty.","Everyone was very busy, so they didn’t bring up this topic again.","Ye Jian was like all the soldiers. She was so busy carrying out her duty. There was even an emergency that needed to be dealt with. As she dealt with the tasks in her hands, she would also have to call her comrades nearby to hurry over and deal with another problem. She was so busy that a ten-minute break became a luxury.","On the first day, which was the 28th, Ye Jian’s team received praise from the higher-ups. They even said that they hoped that they could come and help next year.","The company commander, who was holding a cup of instant noodles to fill his stomach, smiled and said, “This was the only year we were able to catch up. But she won’t be in our company next year.","“This is a high-level talent from the military school. Our company doesn’t even have the courage to let her stay. Let’s have the country make the arrangements for her.”","The company commander called the battalion commander after he finished speaking. He sighed and said, “Ye Jian really makes me want to keep her. Is there really nothing our battalion can do?”","“You want to keep her? Don’t even think about it. The military school has already informed the regiment. She has already made arrangements on her side. Even the military school can’t keep her, so our camp can forget about it.”","“She already has an arrangement? Then there’s really nothing we can do. Unfortunately, it’s a pity. You didn’t see her ability in handling matters today. She alone can take on ten people. Oh my god, even I, the company commander, don’t dare to walk in front of her anymore.”","“Don’t feel too stressed. It’s only one winter vacation. After the winter vacation ends, she’ll go back to where she belongs. Why are you thinking so much? There are still two days left. Cooperate with the train station and complete your mission. Don’t embarrass me!” The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion finished speaking quickly and hung up the phone. He was busy. He didn’t have the time to chat.","There was no way they could keep her, so what else was there to talk about?","Placing his phone in his pocket, the company commander turned around and held an emergency meeting. He instructed Ye Jian what shortcomings she had today and how she needed to improve them so that she could complete her tasks well in the next two days.","What gave the soldiers a headache was not passengers coming to them with questions but them cutting queues.","No matter how they shouted, there would always be people who liked to cut the line to make things easier for themselves but make things difficult for the people behind them.","It was understandable if they cut the line if they couldn’t catch the train otherwise. However, they even cut queues when entering the train station. If the soldiers spoke in a stern tone, the passengers would say that they were scolding them. If their tone was too soft, the passengers wouldn’t take them seriously and would continue cutting queues. Everything had to rely on making last-minute decisions.","On the first day, everything was still new. On the second day, things became familiar. The soldiers’ learned from yesterday’s experience became more proficient in dealing with problems. Their efficiency also increased.","However, as long as it was during the New Year’s festivities at the train station, there would not be enough manpower to deal with all the tasks. Although their efficiency increased, there were also more things to do.","Ye Jian, Ding Ling, and another soldier from the company stood in a triangle formation and paid close attention to the safety of the area they were in charge of. This was their first time carrying out such a mission. They didn’t dare to relax at all. They even lowered their blinking frequency, afraid that something would happen."]},{"number":3841,"title":"Chapter 3841: Chapter 3840 - 3841: Taking Advantage Of The Chaos","paragraphs":["Chapter 3841: Taking Advantage Of The Chaos","Editor: Henyee Translations","Tomorrow was New Year’s Eve. There were more and more passengers rushing home for the festivities. Some passengers were worried that they would miss the train time, so they arrived early and sat outside to wait. Passengers came and went. They would carry their luggage and run frantically to rush home to reunite with their families.","There were also ‘parasites’ that didn’t intend on going home. They just strolled around the square aimlessly.","Someone threw the cigarette butt on the ground and stomped on it with the toe of his shoe. Then, he picked up the huge denim backpack beside his feet and blended into the crowd.","“That woman has appeared. Find a few people to cut the line and create a scene. Then, get a few brothers to join in the fun. When it’s time, bring out the knives. Just like before, we’ll leave after stabbing her.","“Our brother is still locked up in prison. Since she doesn’t want us to have a good New Year’s, we have no reason to let her enjoy it either. We might as well make everyone unhappy.”","“Sure, Brother Hua has already spoken. We can’t disappoint Brother Hua. We miscalculated last time. This time, we must succeed no matter what!”","“If you can do it, then proceed. If you can’t... there’s no need to fight them head-on. They have guns and we only have knives. We’ll be at a disadvantage if we fight them head-on.”","“Hahaha, Brother Hua, don’t worry. There are so many people coming and going. What’s the use of having guns? Do they really dare to shoot at us? Aren’t they afraid of hurting others? Brother Hua, we must do this. Brother Bin is suffering right now. How can we just watch?”","“Thank you for your hard work. I’ll give you a big red packet for the new year.” The middle-aged man carrying a denim bag followed the crowd aimlessly. He didn’t get too close to Ye Jian.","He was afraid that Ye Jian would recognize him.","If he really appeared in Ye Jian’s line of sight, Ye Jian would be able to recognize him with her powerful memory retention.","Around six o’clock in the evening, five passengers carried their luggage and forcefully cut the line. The passengers behind them were unhappy with them cutting the line and said a few words. One of the five passengers who cut the line was a burly man with a strong physique. Without a word, he hit the passengers who expressed their dissatisfaction.","“What are you doing?! It’s fine if you cut the line, but you’re even starting a fight?”","The passenger who got hit wasn’t alone. How could he accept being hit for no reason? He threw the luggage in his hand on the ground and retaliated without any fear.","“Damn it! Do you want to fight? I’ll beat you to death!” The burly man glared at the other party when he saw that he still dared to retaliate. He started fighting with the passengers who were not afraid of trouble.","At first, there were only two people fighting. Then, the other passengers joined in. The sharp whistle didn’t do anything.","“They’re fighting! There’s a fight in front!”","“Spread out, spread out!”","“Evacuate the crowd. All groups in the vicinity, evacuate the crowd quickly. Immediately subdue the passengers who are causing trouble!”","“Roger, copy!”","“Roger!”","Multiple armed police officers rushed over from the surroundings. The two police officers and three armed police officers who were nearby had already rushed over when the fight started. They quickly controlled the event location and evacuated the crowd.","However, there were people purposely causing a commotion, which created an illusion that the event location was very chaotic.","The two groups of people who were fighting shook off their luggage. To make it easier for themselves, the police officers pulled the crowd apart and shouted, “Watch over your luggage! Watch over your wallets! Everyone, step back! Step back!”"]},{"number":3842,"title":"Chapter 3842: Chapter 3841 - 3842: Clean Up The Event Location","paragraphs":["Chapter 3842: Clean Up The Event Location","Editor: Henyee Translations","At this moment, they were worried that someone would steal something during the chaos. Fights over cutting queues were not uncommon. The police and armed police dealt with it in a timely manner. Ye Jian and the rest rushed over to help control the entire event location to prevent the chaos from spreading.","The few pickpockets who had blended into the crowd and were waiting for an opportunity to strike were at the front. They were the ones who caused the most commotion. When they saw that the event location was quickly controlled, they remembered that they didn’t manage to do what they promised. They rolled their eyes and shouted again, “They hit someone! The police hit someone! The police hit someone!”","Ye Jian, who rushed over, immediately stood at the front and blocked the crowd to prevent the other passengers from getting hurt. Suddenly, she heard that someone was maliciously slandering the police. Her gaze was cold as she swept her gaze toward the crowd.","A few skinny but extremely cunning figures squeezed into the crowd, approaching Ye Jian.","This was their chance. They needed to act quickly.","The burly man, who was pulled away by the two police officers, was still cursing in a local accent. His rude and unreasonable behavior made the surrounding passengers move away automatically to avoid being accidentally injured by him.","The passenger who got scolded didn’t make any noise after the armed police pulled him away. However, the person who was rude to him first was still scolding him. The passenger couldn’t take it anymore. With his hands held, he raised his foot and smashed his shoe directly on the burly man’s face.","The brawny man’s face didn’t get hit, but his body got hit.","“F*ck you!” The brawny man was strong. After being hit by the shoe, he shouted and broke free from the two police officers’ control. He rushed toward the passenger who couldn’t take it anymore and retaliated. “Bastard, I’ll beat you to death!”","Two police officers rushed over to catch him. Someone pushed a passenger in front of the two police officers. The burly man took the opportunity to rush in front of the passenger who was being pulled along by the armed police.","Before he could swing his fist, Ye Jian grabbed his wrist and pulled him away quickly.","The burly man who rushed out to beat up the passenger didn’t stop cursing. When he saw that it was a female soldier who was pulling him, he was furious and shouted, “F*ck you! Why are you pulling me instead of them?!” His fist smashed toward Ye Jian’s face.","Ye Jian, who was holding his hand, was almost hit by the burly man’s fist. She tilted her head hurriedly, and his fist brushed past her ear.","The soldiers were here to maintain public order and strengthen the patrolling management; not to be beaten up. A soldier shouted, “What are you doing?!” He reacted, wanting to subdue the burly man quickly.","Ye Jian didn’t give the burly man a chance to attack her again. She pushed the passenger in her other hand to the soldier and grabbed the burly man’s arm. The burly man, who weighed at least 160 kilograms, was thrown over Ye Jian’s shoulder and fell.","Ye Jian pressed the burly man down until he couldn’t move. No matter how the burly man struggled, he couldn’t escape from her grip.","Ye Jian glanced at the crowd and shouted coldly, “Pull them away. If anyone disturbs public order again, please talk to the police in the police car! Let’s see if going home or fighting is more important!”","Some of them were deliberately creating trouble. Someone purposely pushed the other passengers out to block the path of the two police officers so that the burly man could beat up the passenger who was already being subdued.","Someone was causing trouble on purpose. They needed to clean up the event location immediately."]},{"number":3843,"title":"Chapter 3843: Chapter 3842 - 3843: Locked","paragraphs":["Chapter 3843: Locked","Editor: Henyee Translations","After Ye Jian knocked down the burly man who weighed more than 160 kilograms, the surroundings had turned silent. The passengers carrying all kinds of bags stared at Ye Jian as if they were looking at a monster. The burly man and his fellow friends were asked to go to the police car.","They didn’t want to get into a police car and be locked up in the police station. They were just greedy and wanted to create trouble on purpose. They had planned to leave after carrying out their task.","That was what the other party told them. Everyone would get 100 yuan. They would cut in line and fight with other passengers. As long as they didn’t cause anyone to bleed, the police wouldn’t be able to do anything to them.","The police wouldn’t lock them up in the station even if they wanted to!","Also, this female soldier was really f*cking strong. She actually knocked the burly man down. He was even heavier than her. She placed one arm behind his back and pressed him until he couldn’t move. As he didn’t want to suffer any further injuries, he immediately surrendered.","It was all thanks to Ye Jian’s move that the brawny man and the few people who cut the queue were now standing obediently. They didn’t dare to shout at her anymore.","The fight had caused a huge commotion. The police didn’t let go of the people who jumped the queue so easily. They brought them to the side to receive criticism and lessons.","Fortunately, the group of harassers was controlled in time and the matter didn’t escalate. If not, the people who took the initiative to attack and those who had no choice but to retaliate wouldn’t be able to go home safely.","This was the biggest commotion Ye Jian encountered while carrying out her mission. It also shocked a few people in the crowd who were looking around for an opportunity to attack.","As the police brought the passengers who cut the line and started fighting away from the event location, the entire station regained its order. At this moment, no one dared to casually cut queues anymore. They all lined up under the guidance of the armed police.","“What should we do? Boss, I’m afraid we can’t handle this woman. We haven’t even done anything and we’ve already f*cked it up!”","“It’s not easy. This is gonna be troublesome. We didn’t have the chance to attack just now. Now that everyone has dispersed, we won’t have the chance to attack anymore. Boss, how do we report this to Brother Hua?”","“What’s so hard about it? They’re still clearing the area. We must please Brother Hua today. Let’s go!”","The fellow who was called ‘Boss’ by the three pickpockets threw away the cigarette butt in his hand and walked toward Ye Jian, who was still instructing the passengers to line up.","Ye Jian was ordering the passengers to line up in an orderly manner with one hand and holding a walkie-talkie in the other. The police officer in the control center was talking to Ye Jian in a low voice. “Look around. Check the identity card of the passengers who need help and verify the information on their bus tickets. Then, tell the passengers where they can take the bus.”","The control center had been monitoring the entire fight through the surveillance cameras. When Ye Jian said that someone deliberately caused trouble and took advantage of the chaos to push the passengers out, the control center immediately focused on replaying the moment the passengers were pushed out.","As expected, when they looked back, they saw two people taking advantage of the chaos to push the passengers out and move closer to the female soldier.","As for the conversation with Ye Jian, it sounded normal to the passengers. Only Ye Jian knew what it meant. ‘Look around. If you see any suspicious people, use the excuse of checking their identity cards and ticket information to bring them away from the event location before subduing them.’","This was what the control center meant.","Ye Jian replied, “Roger that.” At this moment, the police in the control center had already locked onto the two suspects who purposely pushed the passengers out.","“Two passengers who needed help just now are five meters behind you. Please cooperate,” the police officer reminded Ye Jian that the two suspects had appeared and their target might be her.","That was because their gazes were fixed on the female soldier who was maintaining order."]},{"number":3844,"title":"Chapter 3844: Chapter 3843 - 3844: Overconfidence","paragraphs":["Chapter 3844: Overconfidence","Editor: Henyee Translations","Only Ye Jian could understand these words. The passengers who were beside her heard what the police officer said clearly, but they only understood the literal meaning. They wouldn’t think too much about it.","When Ye Jian heard this, she quietly helped a passenger to pick up the luggage. She tilted her body slightly. When her gaze met the gazes of the two young men who were less than two meters away from her, she already knew who the suspects were without the police’s reminder.","“Roger that. I’ll go over immediately.”","Ye Jian held the walkie-talkie horizontally and answered the command center. She made a turn and sped up slightly. She seemed to be handling things on the walkie-talkie and didn’t have the time to care about her surroundings.","The two young men who were getting closer and closer to Ye Jian saw that the person they were staring at seemed to have something urgent to deal with. Their expressions changed slightly as they increased their pace to chase after her.","“Damn it, hurry up and catch up with her. Don’t let her escape.”","“We let her escape last time. We can’t let her escape this time!”","The two of them rushed toward Ye Jian directly. Very soon, the control center discovered two young men who were secretly approaching Ye Jian from the side. Then, Ye Jian received a reminder from the control center again.","“There are two passengers who look like they need urgent help. We need to confirm them carefully.”","“Roger that.” Ye Jian kept walking in a straight line, trying her best to go to a place where the people had evacuated. Now, there were passengers everywhere. Compared to the last time when she got off the train...","Suddenly, Ye Jian stopped in her tracks. She felt that she knew why someone was targeting her.","“I suspect that this group of people is from the same group of people that I met on the train last time...” Ye Jian told the police officer the date of her arrival in Nanguang. She didn’t explain what happened that day in detail. She didn’t have the time to explain so much. There must be someone in the control center who knew about it.","As expected, when Ye Jian mentioned that day on the train and at the square of the Nanguang Train Station, the policeman on duty at the control center immediately reacted. “She’s right. It might be the same group of people!”","“The last time, they didn’t succeed in taking revenge. This time, the female student is on duty at the train station. They might recognize her, and it’s possible this is their second attempt at revenge.”","The person on duty tonight was the captain of third squadron of the police station. Hearing that, he quickly locked onto the key point and said in a low voice, “That means that a few escaped the net last time. Moreover, they’ve been moving in secret. They were at the scene that day!","“Let’s subdue the four suspects first before secretly investigating where their boss is.”","They didn’t ask Ye Jian to act. If Ye Jian acted now, she would undoubtedly alert the boss hiding in the dark. Hence, after walking in a straight line, Ye Jian turned left and went to the bathroom on the second floor below the square.","There were fewer passengers on the second floor than in the square. Most of them were traveling in the evening or at night. At this moment, they were sleeping on the second floor to shelter themselves from the wind.","Ye Jian went down the stairs and walked toward the bathroom. When the four young men saw this, they couldn’t help but laugh.","As it turned out, she did have something urgent to deal with. That was good!","Coincidentally, there was an orange plastic maintenance sign at the bathroom door of the men’s and women’s bathrooms on the second floor. Some passengers needed to go to the bathroom and saw the word ‘maintenance’, so they went to find another bathroom."]},{"number":3845,"title":"Chapter 3845: Punish Her Badly","paragraphs":["Chapter 3845: Punish Her Badly","Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Ye Jian went in. The two workers in charge of maintenance came out of the bathroom with tools in their hands. They even asked the cleaning lady at the door to go with them to get some tools.","There was no one at the door and no passengers inside. The four young men looked around with their hands in their pockets before walking toward the bathroom.","In front of the sink in the middle of the men’s and women’s bathroom, the young man known as the boss whispered to the leanest one among the four of them, “Guard the bathroom and don’t let anyone in.”","They needed someone to keep watch. If he found anything, he would be able to inform them immediately. This was the vigilance of the pickpockets. They were used to working together like this.","The lean man in charge of keeping watch nodded and pretended to stand in front of the maintenance sign after washing his hands. When two passengers walked over, he didn’t speak. He pointed at the maintenance sign with his finger before then pointing to the other side. He meant to say that this bathroom could not be used and that they should go to the bathroom opposite.","The other three men had already rushed into the female bathroom.","Ye Jian purposely walked to the end of the bathroom and waited for them for two minutes. If the control center hadn’t told her that the four of them were at the sink outside, she would have thought that they didn’t follow her.","When she heard footsteps, she immediately stepped on the flushing valve. The sound of rushing water was heard by the three people who came in to look for her. They ran in the direction the sound came from.","At the same time, they took out the five-centimeter-long sharp knives that they had been hiding in their arms.","The moment the cubicle door opened, they ran over and stabbed Ye Jian with their knives. Ye Jian, who specially waited for them to arrive before opening the door, was already prepared.","They weren’t the ones who wanted to catch her. She was the one who wanted to catch them.","A cold light flashed past her eyes. Ye Jian grabbed the wrist of the pickpocket on her right with one hand. The other pickpocket, who was hiding on the other side and raising his knife, was pushed into the toilet by Ye Jian’s other hand. The man had used a huge force to try and stab her. When Ye Jian pushed him, he lost his balance and fell into the toilet...","As for the person in front, it was easier to deal with him. She raised her leg and kicked him, flinging him off to the side.","“Don’t move. Behave yourself!”","A few cubicle doors that were closed and labeled with signs that read ‘this one is broken’ were opened. Armed police officers rushed out from their positions and caught the three pickpockets who tried to sneak an attack on Ye Jian in the female bathroom at their fastest speed.","The three confident pickpockets only managed to flash their sharp knives once before they were mercilessly attacked. They didn’t even have the chance to shout and alert anyone before their mouths were gagged.","Not only were their mouths blocked, but they were also pressed into the dirty, smelly, and nauseating toilets!","Half of their faces were pressed against the toilets, and their noses were only two or three centimeters away from the toilet bowls. The guy who was called ‘boss’ couldn’t help but vomit.","When Ye Jian heard the sound of vomiting, she couldn’t help but shudder. To be honest, it was quite disgusting to have one’s entire face pressed into the toilet.","However, it had nothing to do with her.","The person outside didn’t know that they had already lost. When he saw Ye Jian walking out of the female bathroom, the man was stunned for a moment. Then... Ye Jian glanced at him and suddenly turned around to return to the female bathroom.","The stunned man seemed to have realized something. He raised his leg and rushed into the female bathroom.","He thought that his partners couldn’t find Ye Jian!"]},{"number":3846,"title":"Chapter 3846: That’s Not Simple","paragraphs":["Chapter 3846: That’s Not Simple","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian showed her face and suddenly turned around to lure the other party into her trap. Now that he had been baited, it was easy to deal with him!","The four of them were silently taken care of in the female bathroom. Ye Jian, who had changed out of her military attire, wore the black windbreaker and hat of a female inspector from the control center. She walked out of the bathroom and rushed to the control center of the train station.","She needed to look through the surveillance footage in the control center to see if she could find the biggest fish that escaped the net.","This wasn’t Ye Jian’s first time finding someone from the countless surveillance cameras in the control center. That year, she helped the Southern Province police to find the suspect through the surveillance cameras of the traffic police unit. This time, she had to find the suspect through the surveillance cameras too.","There was no need to search on a large scale. They just needed to find Ye Jian’s position, the time period, and locate a few cameras nearby. Although there was no need to search on a large scale, it would definitely take some time.","“Are you sure... you want to do this? Can you really find anything like this?” The police officer pulled out the footage from three surveillance cameras for Ye Jian at the same time. He asked the female student beside him, “Can you really find the suspect?”","Ye Jian, who had her eyes on the screen, had already entered work mode. Hearing that, she nodded slightly. “Yes. You can go ahead and do your work. I’ll do this myself.”","“Ah... Okay, if you have any questions, you can ask us at any time.” The policeman silently retracted his right hand from the mouse and walked to the captain of the third squadron. He started speaking softly.","“She said that there’s no problem even though footage from three cameras are playing at the same time?” The commander of the third squadron couldn’t believe his ears. He even dug his ears to confirm. “Did she really say that?”","“Yes, I’ve already confirmed it a few times. Look, she’s already watching the footage.”","...","The captain of the third squadron, who was silent for a while, finally swallowed his saliva and said calmly, “That’s all for now. Lock everyone up and interrogate them.","“As for her... Hmm, let her handle it herself. This female student is quite powerful, so... we have to believe her.”","The captain of the third squadron said that they needed to believe her, but he didn’t really believe in her himself.","Whether they could find the big boss hiding in the dark... Based on her method of searching, he didn’t have much hope.","How could one person watch three videos at the same time?","It would only be an effective search if three people watched three videos at three times the playback speed.","The captain of the third squadron didn’t say much. He asked the police officers below him to busy themselves with their work. They would be in charge of finding the ‘big fish’.","Approximately four hours later, when a man carrying a denim backpack appeared on the screen, Ye Jian immediately pressed the pause button. She said to the captain of the third squadron, who was handling matters beside her, “I have an impression of this person.”","“That fast? Are you sure?!”","He didn’t believe that Ye Jian would be able to find the big boss, so he had been prepared to stay up all night. Hearing that, he raised his head abruptly and stared at Ye Jian. Then, he said word by word, “Are you sure that you’ve locked onto the suspect?”","She watched three videos at the same time at three times the playback speed. And she really found the suspect!","For a moment, the captain of the third squadron wondered if he was too old or if... his police station was filled with ordinary police officers!"]},{"number":3847,"title":"Chapter 3847: How Are You, Captain Xia","paragraphs":["Chapter 3847: How Are You, Captain Xia","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian didn’t hesitate and replied firmly, “I’m sure. That day, I met him on the train. Right on the heels of that, I got sneak attacked when I got off the train. Today, after he appeared, I was targeted by those pickpockets wanting to take revenge. He’s the most suspicious!”","“Lock onto this person first!” The captain of the third squadron immediately gave the order and started searching for the man through all the cameras in the train station.","Unfortunately, the man was no longer at the train station. An hour after the four pickpockets were caught, the man left the train station vigilantly.","However, since the man’s appearance was confirmed, it was much easier to capture him.","The next morning, at 7:30 am, Ye Jian found out that the man was caught in a hotel. When he was caught, they found several wallets in his room. There was a large amount of cash. As for the huge denim backpack he was carrying, there were just some dolls of various sizes.","When Ding Ling found out about it, she remembered the time when she was hit by the suspect’s denim backpack. Realization dawned on her. “So that’s why it didn’t hurt at all when I was hit by his backpack. As it turns out, it was filled with dolls!”","That night, the suspect boldly entered the train carriage where the students were sitting. He did it for no other reason than to see what the female student looked like.","Ye Jian’s sneak attack was only possible because he remembered her appearance.","The suspect was directly brought to the police station. Interrogating him was out of Ye Jian’s job scope. Ye Jian, who was standing guard, didn’t want to ask about the follow-up. Her mission was to stand at the last post of Class One today.","It was not until 7:00 pm on New Year’s Eve that the entire train station gradually became empty. Ye Jian and the others could only rest at 11:00 pm.","They didn’t rest in the train station. The whistle blew, and the three teams that were assigned to the train station immediately lined up. Without informing the police, they left in the vehicles prepared.","The armed police knew about it and had already wished them a happy new year in advance. After Ye Jian and the rest returned to the team, the police and the armed police only knew that her codename was ‘No. 1’. They didn’t know her name.","When the students returned to the camp, it was already past one in the morning. The comrades from the cooking team had prepared a sumptuous dinner. Although they missed the festivities because of their mission, the students were still very happy. At one in the morning, they all ate their dinner in the cafeteria.","A new year had arrived. Ye Jian stood quietly on the roof of the barracks. She was holding her cell phone that was getting hot. She looked into the distance. That was the direction of the city. The lights lit up half of the night sky. Everyone was reunited there. They were laughing and enjoying the best festival of the year.","Ye Jian clicked on her cell phone and entered the message box. She opened the message that was filled with love and read the hundred-word message that she had already memorized.","[Captain Xia, Happy New Year.]","Ye Jian smiled gently. ‘Happy New Year, Captain Xia. We’re a few days away from an entire year of not seeing each other. How are you?","‘I’m fine. You don’t have to worry about me. I’ve gotten used to the life outside and the life in the company. I won’t be as unsociable as before. I won’t be a loner.’"]},{"number":3848,"title":"Chapter 3848: I’m Good, What About You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3848: I’m Good, What About You","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian, who was holding her cell phone, missed her boyfriend even more when she heard the sounds of firecrackers and fireworks.","Her nose was a little stuffy. She took a deep breath to get rid of the bitterness in her heart. Then, she began muttering to herself.","“Don’t worry about me. Take good care of yourself and protect yourself. Please think about me occasionally. Don’t forget what I look like after not seeing me for a year. If that happens, I’ll be very sad.","“However, I believe that you won’t forget me. You love me so much. How can you forget me?","“I believe that you miss me too despite being far away. You must also want to return to the country as soon as possible so that you can meet me, right?","“You’re far away, but I’ll wait for you here. I hope that everything will be fine. I’ll wait for you to come back.”","Fireworks were blooming in the distance. They seemed to have heard Ye Jian’s wish and bloomed into the sky one after another, looking resplendent in the night sky. The firecrackers marked the new year, telling the world that a new year had arrived. New hope was here.","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing on the deck of a boat, looked at the fireworks on the other side of the river. The colorful fireworks reflected in his deep black eyes. Countless lights flickered, hiding the longing in the depths of his eyes.","It was another new year. He was only a river away from his country. This was the first time in the past year he was close to the borders of his country.","The sound of firecrackers and fireworks were majestic. It was a prosperous scene.","He wondered what his lover was doing at this moment. Was she accompanying the old man in the capital city? Or was she in the military unit?","She was in her third year, and it was time for her to be sent to the grassroots company to study. The possibility of her going back to the capital city to accompany the old man for the new year wasn’t high. She would probably be sent to the company.","He didn’t know if his little fox, who was sent to the company, was getting along well with the other soldiers. She should be able to forge harmonious friendships now. His little fox had grown up and become more outgoing. She wasn’t as cold as when she was young.","She was smart and capable. She would definitely rely on her ability to create her own path wherever she went.","“Hey, Xia, what are you doing? Why aren’t you going in to drink with the pretty ladies?”","He heard staggering footsteps behind him. From the sound of the footsteps, he knew that the person who spoke was pissed drunk from his slurred speech. Xia Jinyuan had to listen carefully to know what he was saying.","Xia Jinyuan turned around and saw Luke, who was talking to him. While walking, he suddenly fell forward. Xia Jinyuan quickly grabbed him and said calmly, “You’re drunk, Luke.”","“Oh, yes, I’m drunk. There are so many beauties and so many good drinks. Burp...” The drunk Luke burped heavily as he spoke. Xia Jinyuan smelled the alcohol and pushed the drunk man to the side with a look of disdain. He needed fresh air.","“Hahaha, don’t hide. Xia, do you like men? Hahaha, come on, Xia, I like both men and women. Since we’re friends, I don’t mind sleeping with you...”","Holding a half-empty bottle of whiskey in his hand, Luke smiled lewdly and pounced on Xia Jinyuan.","He didn’t like men. He was just talking nonsense because he was drunk.","“Luke, do you know which river our boat is sailing on?” Xia Jinyuan dodged, avoiding Luke’s lunge. The cold river breeze was filled with the smell of alcohol. Xia Jinyuan felt like vomiting when he smelled it.","He didn’t have the habit of smoking and drinking. Even when he was with these people, he never made an exception."]},{"number":3849,"title":"Chapter 3849: So Wet","paragraphs":["Chapter 3849: So Wet","Editor: Henyee Translations","When Luke asked him why he didn’t drink, Xia Jinyuan took off his shirt and revealed the bullet wound on his back. Luke understood that he had almost died from drinking.","There were many scars on Xia Jinyuan’s body. Every wound represented a medal. When Luke saw his body, he was shocked by the scars on it.","From then on, Luke stopped asking Xia Jinyuan why he didn’t drink or smoke. Now, he was used to Xia Jinyuan’s self-discipline.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t smoke or drink, and he didn’t like beautiful ladies. Luke pounced over and fell on the deck. He didn’t get up and just laid there with his limbs spread out. He kept muttering, “No, no, no. I don’t want to know what will happen tomorrow at all. I only know that... Xia, you’re a very boring fellow. Besides money and killing people, you really don’t like anything else.","“You’re so boring. I’ve seen the priests in the church, and they’re not as disciplined as you. You’re not interested in anything.”","“You like to drink, smoke, and flirt with women. I like money and killing people. It’s just that my hobbies are different. You can get up now, Luke. The Mekong River is below us. If you fall, I don’t think anyone will jump into the cold river to save a drunkard.”","Xia Jinyuan kicked the drunk Luke. When he kicked him a second time, Luke was half-awake. He opened his eyes lazily and asked, “I think I heard gunshots. Oh, damn it, why can I still hear gunshots? Tell them, Xia, tell them to scram farther away. If they disturb me, I’ll let them all see God.","“Oh, damn it, did I wet my pants? Why are my pants so wet?”","He didn’t wet his pants. The half-empty bottle of whiskey in his hand had fallen toward his thigh. The remaining contents of the bottle poured out. It looked like he wet his pants.","Xia Jinyuan kicked the bottle that was now empty. After a series of clangs, the bottle was kicked to the edge of the deck. He had exerted a little too much force.","He lowered his head and looked coldly at Luke, who was lying on the deck like a fool. “You peed your pants. I don’t want the pretty ladies to see you like this. I suggest that you get up immediately and change your pants.”","“No, I can’t get up. There are gunshots. We need to hide!” Like a fool, Luke waved his hands. From his drunken appearance, one couldn’t tell that he was a bodyguard whose hands were stained with blood.","The sound of firecrackers on the other side of the river welcomed the arrival of the new year. However, Luke, who was drunk, thought he was hearing gunshots.","The sound of firecrackers did sound like gunshots.","“You’re hearing the sound of firecrackers.” Xia Jinyuan kicked him again. “Get up, Luke. If you don’t, I’ll throw you into the river so that the cold water will wake you up.”","“No, I can’t get up. Those are gunshots. I’m all too familiar with the sounds! Xia, hurry up and teach them a lesson. Let them go to hell.”","Luke, who was completely drunk, started to act like a drunkard. He laid on the cold deck and refused to get up. The veins on Xia Jinyuan’s forehead were twitching.","When talking to a drunkard, the person who was angered would always be the sober one.","Xia Jinyuan ignored the fool. But he didn’t return to the cabin to join the crazy party inside.","This was a small-scale cruise ship controlled by the Myanmar mafia. Those who could come up were all people who came to find excitement. Each and every one of them had killed people before."]},{"number":3850,"title":"Chapter 3850: Luxury","paragraphs":["Chapter 3850: Luxury","Editor: Henyee Translations","Today, Cobra had a business meeting with the boss of the Burmese mafia. After the meeting, the boss invited Cobra to the cruise ship to have fun. Cobra’s subordinates naturally followed him.","The soundproofing of the cruise ship was quite good. No matter how loud the heavy metal music was inside, it couldn’t reach the outside of the deck. The scantily-dressed women swayed their waists as they followed the music and pestered the men who could give them a lot of money. They laughed with the guests, and even when their bodies were groped, their laughter still sounded so happy.","This was a booze-filled extravagant cruise ship filled with money and desire.","Xia Jinyuan had never shown his face since he stepped on this cruise ship. Only Luke had managed to find him. Of course, there was also Cobra, who was having fun with many top beauties on the ship.","The closed door opened, and a few men walked out unsteadily. They kissed the woman on their right and then the beautiful woman on their left. They laughed all the way to the deck of the second-floor cabin.","The men laughed heartily while the women laughed along with their sugar daddies. Both parties were satisfied with their consensual sex deal.","A black man noticed Xia Jinyuan standing in front of the deck below. He was too drunk to notice him immediately. He narrowed his eyes and looked at him for a while. Then, he turned his head and said vaguely to a man who was flirting with a woman who had her arms around him, “Look at that fellow. Isn’t he that annoying person?”","“Let’s see if it’s him. He’s the one guy who keeps annoying us.”","“I think it’s him. Xia, I remember now. He’s Xia. He has a good relationship with Luke. Hiccup... He’s someone that Mr. Cobra admires.”","“That’s enough, buddy. There’s no need for us to talk about that fellow on such a happy night. I still prefer chatting with beautiful women... Look, this is a woman with big breasts. Hahaha, I like women with big breasts!”","A few men were doing unrestrained things on the deck of the cabin on the second floor. From time to time, they would take out a few colorful bills from their pockets and stuff them in the women’s chests. They laughed even more unrestrainedly.","The black man who saw Xia Jinyuan first took out a stack of banknotes from his pocket. He waved his hand,and the sound of the banknotes caused the two women who were wearing shorts to look at the stack of banknotes. Their chests were exposed to the cold wind. They smiled as they looked at the stack of cash.","They needed money. They needed a lot of money to satisfy their desires, and these men could satisfy their needs for money.","The man who was waving the banknotes pointed to the front and said loudly, “Babies, if you can drag in that fellow outside or strip him of his clothes, this stack of US dollars will be yours.”","The black man, whose skin was so dark that it merged with the night sky, smiled maliciously, revealing his bright white teeth. “If you don’t complete the mission according to my requirements, you have to jump down from the ship. How about it? Do you dare to give it a try?”","The stack of banknotes was thick enough. As the wind blew, the banknotes made crisp sounds. Two women nodded and agreed without hesitation. However, the prerequisite was that the women could only take half of the money first. As for the other half, they could take it when they came back.","The man who was using money to tempt the ladies laughed loudly. There were a total of four men and eight women. In the end, they only hugged one woman each and let the other four women carry out the mission."]},{"number":3851,"title":"Chapter 3851: Dirty Things","paragraphs":["Chapter 3851: Dirty Things","Editor: Henyee Translations","Asian. He was a very powerful Asian man. He was someone that Cobra had a whole new level of respect for and wanted to promote. He was an eyesore.","He didn’t like smoking, he didn’t like drinking, and he didn’t even like women. Hahaha, maybe this guy really did suffer from a ‘deficiency’ as they thought.","Hahaha, was a man still considered a man if he was impotent?","They would see if he was a man tonight!","Xia Jinyuan had already heard the commotion behind him. The unrestrained laughter of the men and women was blown away by the river wind, leaving only faint sounds in his ears.","Luke, who was by his feet, was so drunk that he started snoring. He was so drunk that he couldn’t tell if he was lying on the bed or the deck. It was very cold. Luke curled up like a pangolin to warm himself.","The smell of alcohol wafted over from the river breeze. The sound of high heels could be heard.","Xia Jinyuan turned around and looked at the four black figures walking over from the deck. Then, he looked at Luke, who was sleeping soundly. With his hands in his pockets, he raised his hand and walked to the other side of the deck.","“Damn it, I’m...”","The drunk Luke suddenly cursed. Then, he said something that made Xia Jinyuan stop in his tracks. He turned around quickly, bent down, and covered his mouth.","“Ugh... Damn it, you filthy things. My brothers... Wait for me to come back. My brothers, wait for me to come back...”","His voice got softer and softer until it gradually disappeared, but Luke started crying. He was crying softly. He was as sad as a child.","Xia Jinyuan bent down and looked at Luke, who was crying in his dream. His gaze gradually became complicated, and there was a hint of probing. If he didn’t hear wrongly just now, Luke had spoken in... Russian, and he mentioned the name of a Russian... special forces unit.","He didn’t understand the rest of the words. He wasn’t proficient in Russian, so he didn’t know what Luke said.","With a complicated look in his eyes, Xia Jinyuan didn’t leave. He knelt on one knee and picked up the drunkard with one hand. The drunkard was a little heavy, so Xia Jinyuan had to exert some strength to help him up.","“Luke, you need to lie back on the bed and sleep. If you drink again in the future, I won’t take care of you like this anymore. Do you understand?”","Xia Jinyuan helped the drunk man up. He didn’t even have the energy to walk anymore. He returned to the cabin on the first floor with much effort.","The four women who walked over ran over in their high heels, blocking Xia Jinyuan and the drunk Luke’s path.","On the deck of the second floor, the four men, who were watching a good show, laughed loudly. They put a hand to their mouths and blew sharp and light whistles.","“Babies, he’s yours tonight, and the money is yours too!”","They raised their hands like trumpets and shouted at the four ladies, “Think about the money in our hands. You’ll only get it if you sleep with that impotent man. Hahaha, let’s go, babies!”","Their voices were very loud. Even though they were a few meters apart, Xia Jinyuan could hear them clearly. Among these four people, two of them were the bodyguards who Cobra was most proud of. Many very important tasks were handed over to them to complete. They had done many things like murder and arson.","They had already disliked him for a long time. They always wanted to find trouble with him and wondered if they could get rid of him. Unfortunately, they didn’t have the chance to do so until now."]},{"number":3852,"title":"Chapter 3852: Teasing","paragraphs":["Chapter 3852: Teasing","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan finally managed to sneak to Cobra’s side. Seeing that he was getting closer and closer to the Cobra, he wouldn’t leave any trail behind for the two people who wanted to get rid of him.","He didn’t argue or kick up a fuss. He just stood at the side quietly. When he was needed, he would do whatever Cobra asked him to do. The more Cobra trusted him, the more they were worried that their position in Cobra’s heart would be lost. In the past two months, they had been secretly pulling cheap tricks on him.","They asked the four women to come over because they wanted to see Xia Jinyuan make a fool of himself.","Xia Jinyuan, who still needed to support the drunk Luke, looked at the four Myanmar ladies and said calmly, “Up above is where you should go. Please move aside.”","The four ladies hesitated. They wanted money, but the man in front of them wasn’t interested in them. He didn’t look like someone they could provoke...","“Do you want money?” Xia Jinyuan asked them. Before they could reply, he said calmly, “Wait a moment.”","He placed the drunk Luke back on the deck and started searching through his clothes and pockets. Soon, a few stacks of colorful notes were in his hands. They were so new that they made a crisp sound.","He took out a stack and handed it over. “Can I leave now?”","The four scantily-dressed ladies came here for money. Now, they were able to get a stack of banknotes effortlessly. After receiving it, they winked and threw kisses at him... They even wanted to tease the generous guest.","The generous guest bent down with his back facing them. Xia Jinyuan helped Luke, who was still sleeping on the deck, up.","Xia Jinyuan used his back to block their winks and flying kisses.","What a boring man. The four ladies who were trying to flirt with the ‘blind’ man pursed their lips. Turning around, they swayed their hips and ignored Xia Jinyuan.","Impotent? Hahaha, it seemed that he truly was impotent!","“Let’s go, let’s go. He’s such a boring man. Let’s not waste our time.”","“He’s tall, but if he’s really impotent, so what? Hehehe... HE can’t do anything.” One of the women laughed mockingly.","“It doesn’t matter if we can’t do anything. We just need money.”","“Yes, we just need to get the money. What does his impotence have to do with us? It should be something his future wife should worry about.”","The four women left while swaying their hips. The smell of their perfumes didn’t linger as the river breeze carried it away. Only the slightly salty river breeze continued blowing, bringing with it a chill that made people’s spirits rise.","Xia Jinyuan helped Luke back to the cabin and ignored the few people who were trying to cause trouble. As long as he remained patient, no matter how much they disliked him, they could only bear with it.","However, the fate of the four ladies was a little tragic. They went back after receiving the money. Before they could smile, however, they were welcomed by the kicks and punches from the four men.","The other four ladies who stayed behind were so frightened that their faces turned pale. They screamed and hid in a corner on the deck. They watched as their companions were beaten, scolded, and kicked by the four men. Besides screaming, they couldn’t do anything else.","These people were already drunk. They didn’t manage to make a fool out of Xia Jinyuan, so they vented their anger on the four ladies. They cursed loudly, and their fists landed on the four women who were screaming in pain.","One of the four escorts was hit until her internal organs bled. She wasn’t saved in time and died on the spot."]},{"number":3853,"title":"Chapter 3853: Dude","paragraphs":["Chapter 3853: Dude","Editor: Henyee Translations","The four men were very arrogant. They were indifferent to life. After discovering the death of that woman, they lifted her and threw her into the Mekong River. The turbulent Mekong River water swallowed the woman who died because of money. She disappeared in the blink of an eye.","There was still a faint smell of blood in the air. The four men, who were tired from the beating, cursed and left the three ladies. They had also been beaten until their bones were fractured. They hugged the four other ladies who were trembling in fear. Together, they left the event location. Inside the ship, there was a new round of celebration going on.","Xia Jinyuan only found out about last night’s events the next morning. Luke was sitting by the bed. He seemed to have indulged himself too much last night, judging by how bad his hangover was. Even his eyelids were drooping. He didn’t have any energy.","Xia Jinyuan passed the milk and bread in his hand to Luke and sat on a small chair at the side. He placed his slender and straight legs on the side of the narrow bed and looked at him calmly. “I don’t like to serve a drunkard who can’t even distinguish the sounds of gunshots and firecrackers. I hope that this won’t happen again.”","“God, I just heard those bastards beat up a party girl to death and threw that poor woman into the cold river. Is that true? If it’s true, God, that’s very unfortunate news.”","Luke finished his milk in one gulp and changed the topic to other people’s matters with an exaggerated and stiff expression. He said regretfully, “Poor woman.”","“Don’t change the topic, Luke. You drank too much last night and said a few sentences... in a foreign language.” Xia Jinyuan looked at him and caught the subtle expressions on Luke’s face.","The moment Luke heard that he had spoken in an unfamiliar language, his eyes stopped moving for three seconds. Then, his eyelashes trembled slightly. He looked up with a smile. “An unfamiliar language? It’s just the nonsense of a drunkard. Don’t worry, my friend.”","“Didn’t they kick up a fuss? Those guys even beat a woman to death. Ha, these fellows like to cause trouble for Mr. Cobra wherever they go and give him a headache.”","The subtle changes on his face allowed Xia Jinyuan to know that what he said made Luke feel at ease. The Signal Flag of the special forces... It was a special forces unit that wore a mysterious veil. They were mainly involved in secret activities outside Russia.","The most famous battle was in 1993. A group of terrorists hijacked a nuclear-powered ship. The special forces received orders to rush over and secretly approached the nuclear-powered ship. The frogmen used a special method to sneak to the sides of the ship and take down the terrorists on the ship at a fast speed. Then, a few airborne soldiers with wind speeds of 15 meters per second descended from the sky and surrounded the hijacked nuclear-powered ship. They successfully countered the act of terrorism.","This battle was the only time the Russian Signal Flag special forces unit appeared in the past ten years. After that, there was no more news of the Signal Flag. That was, there was no more international news about the Signal Flag.","Obviously, this rumor was wrong.","It wasn’t that the Signal Flag no longer existed. It was just that they were continuing to work hard for the defense of Russia in a more subtle way.","As for Luke...","It was very likely that he was a member of the special forces.","Was it possible for a member of the special forces to hide beside Cobra for five years?","Xia Jinyuan didn’t immediately ask for Luke’s identity because he heard the drunk Luke mutter about the Signal Flag last night. Who knew if the other party was just testing him again?","However, he didn’t believe that Luke had nothing to do with the special forces.","When he was drunk, Luke looked just like a child. Xia Jinyuan was all too familiar with the emotions in his cries."]},{"number":3854,"title":"Chapter 3854: Friend Or Foe","paragraphs":["Chapter 3854: Friend Or Foe","Editor: Henyee Translations","As Luke cried, Xia Jinyuan thought of his comrades who sacrificed. He thought of J5, who fell into his arms that year and his body temperature gradually turned cold.","His comrade was sacrificed in front of him, but he was helpless and could only watch as his comrade passed away. Xia Jinyuan held back the tears, but he could still feel the sorrow in his heart.","As one of the sharp swords of Russia’s anti-terrorist mission, the Signal Flag was just like the Xueyu unit. They were hidden from the public as they swore to protect their country forever.","Last night, had Luke been crying over his comrade who was sacrificed? Was the Russian Signal Flag targeting Cobra too?","Had so many parties infiltrated Cobra’s underground forces?","If Luke was really a member of the Russian special forces, then what Xia Jinyuan needed to do next... was to confirm Luke’s identity.","It was very risky to confirm Luke’s identity. He needed to consider it carefully.","Moreover, even if he confirmed Luke’s identity, it didn’t mean that the two of them could become allies. If it was for the benefit of their country, they might become enemies tomorrow.","The disadvantages were greater than the advantages. He had to be careful.","While Xia Jinyuan was thinking quickly, waves were crashing on the shore in Luke’s heart. He knew that he drank a lot last night, but he really couldn’t remember what he said.","Did he really say something? Did he speak his mother tongue?","Impossible!","He had undergone deep hypnosis. Through special psychological hypnosis, his mother tongue became his second language. Even if he was drunk last night, he couldn’t have spoken in his mother tongue.","However, Xia was a very honest man. He said that he spoke a language that he didn’t understand. It was very likely that... he really spoke in Russian.","Now, there was only one big problem—Did Xia understand what he said?","The emotions in Luke’s heart fluctuated. He lowered his eyes slightly. He needed to think of a way. If... Luke pursed his lips. If that was really the case, then he could not let Xia stick around regardless of how much he admired him. He would feel sorry if he had to resort to that too.","He hoped that the man he admired didn’t know what he said.","Xia Jinyuan, who was paying close attention to Luke, looked away calmly. There was no need for him to deliberately confirm Luke’s identity. If Luke was really a member of the Russian special forces, he would be even more impatient than him.","Xia Jinyuan smiled slightly. In that case, he would wait for Luke’s next move.","“Cobra is indeed having a headache now. The woman they beat to death and threw into the Mekong River is often around Qin Maosheng. She’s highly valued by him. Now that she’s been beaten to death, Cobra needs to give Qin Maosheng an explanation. The cruise ship is preparing to reach the shore. We’ll discuss how to solve the problem when we reach the shore.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the cruise ship seemed to have bumped into something. After bumping, it bounced back again. Then, it slowly stopped... The cruise ship had reached the shore. The night’s celebration was over. It was time to even the score.","Xia Jinyuan retracted his slender legs and stood up. “Alright, drunkard, you can wash your face and change your clothes. It’s time for us to go ashore.”","The hungover Luke still had a headache. He was dizzy and uncomfortable. Frowning, he pressed his forehead with his palms and said in a low voice, “Okay, I still need to wash my face. Damn it, the hangover is so uncomfortable. I hope Cobra will be in a good mood later.”"]},{"number":3855,"title":"Chapter 3855: Closest","paragraphs":["Chapter 3855: Closest","Editor: Henyee Translations","“In that case, you’ll be very disappointed. Mr. Cobra isn’t in a good mood. On the contrary, he’s in a very bad mood now.” Xia Jinyuan stopped at the door and leaned forward slightly. He said calmly to Luke, “However, we don’t have to worry about Cobra’s bad mood. The ones who should be worried are the four of them.”","“If Cobra is in a bad mood, all of us are in for a hard time,” said Luke in a low voice. Then, he stood up and cleaned himself up.","Smelling his collar, Luke almost vomited from disgust. As he lowered his head and tidied his belt, his fingers froze. Damn it, did he wet his pants last night?","Last night was really his worst drunken episode. What happened last night couldn’t happen again.","The people on the cruise ship were almost all gone. Xia Jinyuan didn’t wait for Luke on the ship. He stood on the shore and looked at the scenery of the Golden Triangle at the Mekong River while waiting for Luke.","When Luke walked out of the cabin of the cruise ship and saw the scenery in front of him, his expression changed instantly. His facial expression was so stern and cold that it contained a metallic killing intent. In just a short moment, Luke smiled again. The killing intent was like an illusion.","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing on the shore, waved at him, indicating that he should hurry up and come down. Luke closed his eyes lightly before walking out of the cruise ship.","Cobra’s anger didn’t affect Luke and Xia Jinyuan. However, because of the other four people, Luke and Xia Jinyuan had no choice but to face the problem of giving Qin Maosheng an explanation.","Luke walked out of the wooden house and walked to Xia Jinyuan, who was standing outside and keeping watch. His expression was a little cold as he said, “They caused trouble last night. Now, we need to help them solve it. Those damned things, sometimes I really want to shoot them!”","Everyone had followed Cobra into the depths of the primeval forest at the border of Myanmar, Thailand, and China. It was the closest to Thailand and the farthest away from China. It took more than three hours to drive in.","This was the temporary hideout of the boss of the Burmese mafia. It was also the base of his secret transaction.","It was safe, hidden, and protected by some people in the Myanmar military. The ‘giant umbrella’ behind the boss allowed him to almost monopolize the drug market of Myanmar.","Now, Qin Maosheng was giving Cobra a hard time. And the reason why this happened was because Cobra’s subordinates killed the woman he had sent out to fetch the goods.","After coming out, Luke told Xia Jinyuan about the main points of the discussion in the wooden house. “Qin Maosheng told Mr. Cobra that the woman those bastards killed last night was very powerful. She often goes to Myanmar, Thailand, and China to bring his goods in and out. She has never failed. Now that she’s dead, Mr. Cobra must send someone from our side to transport the goods that were supposed to be done by her.”","Qin Maosheng was the boss of the Burmese mafia gang that Cobra was meeting this time. Cobra needed the high-purity goods in his hands to obtain more money and allow his underground forces to become stronger.","Hearing this, Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows slightly. “So, what does it have to do with me? Whoever caused the trouble should take up the task.”","“Xia, you’re too naive. Things have become very complicated.”","Luke looked at Xia Jinyuan with pity in his eyes. He reached out his hand and patted Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder. He sighed and said, “First, I need to tell you a piece of good news. Cobra thinks that those fellows don’t have the ability to solve the problem for him. He asked me to bring you to the conference room and participate in the meeting with us.”"]},{"number":3856,"title":"Chapter 3856: Good News And Bad News","paragraphs":["Chapter 3856: Good News And Bad News","Editor: Henyee Translations","Hearing this, a trace of surprise flashed past Xia Jinyuan’s eyes, as if he was surprised that Cobra would let him participate in the meeting.","The surprise in his eyes made Luke smile. “Congratulations, Xia. In the future, you can sit down for meetings with us. You don’t have to stand outside and watch over us anymore. Cobra’s trust in you has increased.”","To Xia Jinyuan, who took a year to reach Cobra’s side, it was good news to be able to participate in the meeting!","Previously, even though he had received special recognition from Cobra and passed countless tests, he still couldn’t participate in meetings.","Luke was qualified to participate in the meeting, but he wasn’t qualified to stand beside Cobra. So far, Xia Jinyuan knew that there were eight bodyguards who could stand beside Cobra, four out in the open and four in the shadows.","Now, Xia Jinyuan finally had the chance to sit in the same conference room as Cobra. Xia Jinyuan knew that he was a huge step closer to Cobra.","The closer he was to Cobra, the more evidence he could get that would be beneficial to China.","Facing good news, Xia Jinyuan only acknowledged it calmly. He didn’t show much joy.","This made Luke find it unbelievable. “Aren’t you happy? Why aren’t you saying anything?”","“It’s a very normal thing. What should I be expressing? Also, I already had my moment of surprise just now.” Xia Jinyuan pushed away the hand that was still on his shoulder and asked calmly, “So, what’s the bad news?”","Luke widened his eyes. “Just now, there was only a hint of surprise in your eyes. It was just a small surprise, not a big surprise. Also, how do you know that I have another piece of bad news?”","Xia Jinyuan only looked at him and didn’t reply.","“Okay, okay, okay. I’ll tell you, I’ll tell you. The bad news is... we might have to solve the problem that the four of them created. That’s why I’m angry. F*ck, I had nothing to do with them beating up the women. They’re the ones who caused the trouble, but we have to clean up after them. When I came out just now, I gave them the middle finger. I hope that when you go in later, you can give them the middle finger with me.”","Xia Jinyuan didn’t raise his middle finger. He pushed the door open and nodded at Cobra, who was sitting at the top with two bodyguards standing behind him. Then, he sat on one of the empty seats.","What Cobra admired the most about Xia Jinyuan was his composure. He was a very calm and capable man. However, for some reason, he became a vagrant. If not, he wouldn’t have met him.","He had observed and investigated Xia Jinyuan for a year. What Xia Jinyuan said and the results of Cobra’s investigations were indeed the same. However, for some reason, he felt uneasy.","Even so, it was undeniable that Cobra admired this man’s ability. He was able to put aside the uncertainty in his heart this time as he wanted to put Xia Jinyuan in an important position.","Xia Jinyuan remained silent as he sat down. He didn’t say a word. The four men who were just reprimanded by Cobra felt hatred in their hearts.","Sitting beside him, Luke whispered, “Do you see that? They look like they want to eat you up. So, buddy, I’m really, really dissatisfied that we have to help them.”","“Mr. Cobra will make the arrangements. Just listen to him,” Xia Jinyuan replied calmly. He looked at Cobra, who was communicating with the boss of the Burmese mafia, Qin Maosheng. No one knew that Xia Jinyuan was secretly memorizing Qin Maosheng’s facial features."]},{"number":3857,"title":"Chapter 3857: Go To China","paragraphs":["Chapter 3857: Go To China","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was the first time he saw Qin Maosheng at such a close distance. Before this, he couldn’t see Qin Maosheng even though they were on the same cruise ship last night.","Luke glanced at the four people who couldn’t sit down and rolled his eyes at them. The four people who were shocked by Xia Jinyuan’s entrance were furious.","Was this bastard looking at the four of them as a joke?","That was right, Xia Jinyuan wanted to see them make a fool of themselves!","Luke smiled and retaliated as well by rolling his eyes. At the same time, he secretly gave them the middle finger.","Although Luke was one of Cobra’s bodyguards, his relationship with the four men who secretly handled many things for Cobra was very ordinary. The four men were not very friendly to Luke, but Luke was highly valued by Cobra. No matter how much they disliked him, they didn’t dare to make things difficult for him.","Xia Jinyuan was different. They knew that Cobra didn’t value Xia Jinyuan as much. Hence, they weren’t polite to him.","The four people who couldn’t fight with Luke glared at Xia Jinyuan.","This hateful Asian man! So what if he could participate in the meeting?","But how could Mr. Cobra trust a fellow that he had only known for a year and let him attend the meeting?","Mr. Cobra even needed him to complete the deal with Qin Maosheng!","Qin Maosheng had already looked at Xia Jinyuan several times and nodded several times. It looked like he was very satisfied with Xia Jinyuan.","He was indeed very satisfied with Xia Jinyuan. It was easy for a man who looked no different from a Chinese man to enter China.","Moreover, this man was very good-looking. It was easy for people to have a good impression of him. They wouldn’t feel that there was a problem at first glance. He felt at ease to have such a person enter China.","“Since you’re very sincere, Mr. Cobra, as long as you bring back the goods I need this time, I’ll definitely be the first to supply your goods in the future. I won’t let you wait for too long. I look forward to working with you.”","The short Qin Maosheng stood up and stretched out his hand with a smile. He shook hands with Cobra, who had a melancholic temperament that made him not look like a boss of a mafia force. “See you in ten days.”","“Okay, no problem. Ten days later, we’ll prepare to bring the goods here and hand them to you.” Cobra stood up and shook hands with this smart and ruthless Burmese mafia boss.","The cooperation had been established. Whether they could cooperate happily in the future would depend on whether Xia Jinyuan could bring the other party’s goods back.","Cobra personally sent Qin Maosheng out. He didn’t ask Xia Jinyuan if he was willing to enter China. In his eyes, his subordinates didn’t have the right to reject what he told them to do.","How could Xia Jinyuan reject him?","Xia Jinyuan hadn’t stepped into China for an entire year. Even if he had to go to China immediately, he wouldn’t complain.","Hence, when Cobra came back and asked him if he was willing to go to China, Xia Jinyuan only replied, “I’ll listen to your arrangements. I’ll complete my mission to your satisfaction.”","Cobra laughed heartily.","That was right!","He admired Xia’s composure, and he admired his obedience even more!","He was happy to promote an obedient and capable subordinate!","“Very good. I’m very relieved to let you go to China. Qin Maosheng only gave us ten days. I’ll fight for 15 days so that you have more time to arrange your retreat. Don’t worry, Xia, I’m very satisfied with your loyalty. I won’t let you go alone. Luke... Stand up...”"]},{"number":3858,"title":"Chapter 3858: Each With Their Own Schemes","paragraphs":["Chapter 3858: Each With Their Own Schemes","Editor: Henyee Translations","Cobra was in a good mood after solving this problem. He said to Luke amiably, “I know that you have a good relationship with Xia. Next, I’ll send you and Xia to China. I also need you to ensure Xia’s safety. Luke, can you do it?”","“Sir, of course I can do it. Xia is my friend. I’ll definitely protect his safety and let him settle everything for you safely,” Luke replied to Cobra seriously. Moreover, what he said was similar to Xia Jinyuan’s own words. They both expressed their obedience to Cobra.","“Very good. The two of you are the subordinates I admire the most. I believe that you won’t disappoint me.” Cobra’s skin was so thin that he looked sickly pale. There was a hint of blood on his face because of his laughter. His eyes, which were as melancholic as an artist’s, were filled with smiles. “Rest assured, I’ll never treat my loyal subordinates badly.”","After he finished speaking, his gaze seemed to sweep past something unintentionally. Then, he shook his head lightly at the two of them, as if reminding them of something.","“Yes, sir.”","The two of them stood up at the same time and left the conference room. Cobra had looked up at the surveillance cameras in the conference room, signaling to them that they could leave now.","When Luke closed the wooden door of the conference room, he received a look from Cobra. He nodded slightly, already understanding Cobra’s intentions.","The wooden door closed and the angry roar of the cobra came from the conference room. It was the angry roar of the four people who caused trouble last night. Right on the heels of that, an extremely familiar gunshot was heard and everything returned to silence.","“Cobra will never keep anyone who likes to cause trouble for him, especially... people who delay his schedule and money-making plan. He won’t keep them for long.”","Standing in the empty grass field in front of the wooden house, Luke reminded Xia Jinyuan, “No one can provoke Cobra’s dignity. It’s the same for you and me.”","“Yeah.”","Xia Jinyuan’s reply was extremely concise, which made Luke very discouraged.","He really didn’t understand why this fellow didn’t like to talk. He was like this in the past. Now that they were close, he still didn’t like to talk. What an incomprehensible fellow.","In the wooden house, Cobra’s most trusted bodyguard stood in front of the window and retracted his gaze. He returned to Cobra’s side and bent down. He lowered his head and said a few words in a low voice.","Cobra nodded. The smile on his thin and pale face didn’t disappear. “Very good. You can withdraw the people watching him. If he can really help me this time, I’ll hand him over to you in the future.”","The conference room was filled with the smell of blood. Cobra stood up and glanced coldly at the person lying in a pool of blood. There was a hint of viciousness in his eyes. Then, he glanced at the other three people who didn’t even dare to breathe loudly. He raised his leg and walked out of the conference room.","The fellow lying in the pool of blood was a warning to the three of them. Just like what Luke said, they had to pay a price for delaying his plans.","Qin Maosheng saw everything that happened in the conference room clearly. He was very satisfied with Cobra’s cooperation and liked that someone had finally solved his biggest problem.","“Inform our people in China to avoid the Chinese border defense armed police officers and return immediately,” Qin Maosheng said happily. His triangular eyes, which were like vipers, flickered with coldness. “Tell my brothers that I, Qin Maosheng, will definitely avenge the brothers who were killed by the Chinese border defense armed police officers!”","Qin Maosheng, who was being watched by the Chinese border defense armed police officers and subject to their intense attacks, hated the Chinese police to the core and wanted to take revenge. He vowed to fight the Chinese border defense armed police officers to the death."]},{"number":3859,"title":"Chapter 3859: Situation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3859: Situation","Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Maosheng hated the Chinese border defense armed police officers to the core. It could be said that no other country had given him as much of a headache as China. China’s crackdown on drugs was getting harsher every year. In the past, he could still transport goods through the borders. But now... If it wasn’t because the Chinese market was huge, he would’ve wanted to give up.","Qin Maosheng naturally knew a little about what kind of person Cobra was. However, he only knew a little. Besides knowing that Cobra was the poison king from Molaban, Qin Maosheng didn’t know anything else.","Now, Qin Maosheng just wanted to use the help of the poison king, Cobra, to solve his current difficulties.","“Reveal Cobra’s whereabouts and let the Chinese border defense armed police officers keep an eye on him. Then, we’ll move around and teach the Chinese a lesson. They’ve harmed so many of my brothers. It’s time to get payback!”","Qin Maosheng secretly arranged his plan. Cobra, who had left the conference room, didn’t stay idle either.","Cobra was in other people’s territory now. He was more vigilant than ever. He found Luke and Xia Jinyuan again and reminded them to be careful.","“China is a headache for me at the moment. They’re very strict with the supervision of the invading forces. I originally planned to enter China after completing my transaction with Qin Maosheng. Now, the two of you can finish this mission first. After I finish my business, I’ll meet you soon.”","Xia Jinyuan had no idea that Cobra was going to enter China. Hearing that, Xia Jinyuan’s calm gaze changed slightly.","He needed to be able to enter and exit Cobra’s study room at any time. This was the goal he had been working hard for the past year. The opportunity to do that had come!","Next, he needed to reveal the news of Cobra entering China to his comrades from the Xueyu unit so that they could cooperate with him and complete the goal.","Luke already knew that Cobra would enter China. He was a little surprised that Cobra told Xia Jinyuan about his next trip. However, he quickly regained his composure.","Cobra was placing more and more importance on Xia. He let Xia participate in the meeting today and even revealed his schedule to Xia. It looked like Cobra had decided to let Xia follow him.","“I want to make some suggestions about your schedule.” Luke stopped smiling. At this moment, he was the bodyguard that Cobra admired. He liked to smile, but when he was serious, he was a force to be reckoned with. “I don’t agree with everything Qin Maosheng said today.","“A call girl was the subordinate he was most satisfied with? Sir, this is a joke. He just wanted to use Ferro and the other three to kill someone so that he could make his request. Sir, his request makes me suspect that there has been a huge commotion at the border defense in China recently and it’s been giving him a headache.","“If you need to enter China, I suggest that you wait for Xia and I to come back before you make your plans. I believe that you’ll be safer that way.”","Luke almost exposed Qin Maosheng’s current situation. Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but take a few more glances at his sharp senses. What made Xia Jinyuan’s heart tighten was the importance Luke placed on Cobra’s safety.","Wasn’t Luke a member of the Signal Flag?","This thought flashed past Xia Jinyuan’s mind, but he immediately denied it. He believed in his intuition and believed in the sorrow in Luke’s cries last night. Everything else he said and did could be faked, but the despair and sorrow in his cries couldn’t be faked."]},{"number":3860,"title":"Chapter 3860: Excitement","paragraphs":["Chapter 3860: Excitement","Editor: Henyee Translations","Of course, whether Luke was a member of the Signal Flag or not, Xia Jinyuan didn’t plan to confirm it personally. He just wanted to wait and see.","“I got your reminder.” Cobra listened to Luke’s suggestion and agreed with it. “China is a country I don’t want to step into. I heard many stories about this country from a friend in the past. I don’t have a good impression of this country.","“Luke, you’re right. I’ll wait for you to come back.” He had a reason to go over.","“I will understand clearly if Qin Maosheng is being watched by the Chinese. However, I don’t know if he has caused any trouble. You have to leave tomorrow. That’s what I agreed on with Qin Maosheng. I can’t go back on my word. Hence, I hope that the two of you can help each other so that I can see you come back safely.”","After saying that, Cobra looked at Xia Jinyuan and patted his shoulder. “Do your best. I know how hard you’ve been working. Xia, you’re a powerful man. You and Luke will become my best helpers. I can’t do without your help.”","Xia Jinyuan nodded and said calmly, “Luke and I will definitely come back.”","“That’s right. I believe that you and Luke will definitely come back. Alright, I still have some things to take care of. You and Luke can walk around the area. Someone will send you out tomorrow morning.”","He patted Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder again before leaving.","After Cobra left, he asked his two bodyguards to bring the sketch board, paint, and other drawing tools. He said that he still had some important things to settle, but what he meant was that he wanted to find a place with good scenery to paint the view.","A fellow whose hands were stained with blood actually had a special liking for painting. It could be seen that everyone liked art. Even if it was a criminal, he would like it.","Xia Jinyuan watched as Cobra left. He was still thinking about what Cobra said just now.","Especially when he said that he didn’t have a good impression of China because of a friend. The first person Xia Jinyuan thought of was Li Chuhai. During the prior investigation, it was discovered that Li Chuhai and Cobra had a good relationship and trusted each other.","Cobra, who had never been to China before, might have understood a few things about China through Li Chuhai. He now had a huge prejudice against the country.","It was good news that Cobra had plans of entering China. Xia Jinyuan needed to send this good news back to the Xueyu unit and cooperate with his comrades that he hadn’t seen in a year to complete the mission.","This time, Ye Jian wasn’t part of Xia Jinyuan’s plan. He didn’t plan to tell Ye Jian that he was returning to the country and needed to cooperate with his comrades from the Xueyu unit.","When G3 from the Xueyu unit knew that Xia Jinyuan was returning to the country, it was already the night of the second day of the new year. He hadn’t heard from Xia Jinyuan for a year, so when he received a call from the military, his hand that was holding the phone trembled slightly.","On the phone, Major General Yang gave some orders. He nodded and said with killing intent in his eyes, “Okay, I’ll gather everyone immediately. I’ll give you a video call in three minutes!”","After hanging up, G3 didn’t blow the emergency whistle. Q King hadn’t returned to the unit for a year. The veterans who didn’t know anything knew that their captain must be carrying out a secret mission. As for the new recruits, they didn’t know where their captain went. Although they often discussed it in private, they never managed to come to a conclusion.","They wouldn’t be able to find out the things that they couldn’t find out even if they were in the same military unit."]},{"number":3861,"title":"Chapter 3861: Battle Map","paragraphs":["Chapter 3861: Battle Map","Editor: Henyee Translations","At this moment, G3 only rang the assembly bell of the dormitory of the veteran soldiers and completed the emergency assembly of the veteran soldiers.","“K7, move out! T6, move out! X, Y, move out...”","As G3 announced the codenames of the special forces soldiers who were going to a certain border of the country to carry out a mission, the veterans who stayed behind vaguely guessed something.","They didn’t make eye contact, but at this moment, everyone’s eyes were shining with excitement.","Then, a few more comrades who were active at the border stepped out. The veterans who didn’t step out guessed something. Their captain, Q King, whom they hadn’t seen for a year, must’ve appeared at a certain border of their country!","The ‘recruits’ who had been training for a year and undergone countless tests still didn’t know what was going on. Although G3 didn’t say anything, the veterans who stayed behind knew what was going on.","“The 13 comrades whose names were called out, stay behind. The rest are dismissed!”","In the dark night, G3 stood under the light. His gaze was like a torch as he glanced at the veterans who had understood the situation. His cold voice was slow and relaxed as he said, “Just wait for our good news.”","This sentence confirmed all the guesses of the veterans.","Before the veterans could even get ready, they were already rubbing their fists!","This year, none of the comrades from the Xueyu unit went home for the new year. Even Wu Yue, who had a girlfriend, G3, who had his wedding postponed, and Z7, who was urged by his elders whenever he called his family, didn’t go home. They all stayed in the base to wait for news from their leader.","Now, there was news and it was the latest news from Q King. They were sitting in the conference room and having a video chat with Major General Yang. They listened attentively with serious facial expressions. They were afraid that they would miss important information if they got distracted.","Major General Yang was also very excited when he heard the news about Xia Jinyuan. He said in a deep voice to the special forces soldiers who were heading to the border of the country, “According to the news, Cobra will enter China after Q King safely returns to Myanmar. We’ll cooperate with the border defense officers and soldiers. Once Cobra enters China, we’ll start moving immediately and cooperate with Q King’s plan.","“The Xueyu unit will send two groups of 14 soldiers to the border immediately and be on standby!”","On the satellite video call, Major General Yang and the 14 special forces soldiers, who were about to go to the border to cooperate with Xia Jinyuan, completed the detailed combat mission.","Within half an hour, all the veterans of the Xueyu unit gathered. The snow-covered mountains were majestic. A total of 14 special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit set off on two helicopters. They left the base and headed to the Myanmar and Thailand border.","In the military headquarters, Major General Yang had been standing in front of the window ever since he returned to his office. He didn’t move for a long time. He just stood there until the sky turned white.","He had finally received news of his proudest subordinate. When he received the good news, he became even more worried.","Cobra was too difficult to deal with. Even with Q King’s ability, he didn’t manage to gain his trust in an entire year. There was even a suspected Russian Signal Flag member who was by Cobra’s side for five years. Major General Yang couldn’t help but frown.","If he was really a member of the Signal Flag and hadn’t left for five years, what important information did Cobra have that the special forces soldier couldn’t find out even after five years?","Xia Jinyuan had spent a year. Now, he still needed to use an even more intense method to gain the trust of Cobra. Would it take as long as the member of the Signal Flag?","That night, Major General Yang was thinking about him. When he thought about him, he stood there until dawn."]},{"number":3862,"title":"Chapter 3862: Selfless Dedication","paragraphs":["Chapter 3862: Selfless Dedication","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan came back to the country by illegally infiltrating. Major General Yang, who had been standing for the entire night, was the first to receive the news from the information processing center. After deciphering it, he informed the vice-captain of the Xueyu unit, G3. When Commander Xia found out, it was the morning of the third day. He was accompanying Old Master Xia, Old Madam Xia, and Old Master Fu who was celebrating the new year at the Xia family home.","Old Master Fu had many students. He had many visitors on the first and second day of the new year, but none of them got to see the old man. On the third day, they knew that the old man would be at home, so the student union of the aerospace institute made an appointment with him. The old man could choose not to meet other guests, but he liked chatting with the students of the aerospace institute.","Although he had retired from the aerospace institute, he was still involved in the operations. Complicated and difficult-to-understand graphics would appear from time to time. There were also a bunch of formulas that the people there couldn’t understand. All this was the work of the old man.","Before he received the call, Commander Xia was talking to Old Master Fu about heavy firepower. There were still some problems. The old man heard that and said, “If there’s a problem, just solve it. I’ve seen the experiments and discussed it with the experts from the aerospace institute. The students coming today will send me to the laboratory.”","“Xinhui, I’ve troubled you for the past few days. Your old man is so enthusiastic. If I didn’t come, I’d be a sinner. He’s still as stubborn as when he was young!”","Grandpa Xia, who invited Old Master Fu to the Xia family for the new year, even forced his sons who were working in the capital city to go to Dangui Garden. He ordered them to invite Old Master Fu to the Xia family home for the new year, even if it meant that they had to kneel.","The old man wouldn’t let a minister of national defense, an old man who had never troubled anyone in his life, kneel down and invite him to the Xia family for the new year. It was lively, making the old man very comfortable.","Grandpa Xia, who had succeeded, looked at his old friend who was still laughing in the Xia family home. He said to Commander Xia in private, “You’ll be considered half of Old Master Fu’s son from now on. Be filial to him. Don’t let him feel that his family will be empty once his granddaughter gets married.”","From New Year’s Eve until today, Commander Xia was just like Mr. Fu, always thinking about Old Master Fu. He was just short of calling him ‘Dad’.","Now that he knew that Old Master Fu was going to the laboratory today, he frowned. “Your legs are not suitable for standing for a long time, and you’ll mostly have to stand in the laboratory. Does the aerospace institute want you to go over? Is there any room for negotiation?”","“The heavy load firepower was a problem I left for the aerospace institute before I retired. It had also reached the most critical moment. Thanks to the kindness of the country’s leaders and the aerospace institute, I’ve been allowed to go back and take a look. I’ve been with the aerospace institute for my entire life. Now that I’m retired and old, I realized that my favorite place is still the aerospace institute.","“I’m happy that they’re letting me go back and enter the laboratory. The aerospace institute knows that I can’t stand for too long and will accommodate me. Don’t worry.”","When the laboratory of the aerospace institute was mentioned, the old man’s eyes were filled with yearning. The old man, who had dedicated his entire life to the country’s aerospace industry, had a wish that no one knew about. This time, when he returned to the aerospace institute, he planned to say his wish."]},{"number":3863,"title":"Chapter 3863: Excited","paragraphs":["Chapter 3863: Excited","Editor: Henyee Translations","The old man’s wish that no one knew about was a little heartbreaking. He hoped that the country would allow him to have his ashes brought onto the latest fighter jet a hundred years later so that he could feel the power of his country again. Then, he wanted the soldiers to scatter his ashes into the sea.","This was a wish that even his granddaughter, Ye Jian, didn’t know about. Today, he would tell the aerospace institute and see if it could be realized.","Looking at the old man’s energetic eyes, Commander Xia knew that his persuasion wouldn’t be of any use. This was the lifelong struggle of an old scientist. He didn’t have the right to persuade or stop him.","Just as he was about to tell Old Master Fu to take care of his health, he received a call from Major General Yang.","The call went through. Within a few seconds, there were tears glistening in the corners of Commander Xia’s eyes.","There was finally news about his Little Six who had broken ties with the country. He had infiltrated China, and his identity had become ‘illegal’.","Commander Xia secretly wiped the corners of his eyes and said calmly, “Okay, I’ll rush back to the military immediately.”","The old man knew that something had happened in the military. Without waiting for Commander Xia’s instructions, he asked the driver in front to pull over. Then, Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia’s sedan stopped too.","Very soon, Commander Xia, who felt extremely sorry that he couldn’t accompany them, asked the chauffeur to send him to the military. Old Master Fu, Old Master Xia, and Old Madam Xia took the same car to Dangui Garden.","When he reached the entrance of the military headquarters, Commander Xia hurriedly rushed over. He wasn’t wearing his military uniform and didn’t have the guards there drive him. He walked quickly and took out his identification documents for the sentinel to check.","The guard who was always by Major General Yang’s side was already waiting at the gate. When he saw Commander Xia walking over quickly, he immediately welcomed him.","The sentinels were only allowed to pass after completing the inspection according to strict requirements. Commander Xia almost broke into a trot. Fortunately, Major General Yang had arranged for a car. After entering the military, he took the car and went to the information center.","When Commander Xia arrived at the information center, hot sweat appeared on his back and forehead.","“The information was sent back to our country at 10:00 pm yesterday. From the coordinates, Q King sent the information from within the country. This is the decoded information.”","Major General Yang passed the decoded information to Commander Xia. “Cobra will only enter the country after Q King returns to Myanmar. There’s a man beside Q King. He suspects that he might be from the Russian special forces unit—the Signal Flag.","“We will cooperate with Q King’s plan according to his arrangements. This is his plan.”","Commander Xia, who was secretly adjusting his breathing, looked at the entire plan with a serious expression. His hands were trembling slightly.","He had always known that his son was a bold fellow. However, now that he was seeing Xia Jinyuan’s arrangements for himself, as a father, he couldn’t help but tremble.","This was a life-or-death battle plan. In this plan, his son... might really be sacrificed!","Major General Yang said, “That’s why the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit are joining him. They have been working together for many years and have a tacit understanding. To a large extent, they can ensure Q King’s safety. Most importantly, there’s also the poison king, Qin Maosheng, who our country needs to deal with.","“We’ll carry out the operation on the pretext of encircling and killing Qin Maosheng. That way, Cobra’s suspicion will reduce and Q King won’t be suspected either. That’ll help to ensure his safety.”"]},{"number":3864,"title":"Chapter 3864: Hiding","paragraphs":["Chapter 3864: Hiding","Editor: Henyee Translations","Major General Yang didn’t even dare to meet Commander Xia’s gaze. Q King was Commander Xia’s only son. If he really died... the person who would feel the most sorrow was Commander Xia. He didn’t dare to face Commander Xia because he knew that... Q King’s plan was very risky.","Commander Xia understood how risky this plan was. However, he had no choice. No matter how worried he was, he couldn’t change anything. He could only watch his son walk into the most dangerous situation step by step.","He closed his eyes lightly and suppressed all the uneasiness in his heart. Commander Xia said in a low voice, “Inform everyone that the 14 special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit will cooperate with Q King to complete the entire plan. If anything happens in the middle, kill Cobra with all their might!”","If Little Six died, then Cobra must die too!","Little Six had infiltrated Cobra’s side to find out the power behind him and how many of them were hiding in their country. If Little Six was sacrificed, he would never send anyone to infiltrate Cobra’s side again. In that case, they might as well kill Cobra directly!","Major General Yang’s expression turned serious as he replied in a deep voice, “Yes.” Then, he continued, “Q King specially mentioned that we can’t let Azure Bird join and we can’t tell her that he has returned to the country. What do you think... we should do?”","“We’ll hide the news for the time being.” Commander Xia didn’t hesitate and replied, “Since Azure Bird isn’t joining this mission, there’s no need to inform her for the time being.”","Sometimes, it was better to not receive any sort of news.","Commander Xia didn’t want to distract Ye Jian. However, Ye Jian received a message from Zhou Yijin that read: [Help!] After calling her dozens of times, the phone was still turned off. Ye Jian finally couldn’t take it anymore and called Commander Xia’s private cell phone.","When she called, Commander Xia had just said that there was no need to inform her for the time being. When Commander Xia, who was in a heavy mood, took out his cell phone and saw the caller ID, he almost dropped his phone.","“Speak of the devil... This girl’s call is making me a little nervous.” Commander Xia passed the phone to Major General Yang. “Right after I finish speaking, she called...”","He didn’t answer the call immediately.","Major General Yang thought of Ye Jian’s magical sixth sense and couldn’t help but wipe his forehead with his sleeve. He didn’t dare to answer the call, so he said carefully, “Could it be that... she sensed something?”","“It can’t be that amazing. If she really knew, it might be because Q King told her through other channels.” Commander Xia smiled bitterly.","He also had a nephew-in-law who was a figure in the underworld. Before he washed his hands clean of the business, he had an influence in Yun Province. If Little Ye knew that Little Six had infiltrated the country, she might have known about it through his connections. This possibility was much higher than her sensing it.","“Then... are you going to answer it?” Major General Yang pointed at the phone that was still ringing.","“Yes, of course, I will.” Commander Xia cleared his throat. Just as Ye Jian was about to lose her patience, Commander Xia finally called out, “Hello?”","Without waiting for Commander Xia to say anything, Ye Jian said a long string of words in one breath, “Uncle, Yijin sent me a message asking for help three minutes ago. I called her dozens of times but Yijin’s phone is turned off. Can you check her exact location?”"]},{"number":3865,"title":"Chapter 3865: Missing","paragraphs":["Chapter 3865: Missing","Editor: Henyee Translations","Commander Xia’s breathing got heavier. He pursed his lips and didn’t interrupt Ye Jian. He allowed her to continue.","“A few days ago, I met Yijin at the Nanguang Basic Company. She told me that she’d be going to Yun Province to perform at the border defense company next. She’d only return to the capital city after the performance.","“Recently, the borders of Yun Province haven’t been very stable. Yijin suddenly sent me a message asking for help. I suspect that something happened to her. Yijin definitely isn’t pulling a prank. If she knows that if I receive a message like that, I’ll definitely take it seriously.”","She finished speaking in one breath. She didn’t pause for a single word. She didn’t even take a breath. It could be seen how anxious she was.","Commander Xia was frightened. He knew that Yijin would never play such a prank that would make her family worry. That meant that she must have met danger when she sent the help message!","“Little Ye, don’t be anxious. I’ll contact the leaders of the regiment immediately and confirm which border defense company she went to perform today. Don’t be anxious. Wait for my call!”","It was one problem after another. Zhou Yijin’s help message made people even more anxious than Xia Jinyuan’s situation!","Commander Xia didn’t have the time to feel sad about the danger his only son was about to face. He immediately put his work aside and contacted the leaders of the art troupe.","The arts troupe was in an uproar!","Two female soldiers had been missing for three hours. Their whereabouts were still unknown!","When they checked the surveillance cameras, they only saw two people carrying a child who was knocked down by a motorcycle and crossing the road. They were then directed to a car by two women and brought away.","After that, there was no more news. All the surveillance footage was pulled out, but they didn’t manage to find any vehicle with two female soldiers onboard. At the same time, no pair of female soldiers or a child who was injured by a motorcycle were found in the nearby hospitals!","In other words, this might be a premeditated scheme against the Chinese soldiers!","When Commander Xia sent a call to the military regiment, the leader of the military regiment finally learned that the female soldier in the military regiment, Zhou Yijin, was actually... Commander Xia’s niece. That meant that she was... Minister Xia’s niece!","Commander Xia had a younger sister whose husband was the principal of a military school, and Old Master Xia was the founding father of the country. Zhou Yijin was the niece of Commander Xia and Minister Xia. She was also Old Master Xia’s granddaughter!","The leader of the troupe felt his vision turning black.","He didn’t know the family records of every female soldier in the arts troupe very well. However, if someone really had some connections, he would more or less know a little. However, Zhou Yijin had always kept a low profile in the regiment. He had never heard her mention her family before. Only when something had happened to her did he learn that she was a noble lady!","“We’re already doing our best to investigate. Yes, Zhou Yijin and another female soldier went missing. At 6:10 pm, Zhou Yijin and another female soldier left the camp to go shopping...”","The leader of the cultural regiment reported everything to Commander Xia. They left the camp at 6:10 pm and encountered the child who got knocked down at 6:20 pm. It was 9:20 pm now. They had lost contact for three hours!","Commander Xia told the leader of the art troupe about the help message that Zhou Yijin sent to Ye Jian a few minutes ago. He said, “According to the message, Zhou Yijin is indeed in danger, but her life isn’t at stake yet. I’ll contact the military district of Yun Province and increase the police force to find the two missing female soldiers!”"]},{"number":3866,"title":"Chapter 3866: The Key","paragraphs":["Chapter 3866: The Key","Editor: Henyee Translations","Before he could speak to the leader of the arts troupe, Commander Xia hung up and immediately contacted the military district of Yun Province. The disappearance of the two female soldiers immediately attracted the attention of the military district of Yun Province. The police and armed police got involved.","While Commander Xia was contacting the Yun Province military district, Ye Jian wasn’t idle either. She was far away in Nanguang Province while Zhou Yijin was in Yun Province. She couldn’t help at all.","She couldn’t help but analyze why Zhou Yijin sent her a distress message when she had the contact number of so many friends.","This was what Ye Jian had been thinking about after she received the message and during the time she kept calling Zhou Yijin’s cell phone.","She needed to understand why Zhou Yijin sent her the message. Was it because her other friends were unreliable? No, she still had the phone numbers of all her family members. Hence, it was definitely not because the other people she knew were unreliable.","Besides that, Zhou Yijin must have the contact method of her comrades from the arts troupe. Why did she not send them the distress message?","She had so many relatives and friends, but she only sent the distress message to Ye Jian.","Ye Jian rubbed her cell phone gently with one hand and fell into deep thought. Her mind was like a high-speed data line. She kept thinking about some possibilities and sifting through them. In the end, she eliminated the most unlikely reasons. Gradually, the puzzled Ye Jian started to understand.","If... Ye Jian was the only one who could solve the danger Zhou Yijin was facing now, then it made sense why she only sent her the text message.","Ye Jian had already thought of this possibility from the start. However, there were too many interference factors. First, the geographical location made her eliminate this possibility. Now, after thinking about it repeatedly, this explanation was still reasonable.","Among all of her contacts, Ye Jian must be the only one who could help Zhou Yijin in the danger she was facing now!","Thinking of the crux of the matter, Ye Jian immediately took out her phone and called Commander Xia. She couldn’t wait any longer. The more she waited, the more danger Zhou Yijin would face!","Ye Jian had figured out the crux of the matter. Commander Xia, who was far away in the capital city, said to Major General Yang, who hadn’t left, “Yijin doesn’t know Little Ye’s true identity. Although what you said is possible, it’s unrealistic. Yijin is giving up what’s near to seek what’s far.","“That means the danger she has encountered is very great. The more reliable and trustworthy her friend is, the more likely she’ll be saved. Or rather, Yijin needs a friend with enough ability to save her.”","“Commander Xia, Little Ye and Yijin have met before. I’ve seen Yijin too. She’s a smart girl. Last year, Little Ye and Little Six suddenly left the Xia family together. I think that Yijin might have guessed something.”","This... was possible!","Zhou Yijin looked carefree, but she was actually very meticulous. She was especially observant. When Little Six didn’t return home for two years, she secretly asked him if her cousin had joined a military unit that was very difficult to enter.","At that time, Commander Xia thought that Little Six had told her. However, Yijin said, “He hasn’t returned home in two years. He doesn’t even call home or contact my family. I grew up in a military family. Uncle, aren’t you looking down on me? Do you think I don’t know anything?”","That was Little Six’s second year in the Xueyu unit and Yijin had already guessed it."]},{"number":3867,"title":"Chapter 3867: Encounter","paragraphs":["Chapter 3867: Encounter","Editor: Henyee Translations","Last year, Little Six and Little Ye received a call and left urgently. Since Zhou Yijin knew Little Six’s identity, she must have guessed the reason behind Little Ye’s departure.","This would explain why she was ‘giving up what’s near to seek what’s far!’","Commander Xia couldn’t help but purse his lips. His facial expression became more and more serious. This matter was a little difficult.","Letting Little Ye go over was equivalent to putting his family in danger. Two juniors were already in danger... With the addition of Little Ye... Thinking about it made Commander Xia purse his lips into a straight line.","He was still a little worried. If Little Ye managed to think of the reason why Yijin sent her the distress, she would not sit back and do nothing given her personality. That would be even more troublesome.","The reason why Commander Xia felt that it was troublesome was that as long as Ye Jian asked to go to Yun Province, he couldn’t reject her.","In his heart, Ye Jian was the best person to save Zhou Yijin.","However, before that, they needed to understand why Yijin disappeared and who it was that dared to kidnap Chinese soldiers.","The phone on his desk vibrated. The screen flashed, and a call came in. Commander Xia, who was in a dilemma, sighed softly when he saw the caller ID.","At this moment, he had a feeling that Ye Jian had already thought of the crux of the matter.","When the call went through, Ye Jian voiced out her suspicions. Commander Xia could only smile bitterly. Her premonition was the reality. She had really thought it through.","He took out a ballpoint pen from his pen holder. Commander Xia wrote a few words on the paper and pushed it to Major General Yang.","After looking at it, Major General Yang shook his head and sighed. He took out a pen from his pen holder and wrote on the paper: [Little Ye is smart. I’ve experienced the extent of her wits before.]","Since Ye Jian had already figured it out, what should they do?","“Uncle, Yijin sent me a distress message because she trusts me. I beg you to let me stay here and wait for orders. If there’s a need, I can take action immediately!” Ye Jian didn’t immediately suggest going to Yun Province. She knew that this transfer wasn’t as simple as when she was in school. After all, she was studying in a basic company under a regiment in Nanguang Province.","If she really wanted to go over, she would have to pass through the company first.","But in her heart, she really wanted to go.","“Little Ye, I can understand your feelings. But Yijin’s whereabouts are unknown now. The military district of Yun Province is investigating with all their might. They need to find out who dares to kidnap our soldiers before they can make any further plans. Don’t worry, with the military forces from Yun Province, Yijin will definitely be fine.","“I promise that if I really need you to go over, I’ll inform you immediately.”","Ye Jian knew that it was more troublesome to mobilize people from other military districts. She could only wait patiently. She had no other choice.","However, she knew that Yijin hoped that she would go. Yijin believed that she would be able to save her. If not, Yijin wouldn’t have sent her such an important distress message.","Zhou Yijin had indeed placed her hope of survival on Ye Jian. Just like what Commander Xia had guessed, Zhou Yijin must’ve figured out that her cousin-in-law’s identity was a little unusual after seeing her and Xia Jinyuan leaving at the same time in the first month of last year.","It wasn’t easy for her to get the cell phone hidden in her military boots. It wasn’t that she didn’t think about her family. However, in the end, she still sent the distress message to Ye Jian. It was because Ye Jian’s identity was special. She would be able to know that she was in danger faster."]},{"number":3868,"title":"Chapter 3868: Save Yourself And Call For Help","paragraphs":["Chapter 3868: Save Yourself And Call For Help","Editor: Henyee Translations","Most importantly, she believed that her sixth cousin-in-law would definitely come and save her personally. Among her family, only her sixth cousin might come and save her. However, her sixth cousin hadn’t returned home for a year, so she couldn’t expect him to come.","That meant that there was only her sixth cousin-in-law left. Since her sixth cousin-in-law was able to leave with her sixth cousin back then, the possibility of her coming to save her personally was higher.","Zhou Yijin had been exposed to trichloromethane. When she woke up, she wanted to observe the environment first. However, her eyes were covered, so she gave up. After that, she wanted to escape, but her hands and legs were tied up. She couldn’t save herself, so she could only ask for help.","Fortunately, due to the environment she grew up in, she didn’t panic just because she had been kidnapped. After analyzing the most effective ‘rescue’ plan, she only had time to type the word ‘help’ to Ye Jian.","Just as she turned off her phone and before she could hide it in her military boots, her comrade, who was kidnapped with her, made muffled sounds from her throat to tell her that someone was coming.","The sound of metal chains rattling could be heard from outside the rusty iron door. Right on the heels of that, someone kicked the iron door open forcefully. Zhou Yijin pretended to be very frightened and kept shrinking back. She clasped her hands behind her back, stuffing her phone into the haystack.","The moment the message was sent, Zhou Yijin no longer felt as panicky. She calmed down, and her thoughts were very clear. Even though she was very frightened now, she knew that she should cooperate obediently and not resist.","She believed that with her cousin-in-law’s intelligence, Ye Jian would know that she was in danger and needed help.","Zhou Yijin was blindfolded. When she heard her comrade struggling, she retreated to a corner of the cold wall. She had nowhere else to go.","Someone grabbed her collar forcefully. The next second, the ropes tying her legs were cut off and she was pushed out of the room that was filled with the smell of humidity and cow dung.","Zhou Yijin, who was pushed out of the room, was separated from her comrade. She spent the next few hours on a bumpy car ride. She knew that she was getting farther and farther away from the border defense company. She didn’t know where she was being taken to. She only knew that she had been sitting in the car. Other than that, the surroundings were so quiet that there was no sound at all.","There was something stuffed into her mouth. Her hands and legs were tied up. She curled up in the car as her body swayed. Yijin closed her eyes, forcing herself to take a nap.","Half an hour after their departure, the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade sent by the Yun Province military district found a cell phone among the stacks of hay belonging to the border ethnic minorities. After checking and confirming it, they sent a message. It was confirmed that the cell phone belonged to the missing female soldier, Zhou Yijin.","They found her cell phone, but she wasn’t there.","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade continued their search. The border defense drug inspection team received the latest news. When Xu Yu received the news, he stood alone for several minutes. Then, he called the Yun Province military district.","Commander Xia received another call from the Yun Province military district. It had been two hours since Zhou Yijin sent Ye Jian the distress message. He stood there and picked up the landline phone. He quietly listened to the latest updates from the Yun Province military district and their next deployment. After a long time, Commander Xia pursed his lips and asked in a low voice, “Is there no other way?”","His deep voice contained the dignity of someone who had been in a high position for a long time. The expression of the leader of the Yun Province military district became more and more solemn. “No, Commander. We’ve been discussing this problem for half an hour. Time is tight. We could only report to you first and see if it’s possible.”"]},{"number":3869,"title":"Chapter 3869: Careful","paragraphs":["Chapter 3869: Careful","Editor: Henyee Translations","The result of their half an hour of discussion was to send his future daughter-in-law to take the risk?","“Ask Xu Yu to call me. I’ll wait for his call.” After Commander Xia finished speaking, he slammed the phone down. He was obviously a little angry.","Ye Jian again! Besides Little Ye, he didn’t believe that there was no one else who could do it!","His only son’s life was in danger. Was he going to let his daughter-in-law enter the tiger’s den too?","At this moment, Commander Xia was just an ordinary father. He was worried about his only son, Xia Jinyuan. He was worried about his niece’s whereabouts. Now, his future daughter-in-law, Ye Jian, was involved too. Three youths of the Xia family were in danger. He was used to all kinds of situations and knew that it wasn’t easy for soldiers. But at this moment, he couldn’t remain calm anymore.","There was one problem after another, and another person was going to be pushed into the tiger’s den. Commander Xia suppressed his anger and sat back in his office chair, waiting for Xu Yu to call him.","Xu Yu received a call from the Yun Province military district first. They warned him in advance that Commander Xia was angry. Then, they dialed the main switchboard of the military and transferred the call to Commander Xia’s office. Xu Yu’s hands were sweating.","Normally, such a thing wouldn’t alarm Commander Xia, but one of the missing female soldiers was Commander Xia’s niece. As an elder, Commander Xia naturally had to pay attention to this matter.","He made this deployment so that he could save Commander Xia’s niece as soon as possible. Then, he would follow the information provided by the informant.","He just didn’t know why Commander Xia was angry. Was he angry because they hadn’t found the female soldier, Zhou Yijin? Or was he angry because of their arrangements?","Xu Yu’s palms were sweating. This was the first time he had a direct conversation with Commander Xia. When he heard the dignified voice from the other end of the phone, Xu Yu’s heart skipped a beat.","“Hello, Commander Xia. I’m Xu Yu from the Yun Province border defense drug inspection team...”","The call between Xu Yu and Commander Xia lasted for a long time. After ten minutes, Commander Xia hung up.","The other party’s explanation was reasonable, and the other party’s arrangements were seamless. Ye Jian... Besides her, there was no other suitable candidate.","Her skills were not bad. She had individual combat experience and actual combat experience. She had the experience of going to the borders of Yun Province to survive in the wild. She had a certain understanding of the borders of Yun Province and had actual combat experience there. She knew Zhou Yijin and was able to recognize her at a glance. She was also a female soldier, making her the best choice for Qin Maosheng’s plan...","They couldn’t find another female soldier who was more suitable to go to Yun Province than Little Ye.","They couldn’t find one at the moment, but what about in the future?","It was evident how important it was to establish a female special forces.","Not only was a female special forces unit required in Yunnan, but it was the same for other military districts, especially at the borders like Yun Province and Tibet. The establishment of female special forces units must be proposed. This was an urgent task!","At one o’clock in the afternoon, Ye Jian, who had been waiting, received a call from Commander Xia. She had been waiting all this while. When she saw the call, she jumped up from her bed. Her actions were so huge that Ding Ling, who was on her lunch break, was shocked. She opened her eyes and asked, “What’s wrong? What’s wrong? What happened?”","“It’s nothing. I’m going out to answer a call.” Ye Jian didn’t even put on her jacket after she finished putting on her shoes. She picked up her phone and rushed out of the dormitory. She rushed from the fourth floor to the roof of the sixth floor in a few strides before picking up the call."]},{"number":3870,"title":"Chapter 3870: Entering The Tiger’s Den","paragraphs":["Chapter 3870: Entering The Tiger’s Den","Editor: Henyee Translations","Even at such a fast speed, she didn’t lose her breath. Commander Xia replied in a low voice, “The Yun Province military district and border defense armed police officers have confirmed that the person who kidnapped Yijin and the other female soldier is the boss of the Burmese mafia, Qin Maosheng...","“Qin Maosheng hates our border defense armed police to the core. He once planned to take revenge on our armed police and killed three of our armed police officers. Our country has been looking for him too.","“The border defense armed police suspect that he kidnapped two soldiers from our country. It’s very likely that he wants to make a deal with the police in exchange for the drugs seized by the police.","“Our country will not return the drugs. We’ll only deal with him in terms of time. Also, the reason why Qin Maosheng has been active in Myanmar is because of the support of the Myanmar military. Our soldiers were kidnapped by him, but the Myanmar military is turning a blind eye to it.","“Since Yijin’s life isn’t in danger now, the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade from the Yun Province’s military district is already secretly following her to ensure her and the other female soldier’s safety.","“We also discovered that Qin Maosheng is planning to kidnap more of our soldiers. Little Ye, we don’t just want to save the two female soldiers. We also plan to...”","Commander Xia paused for a moment before continuing, “We plan to infiltrate Qin Maosheng’s side and execute the decapitation strike. Little Ye, if you go, you’ll be the sharpest knife in our hands. The decapitation strike will be carried out by you. The danger you face is unpredictable. Little Ye, you have to think carefully.”","Based on the intelligence from the frontlines, they knew that Qin Maosheng was still planning to kidnap their soldiers. After some discussion, the Yun Province military and border defense armed police officers decided to send a soldier to test the waters. They wanted to send the soldier to get close to Qin Maosheng before killing him.","Not only could this serve as a deterrent, but it could also let the other mafia bosses know the consequences of offending China.","If they dared to kidnap Chinese soldiers, they might lose their lives entirely!","The wind on the roof was strong. Ye Jian was exceptionally calm when the wind blew against her. She replied without any hesitation, “I’ve made my decision. I can act at any time!”","Commander Xia was silent for a few seconds before continuing, “Okay, I’ve already bought you a plane ticket. I’ll give you ten minutes to pack up. Ten minutes later, your company commander will personally drive you to the airport. The Yun Province military district is currently in contact with your company. You can pack your luggage and leave for Yun Province immediately.”","“Yes!” Ye Jian replied. Her voice was clear and sharp, like a sword that could split the darkness.","Very soon, the battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion received a call from the military district of Yun Province. Ye Jian, a student from the military school who came to the company to study, needed to leave for Yun Province immediately. The transfer order was given directly by the military.","The transfer order came from the military. The battalion commander of the 3rd Battalion didn’t dare to ask for the reason. He followed the military’s request and asked the company commander to personally send the student, Ye Jian, to the airport.","Ding Ling, who was in the same dormitory, was a little stunned when she saw Ye Jian packing her luggage after receiving a call. “It’s not time for us to go back to school yet, right? Why are you packing your luggage?”","“I have some things to take care of. I’ll leave the company for a few days and return after I’m done.” Ye Jian didn’t pack anything. She didn’t even need to bring her military uniform. She just needed to bring two sets of training clothes."]},{"number":3871,"title":"Chapter 3871: You Can Come Back","paragraphs":["Chapter 3871: You Can Come Back","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ding Ling wanted to ask where Ye Jian was going but when she saw the unfamiliar coldness in Ye Jian’s eyes, she swallowed her words and said softly, “Be careful.”","Ye Jian’s expression was a little sharp. Ding Ling didn’t dare to ask too much.","After packing her luggage, Ye Jian zipped up her travel bag and smiled at Ding Ling. Carrying the two small bags that only had two sets of clothes for training and two sets of undergarments, she left the dormitory without looking back.","Ye Jian took six minutes from the moment she hung up the phone to packing her luggage. Six minutes later, she went downstairs and walked through the sports ground to the Jeep parked at the entrance of the camp.","The company commander, who was sitting in the driver’s seat, saw Ye Jian walking over and hurriedly started the car. When Ye Jian pulled the door open and got into the car, the company commander tightened his grip on the steering wheel.","It seemed that they really couldn’t keep Ye Jian here. This transfer order came directly from the military. When the battalion commander heard that it was a direct call from Commander Xia, his first reaction was that it was a liar!","Fortunately, he held his breath and didn’t question him immediately. If not, he would definitely have gotten scolded! How dare he call the commander-in-chief a liar? Was he trying to rebel?","Even the commander-in-chief had stepped in. The company commander found it difficult to talk to Ye Jian now.","As Ye Jian was thinking about Zhou Yijin, she only exchanged a few words with the company commander before getting into the car. When they reached the airport, the company commander personally took her bags down from the back seat and stood in front of Ye Jian. Smiling, he said, “Ye Jian, your studies haven’t ended. You can only leave the company on the 12th of January. Don’t forget.”","He didn’t know why Ye Jian was going to Yun Province but even the commander-in-chief called the camp personally. This meant that the purpose of her trip wasn’t simple. The company commander didn’t need to say anything else. He just told her that all the soldiers in the company were waiting for her to return safely.","Ye Jian took over the bags and nodded heavily. She saluted the company commander. “Don’t worry, Company Commander. I’ll definitely rush back and write the report!”","“Hahaha, that’s right. Don’t forget that you still have a report to write. If you don’t write it properly, I won’t praise you in your report when you return to the military school.”","Ye Jian was an interesting female student. In less than half a month, the company commander knew that this female soldier would not be an ordinary person in the future. She was not an ordinary person even now. It would be even more so in the future.","She had already caught the attention of the military. She was nothing short of amazing.","At 4:40 pm, Ye Jian took a plane to Yun Province. Two hours later, she arrived at Changshui Airport. At 7:00 pm, Ye Jian walked out of the airport. The car sent by the Yun Province border defense drug company had been waiting for a long time.","This was the second time Ye Jian came to Yun Province. The first time, she accompanied the diplomat, Qin Xiu. This time, she came alone.","There were two armed police officers in the car. They were both veterans who had served at the borders of Yunnan Province for more than six years. They were very familiar with Qin Maosheng. As soon as Ye Jian got into the car, they took the time to tell Ye Jian about Qin Maosheng in detail.","Ye Jian was holding a photo in her hand. In the photo was Qin Maosheng, who was wearing a military uniform. He was holding a rifle in his hand. Behind him stood a group of subordinates who were also holding rifles. In the corner of the photo, one could see mortars.","From the picture alone, one could tell that Qin Maosheng had some firepower in his hands.","In the car, the armed police officers said to Ye Jian in a low voice, “We’ve been looking for his nest, but we haven’t found it. Also, we don’t know which military power is supporting him, which is why we don’t dare to cooperate with the Myanmar military. Qin Maosheng also knows our determination to kill him. That’s why he only stays in Myanmar and never crosses our borders.”"]},{"number":3872,"title":"Chapter 3872: Nothing To Do With Gender","paragraphs":["Chapter 3872: Nothing To Do With Gender","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian was the core of this mission. The armed police officers explained the entire combat deployment clearly. Sometimes, they would even ask Ye Jian if she understood and if there was anything she didn’t understand.","They all knew how important Ye Jian was, so they didn’t dare to be careless.","“This time, you only have one main mission—get close to Qin Maosheng and kill him secretly. After you succeed, the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade will help you leave Myanmar.","“Ye Jian, this mission is very dangerous, and you’ll be completing it alone. When you escape, the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade can only support you from the periphery. They can’t support you all the way.","“Previously, we planned to send a male soldier from the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade to pretend that he was kidnapped by Qin Maosheng. Then, he’d find an opportunity to kill Qin Maosheng. However, Qin Maosheng wants to kidnap our soldiers and is only targeting female soldiers. Unfortunately, the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade hasn’t recruited any female soldiers yet. Our drug hunting team doesn’t have any female soldiers who can enter the enemy’s territory and fight alone. Commander Xu mentioned you...”","Ye Jian raised her head from the photo and looked at the armed police officer who was talking to her. “Is the Commander Xu you’re talking about Captain Xu Yu?”","“That’s right. Commander Xu said that as long as we mention him to you, you’ll definitely know who he is. Commander Xu said that four years ago, our comrades from the border defense drug inspection team cooperated with you. It’s all thanks to you that we were able to kill all the fugitives.”","She didn’t expect to meet a team that she had cooperated with once before. Four or five years ago, they went to the border to survive in the wild. Xu Yu’s main team cooperated with the border defense team and wiped out a group of people making drugs. That time, a scout was sacrificed. It was also... the first time she saw her comrade get sacrificed. Because of this, her emotions were affected. It was Captain Xia who enlightened her and made her mood improve gradually.","This time, they met again.","She had to admit that she was fated with Commander Xu’s soldiers.","The person who picked Ye Jian up was a veteran armed police officer. However, he didn’t know about Ye Jian’s cooperation with Xu Yu’s main team. He only knew that the female student in front of him was quite powerful. She was a sniper and had strong individual combat ability. When Commander Xu mentioned her, he said that he couldn’t find another female soldier who was qualified for this mission.","Xu Yu’s commander-in-chief reported to the Yun Province military district. The military district also mentioned it to the military. In the end, the person-in-charge nodded. It was only then that he and his comrade went to the airport.","Ye Jian didn’t expect Xu Yu to still remember her and even think of letting her participate in this mission. This time, it was all thanks to Commander Xu. If not, she might not be able to participate in this mission.","She had to thank Commander Xu properly.","Ye Jian smiled and asked, “Where is Commander Xu now? Can I see him?”","“Yes, Commander Xu said that he didn’t manage to apologize to you in person last time. This time, he’ll personally drive you... over.” Probably because he knew that the place they were going to send Ye Jian was the place they’d lure Qin Maosheng to kidnap her, the voice of the armed police officer became softer. There was even a hint of guilt in his eyes.","This was a matter of life and death. The male soldiers should be the ones rushing to the front, but a female soldier had to do it. The male soldiers felt a little guilty.","Ye Jian didn’t think much of it. Male soldiers and female soldiers were the same. They were all wearing military uniforms, so why would they differentiate between males and females? They were all soldiers!"]},{"number":3873,"title":"Chapter 3873: Argument","paragraphs":["Chapter 3873: Argument","Editor: Henyee Translations","While Ye Jian was going to the border defense company to meet Xu Yu, Du Kaiwei, who was far away in the capital city, was furious at his younger sister, Du Jiayi, for the first time.","There was no other reason. It was because Du Jiayi had eavesdropped on his conversation with the battalion commander of the military unit.","“Du Jiayi, I think you’re getting worse. You don’t even have basic etiquette anymore. What have you been doing after leaving the military unit for so long? Didn’t you say that you wanted to enter the Ministry of Foreign Affairs? What about your results? What are you doing every day?”","Du Kaiwei was a narrow-minded person. No matter if his family was right or wrong, his immediate reaction would be to protect them. However, he was a soldier and a regimental commander. He had to set an example and pay special attention to the confidentiality of the military unit.","However, he didn’t expect that even around his family, he needed to be on guard. He hid in the study to receive a call from the military unit, but his younger sister actually eavesdropped!","This time, Du Kaiwei was so angry his face had turned red. If word got out, he would have to give up his title as regimental commander!","Du Jiayi couldn’t help but eavesdrop when she heard the name ‘Ye Jian’. She didn’t expect to be shouted at by her brother. She was stunned for a moment. She didn’t react for a long time and stared at Du Kaiwei in disbelief.","Madam Li, who was playing with her grandchildren downstairs, heard her eldest son flying into a rage upstairs and asked her eldest daughter-in-law to go up and take a look. “Yun, what’s going on? Go take a look at my eldest son. It’s the new year. Why is he so angry?”","Du Kaiwei’s wife, Tian Yun, glanced upstairs. She didn’t go up. Instead, she smiled and said, “It’s okay, Mom. Kaiwei is a hot-tempered person. Don’t you know that? He’s shouting now, but he’ll be fine in a while. Don’t worry.”","Then, she smiled at her son and said, “Dan, don’t you want to go next door to play with your friends? Why don’t you go with Grandma?”","Tian Yun knew that her husband was angry at her sister-in-law, Du Jiayi. Although she didn’t know why, it was better to not get close to them at a time like this. Even as Du Jiayi’s sister-in-law and Du Kaiwei’s wife, she couldn’t persuade either of them. Thus, she might as well avoid them.","Knowing her mother-in-law’s personality, Tian Yun simply asked her son, who was already in the first grade, to lure her away.","Madam Li’s anger disappeared bit by bit after her grandson came back. Now that her grandson said that he wanted to go next door to play, she didn’t care about the quarrel between the siblings upstairs anymore. She prepared to bring her grandson over next door.","However, she was still worried. When they reached the door, Madam Li said, “Go up and keep an eye on them. Kaiwei has a bad temper and has been in the military unit for too long. He shouldn’t use the military unit’s methods at home. Also, remind them that you still have to go to their grandma’s house for dinner later. They shouldn’t fight till their faces turn red or it’ll be an embarrassing sight later.”","“I understand, Mom. Go out and play with Dan for a while. I’ll pack my things and go to Grandma’s house early. Dan said that he hasn’t seen her in a long time and wants to accompany her.”","Madam Li didn’t say much. She just brought her grandson out.","After her mother-in-law left, Tian Yun’s expression turned colder. She had never liked her sister-in-law.","She was scheming, but she pretended to be magnanimous. In the first year of Tian Yun’s marriage, she suffered two huge losses at the hands of her sister-in-law. Fortunately, her husband was transferred to Nanguang. She didn’t say anything because she didn’t want to see her sister-in-law’s two-faced nature."]},{"number":3874,"title":"Chapter 3874: Did You Get Brain Damage","paragraphs":["Chapter 3874: Did You Get Brain Damage","Editor: Henyee Translations","Tian Yun knew that her sister-in-law was not someone to be trifled with. She must have done something to provoke her husband.","Her mother-in-law asked her to go up and take a look. Ha, she wanted her husband to scold Du Jiayi for longer!","However, if she didn’t show up at all, her powerful sister-in-law wouldn’t let her off.","Hence, Tian Yun raised her voice from downstairs and said, “It’s the new year. If you have anything to say, say it properly. If you really can’t, go into a room and close the door. Don’t subject everyone else to it. Those who don’t know might think that there’s a fight at home.”","Du Jiayi was a prideful person. When she heard her sister-in-law’s voice, her face turned red. She woke up from her daze and jumped into the study like a cat whose tail had been stepped on. At the same time, she pushed her brother, who was standing at the door of the study and scolding her, inside.","“I didn’t do anything. Brother, aren’t you making a mountain out of a molehill? Even if I did eavesdrop on your conversation with the military unit, what could I have heard? There was a door between us!","“Besides hearing Ye Jian’s name, I didn’t hear anything else. I don’t know what you said to the battalion commander in your military unit! I didn’t hear anything but you’re scolding me for it. Brother, you’re too unreasonable!”","After entering the study, Du Jiayi reprimanded Du Kaiwei for being unreasonable and scolding her.","Du Kaiwei was so angry that he laughed. “You heard Ye Jian’s name, and you know that it was the battalion commander of my regiment who called. Yet you’re saying that you didn’t hear anything. How do you know that it was the battalion commander of my regiment, then?","“Du Jiayi, did you suffer from brain damage?!’","The more Du Kaiwei spoke, the angrier he got. He slammed his palm on the desk. The sound was so loud that Du Jiayi’s heart skipped a beat and her face tensed up.","Seeing that Du Kaiwei’s expression was getting darker, Du Jiayi gritted her teeth and didn’t dare to talk back anymore. She bit her lips and apologized unhappily, “I’m sorry, Brother. I didn’t do it on purpose. I heard Ye Jian’s name, so I couldn’t help it.","“I didn’t hear anything else. I only know that... the military directly issued an order for Ye Jian. I wanted to know where she went, but you didn’t mention it...”","Fortunately, he didn’t say anything!","As she apologized, Du Kaiwei, whose expression was gradually getting better, snorted. He raised his hand to pull the chair over to the desk. Then, he sat down and stared at Du Jiayi with a serious expression. He said in a low voice, “Jiayi, if you’re prejudiced against Ye Jian because of Ye Ying, you’re making a mistake!","“Although Ye Jian and Ye Ying are cousins, their personalities are completely different. Ye Ying wanted to use underhanded methods to climb up the social ladder, but Ye Jian is different. Her skills and studies are outstanding. She doesn’t need any other methods to climb up the social ladder. She can reach a height that even you can’t!","“She’s an outstanding military school student. Previously, you said that she used Ye Ying as a stepping stone to pass the university entrance examination. You also said that she deliberately framed Ye Ying so that she could be in the limelight. I’ve been observing Ye Jian recently. She’s not the kind of person you made her out to be. So, Jiayi, you have to change your temper. Don’t act like you know best.","“Let’s talk about Uncle. Wasn’t he glorious in the past? Didn’t he bring glory to the Li family? And now? He has become a humiliation to the Li family. I don’t dare to mention the Li family at all!”"]},{"number":3875,"title":"Chapter 3875: Eavesdropping","paragraphs":["Chapter 3875: Eavesdropping","Editor: Henyee Translations","Du Kaiwei had always been very good to his younger sister. The last time, he didn’t have a good chat with Du Jiayi because he didn’t know Ye Jian well. This time, Du Kaiwei wanted to have a good chat with her.","He said earnestly, “If Mom didn’t say that she wanted to go back to the Li family to visit Grandma, I wouldn’t have wanted to go over at all. Jiayi, you’re not young anymore. You’re already 25 years old. You can’t throw a tantrum like before. I won’t be able to indulge you like before and let you do whatever you want.","“Because of Uncle’s matter, our Du family has been targeted by the Military Disciplinary Committee. Do you still think that our family isn’t chaotic enough and want to continue causing trouble?","“Look at Dad. He can’t even go home during the new year. He’s already the staff officer of the headquarters and has the military rank of a major general. But because of Uncle...”","Du Kaiwei couldn’t continue because the position of staff officer was a little awkward now. The power in his father’s hands was getting smaller and smaller, and the weight of his words was getting lesser. A few days ago, when they were chatting, Staff Officer Du even revealed to his eldest son, Du Kaiwei, that he wanted to leave the office.","Du Kaiwei was shocked.","He was only a regimental commander now. If Staff Officer Du retired, there would be no one to back him. It would be inconvenient for him to do anything.","Du Kaiwei chatted with Staff Officer Du for a long time before he understood why his father wanted to give up on his post.","Her family was a huge part of the reason!","It could be said that Du Jiayi had bumped into the muzzle of a gun today. Du Kaiwei, who had wanted to talk to his sister, exploded with anger.","He had a good idea of whether or not Du Jiayi had eavesdropped and how much she knew. When the other party was talking about the main points, he didn’t say much. He only replied with things like yes, okay, sure. When he mentioned Ye Jian’s name, he just wanted to confirm that the military did not make a mistake. Who knew that Du Jiayi would hear it?","Fortunately, he had developed a habit. Even at home, he wouldn’t mention anything important. That was why Du Jiayi didn’t hear where Ye Jian was transferred to.","Du Kaiwei’s original intention was to let Du Jiayi let go of her prejudice against Ye Jian. However, the more he spoke, the deeper Du Jiayi’s prejudice against Ye Jian became. Hearing that, her eyes widened and she said, “Brother, are you attracted to Ye Jian’s face too? Is that why you’re speaking up for her?!”","When Du Kaiwei heard this, he was so angry that he slammed the table and shouted, “You’re getting more and more outrageous! Ye Jian relies on her real talent and knowledge. Why are you twisting the truth with your words?!","“It’s fine to talk about it in front of me, but if you dare to talk nonsense in front of your sister-in-law, don’t blame me for being impolite!”","This was good. It reminded Du Jiayi of who she should use to teach Ye Jian a lesson!","She didn’t need to look for other people. She could just look for her sister-in-law!","Du Jiayi’s gaze flickered slightly. She immediately lowered her head and replied obediently, “Oh.” In order to not let Du Kaiwei see what she was planning, she deliberately asked, “Brother, where did Ye Jian get transferred to? Since you said that she’s so powerful, is she going to bigger and better places?”","“Didn’t you get scolded enough just now? How dare you ask?” Du Kaiwei glared at her.","Since she wanted to use another person to deal with Ye Jian now, Du Jiayi stopped asking. She stuck out her tongue and said playfully, “I don’t dare to ask anymore. Brother, don’t be angry.”"]},{"number":3876,"title":"Chapter 3876: Envy","paragraphs":["Chapter 3876: Envy","Editor: Henyee Translations","Du Jiayi knew how to calm her brother down very well. She pouted and pretended to be aggrieved. “I admit that I have a deep prejudice against Ye Jian. It’s her fault for offending me in the past. Also, all of you said that she’s amazing. Ha, I’m not convinced! I feel that I’m much better than her!","“Also, Brother, you can’t expect me to get rid of my prejudice against her immediately, right? I have to take it slow. Don’t worry, I won’t say a word about your conversation with the military unit. I promise, I swear!”","She smiled and made funny faces. In the end, she even ran over to massage Du Kaiwei’s shoulders. As expected, after a while, Du Kaiwei’s face was no longer gloomy.","He said dotingly, “Don’t say that you’re better than Ye Jian. She’s really a rare talent. All the soldiers in the company respect her. You’re indeed better than her in some aspects, such as singing and dancing.","“I heard that Qin Xiu likes musicals. You can focus more on this and try to have a common interest with him. You have to take an exam to get into the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, so you need to work on it.","“Qin Xiu is not bad. I support you.”","At the mention of Qin Xiu, Du Jiayi pursed her lips. She had been wooing Qin Xiu for so long. Even Mrs. Qin was very happy at the idea of her and Qin Xiu becoming a couple. However, Qin Xiu always kept a distance from her. From the moment he rejected her until now, he had never given her hope.","Du Kaiwei sensed that his younger sister was in a bad mood, so he didn’t ask her to massage his shoulders anymore. He turned his chair and faced Du Jiayi. He asked with concern, “What’s wrong? Is Qin Xiu not good?”","“It’s not that. He’s very good. I’ve been pursuing him for so long, but he’s not reacting to anything I do.”","“He didn’t say anything? That shouldn’t be the case. Does Qin Xiu have a woman he likes?”","His words woke Du Jiayi up. Hearing that, a vicious look flashed past Du Jiayi’s eyes. That was right, she had been pursuing him for so long, but there was no result. It was probably like what her brother said—Qin Xiu had someone he liked!","Who dared to snatch her boyfriend?!","“Qin Xiu is 28 years old. It’s normal for him to like someone. If he does, he needs the Qin family’s approval. Since Mrs. Qin supports you and Qin Xiu, it means that the woman Qin Xiu likes hasn’t been recognized by the Qin family.","“For a family like the Qin family, both families’ consent are important for marriage. Most importantly, their families need to be compatible and the parents need to be satisfied. Jiayi, your chances of winning are higher.”","Even so, she didn’t want the man she liked to like other women. She would never allow such a thing to happen!","She needed to investigate properly.","Coincidentally, it was the new year now. She could investigate where Qin Xiu went during the new year and which ladies he met. This way, she could basically find out who the woman Qin Xiu liked was.","At the mention of Qin Xiu, Du Jiayi threw the matter of scheming against Ye Jian aside and thought about how to find out Qin Xiu’s whereabouts for the past few days.","Du Kaiwei naturally stood on his sister’s side and even helped to investigate secretly.","It was very simple to know where Qin Xiu had been for the past few days. Madam Li brought her grandson home and called Madam Qin after hearing her daughter’s reminder. She only received one reply—Qin Xiu had been at the Fu family’s house all day, playing chess with Old Master Fu.","Grandpa Fu didn’t have any women in his family!","Du Jiayi finally felt at ease. In the afternoon, she happily accompanied Madam Li to the Li family. Du Kaiwei and his family were also accompanying her."]},{"number":3877,"title":"Chapter 3877: Hidden Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 3877: Hidden Danger","Editor: Henyee Translations","In the car, Du Kaiwei received a few more calls from the military unit. They didn’t report to him about Ye Jian again.","When Du Jiayi reached the Li family’s home, she forgot about her promise. She said to Old Master Li and Second Old Madam Li with an aggrieved expression that she had been reprimanded by her brother, Du Kaiwei, because of an annoying outsider. Then, right on the heels of that, Second Old Madam Li asked who the outsider was. Du Jiayi directly said Ye Jian’s name.","Old Master Li narrowed his eyes when he heard this.","He found out that his son died at sea because of the old case of a martyr surnamed Sun. At the same time, he found out that this martyr surnamed Sun had married into a family with the surname Ye.","The person his granddaughter didn’t like had the surname Ye too. He really didn’t like the surnames Ye and Sun!","Old Master Li didn’t think that Ye Jian was related to the martyr surnamed Sun who he investigated. He only paid more attention to her because of her surname. However, he didn’t ask further. He just remembered Ye Jian’s name in his heart and said, “Don’t interact with Ye Jian in the future. Your mother was also humiliated by two people with the surname Ye. It can be seen that Ye Jian isn’t a good person.”","Old Master Li’s words allowed Du Jiayi to find solace in him. She nodded in agreement. “That’s right, that’s right. Grandpa is still the smartest. You’re not like my brother. Just because Ye Jian is good-looking, he forgave her easily! Sister-in-law, hurry up and control Brother. Don’t let him be mesmerized by the shady women outside.”","Ye Jian’s name was casually smeared by Du Jiayi.","Du Kaiwei didn’t know about this as he had gone outside to answer a call. He only knew that his wife, Tian Yun, had a forced expression on her face when he came back.","No one talked about what Du Jiayi said earlier. It wasn’t until Tian Yun mentioned it before they went to bed that Du Kaiwei knew what Du Jiayi said. His expression was so gloomy it was as if dark clouds were hovering above his face.","If it wasn’t for the fact that Du Jiayi was staying at the Li family’s house and didn’t return to the Du family’s house, Du Kaiwei would have kicked the door open to give her another round of scolding!","It was late at night in the capital city. Many people had already fallen into a deep sleep. Ye Jian didn’t reach the border defense company until 11:pm.","Xu Yu, the captain of the border defense drug hunting team, saw Ye Jian push the door open and step down from the car. He strode forward to welcome her.","He and Ye Jian hadn’t seen each other since the competition in Australia ended. When they met again, Xu Yu looked at Ye Jian who was wearing a training uniform and sighed. “At that time, you were still a junior high student while I was just an ordinary border defense armed police officer. Now that we meet again, you’ve already become a soldier and I’m getting old.”","Six or seven years ago, Xu Yu was 29 years old. Now, he was 35 or 36 years old. He wasn’t old, but his gaze was sharper than before. When he glanced over, he gave off an aura that made criminals panic.","Ye Jian smiled and said, “I didn’t expect to have a third chance to cooperate with you. Please take care of me this time, Captain Xu.”","“No, no. I should be the one asking you to take care of me.” Xu Yu smiled as he looked at the woman who was still skinny and weak in the past. Now, she had become a young soldier with sharp eyes. He sighed in his heart. Time passed too quickly. In the blink of an eye, the little girl who shocked him in the past had become a soldier who could fight alone.","They didn’t catch up. Ye Jian would only stay at the border defense company for a short time. She had to rush to a certain border defense pass where Qin Maosheng’s men would appear at night."]},{"number":3878,"title":"Chapter 3878: The Most Suitable Female Soldier","paragraphs":["Chapter 3878: The Most Suitable Female Soldier","Editor: Henyee Translations","Actually, there was no arts performance planned at the border defense entrance. In order to cooperate with the armed police and the Yun Province military district, the art troupe adjusted their performance plan at the last minute and went to the entrance where Qin Maosheng’s subordinates would appear.","To ensure the safety of the soldiers from the troupe, all the soldiers knew that they were just cooperating with a decapitation strike. They mustn’t leave the camp alone. After the performance ended, everyone would stay in the camp. No one was allowed to go out.","There were very few female soldiers at the border defense and the border gates. There weren’t many female soldiers in the company. Almost all the communication was done by male soldiers. When the arts troupe came to the company for the arts performance, they went to the village to perform. Hence, Qin Maosheng, who knew that the arts troupe had come to the border defense, treated the female soldiers as his targets.","He didn’t target male soldiers because female soldiers were easier to control than male soldiers. It would make the Chinese side nervous too.","Ye Jian rushed to the company that had an arts performance that night and arrived at 3:00 am. Right on the heels of that, she changed into the military uniform of the female soldiers and entered the arts troupe.","Xu Yu, who had sent Ye Jian over, quietly looked at the young soldier who came out after changing into her military uniform. His fingers trembled slightly.","He walked over and raised his hand to straighten Ye Jian’s soldier cap. His eyes were already red. “Ye Jian, I look forward to cooperating with you for the fourth time, the fifth time... countless times.”","Why was he letting Ye Jian take the risk again?","That was because he had no other choice.","Zhou Yijin chose Ye Jian, Qin Maosheng chose a female soldier, and Ye Jian... was the most suitable female soldier.","Xu Yu adjusted Ye Jian’s military cap and her epaulet. He took three steps back and saluted the young female soldier who dared to enter the tiger’s den alone.","“Captain Xu, wait for my good news.” Ye Jian replied to Xu Yu so easily. Then, she turned and walked into the camp without looking back.","Xu Yu stood on the spot and watched as the young and brave female soldier walked into the darkness. Then, she walked to the place illuminated by the street lamps. Her slender figure was as straight as a gun. She walked out of his vision completely.","The information provided by the informant was correct. Qin Maosheng’s men didn’t send children out to pretend that they were hit by a motorcycle. They sent a pregnant woman to pretend that she was accidentally hit by a car from the arts troupe. Then, the entire car was surrounded by residents. Ye Jian got out of the car under these circumstances and sent the pregnant woman to the hospital for a check-up with a male soldier from the arts troupe.","They were about to reach the hospital near the entrance. The male soldier received a call from the regiment and had no choice but to get off the car halfway. Ye Jian brought the pregnant lady to the hospital alone.","All this was observed by the border defense armed police. From the moment the pregnant woman pretended to be hit by a car, the armed police knew that something was going to happen!","As expected, before the car reached the hospital, something happened to Ye Jian.","The trick the other party used on Zhou Yijin appeared again. The pregnant lady leaning on Ye Jian covered her nose with trichloromethane...","Before she fainted, Ye Jian had already memorized the features of the driver and the fake pregnant lady. When she woke up, her eyes and legs were tied up, but the silver wire was still around her wrist.","She didn’t know where she would be taken to. At this moment, Ye Jian had completely lost her sense of direction. She had to go wherever the other party brought her to.","Qin Maosheng knew that his subordinates had kidnapped another female soldier. He laughed and said to Cobra, “Did you hear that? This is the consequence of angering me. I’ll use even crueler methods to return the favor. I’ll let them know how powerful I am.”"]},{"number":3879,"title":"Chapter 3879: A Lonesome Journey","paragraphs":["Chapter 3879: A Lonesome Journey","Editor: Henyee Translations","Cobra had kidnapped government forces before. Hence, he didn’t find it strange. Also, he didn’t know much about China. Cobra, who had always been smart and cunning, made a wrong judgment in this matter. This made him think that the Chinese border defense police weren’t ordinary. It wasn’t like what Luke said, about China being a restricted area for mercenaries.","Hence, Cobra believed that he could enter China.","Luke and Xia Jinyuan, who had infiltrated China illegally, had not returned safely. When Cobra saw Qin Maosheng laughing happily, he laughed too.","The kidnapping of the Chinese female soldier was done well. It would attract the attention of the Chinese border defense police and reduce the danger Luke and Xia faced. This was why when Cobra knew about Qin Maosheng’s kidnapping plan, he strongly supported it.","A huge net was laid out by the main forces of China. They had no contact with the Myanmar military at all. They sent a female soldier to enter the tiger’s den alone in the most dangerous way, going straight for Qin Maosheng’s head.","Ye Jian was the most important person in this huge net. She wasn’t in charge of rescuing Zhou Yijin and the other female soldier now. She was going to take Qin Maosheng’s head directly.","Maybe she wouldn’t be able to see Qin Maosheng...","No one knew for sure.","Why was the commander-in-chief angry about the plan? It was because this was a gamble. It was a gamble with Ye Jian’s life on the line.","The enraged commander-in-chief chose to give in in the end. Even if he knew that there wasn’t a 100% chance of success, the Chinese were willing to take the risk.","The other party had already revealed their guns and even dared to set a trap to kidnap their soldiers. If the Chinese side continued to bear with it and only sent people to save the two female soldiers, it would undoubtedly increase the arrogance of the other party!","China wouldn’t provoke an irrational conflict. However, in the face of guns, the Chinese soldiers wouldn’t remain silent. When it was time to show their swords, they must show their swords!","Ye Jian was this shining sword. She had already been unsheathed. Even if there was only a 1% chance, she would take action!","There was no backup. There was no way out. They could only move forward.","A lonely journey of thousands of miles, a possible farewell... Perhaps this time, it would really be a farewell. Perhaps the soldier would not return this time and her blood would stain the green mountain.","The commander-in-chief knew this, and so did Xu Yu.","However, Ye Jian didn’t think that she would have to bid farewell. She had the confidence to escape and believed that she could do it.","Now, the only thing she needed to worry about was whether she could see Qin Maosheng or not. Only when she saw him would she have the chance to make a move.","The criminals who were active at the borders had their own way of survival. They wouldn’t pass through the checkpoints normally. Instead, they would enter the village at the border of the two countries and enter the territory of another country through the waterway.","Zhou Yijin and another female soldier left the country in this way. Similarly, Ye Jian left the country in this way too.","The people in the car had already noticed that Ye Jian had woken up. A woman sitting in the back seat pressed something hard against Ye Jian’s waist and said coldly, “What’s pressing against you now is a pistol. If you don’t cooperate, I’ll shoot all the bullets in the pistol into you.”","It was a standard Mandarin dialect. Those who didn’t know better would think that she was Chinese.","Ye Jian was very familiar with this voice. It was the voice of the lady who had pretended to be pregnant and whom she sent to the hospital. Now, the other party’s voice was cold and gloomy. It didn’t sound like her stomach was in so much pain that she needed to go to the hospital for a check-up.","Her stomachache was fake, and so was her pregnancy."]},{"number":3880,"title":"Chapter 3880: Waiting For Them","paragraphs":["Chapter 3880: Waiting For Them","Editor: Henyee Translations","The man driving the car spoke in Burmese. The woman holding the pistol fell silent. However, the pistol in her hand was still pressed against Ye Jian’s waist.","Ye Jian was blindfolded, so she didn’t know that a man sitting in the passenger seat had taken out a syringe filled with medicine from a box. He glanced at the woman sitting in the back seat with Ye Jian.","The moment her wrist was grabbed, Ye Jian seemed to have noticed something, and she panicked for a moment.","“Ye Jian, this trip is filled with danger. You’ll never know what methods the other party will use against you. They won’t be humane. They’ll use all kinds of methods to protect their interests. Once you become their captive, you’ll face many dangers. You must be mentally prepared.","“I’m guessing that you must have undergone captive training. However, the difficulties a real captive faces are many times more brutal than the difficulties you faced during training. You’ll never know what methods they’ll use to deal with you next.","“It’s common for male soldiers to be beaten up, insulted, and injected with drugs. Female soldiers might have to go through worse. There’s a high chance that their bodies will be violated.","“If I didn’t know that Qin Maosheng wanted to kidnap female soldiers to make a deal with us, I wouldn’t have mentioned your name and let you face the danger of being captured.”","This was what Xu Yu said to Ye Jian when they were in the car heading to the border defense.","Ye Jian was mentally prepared. However, when the sharp needle pierced into her skin, she realized that she hadn’t done enough to mentally prepare herself!","Ye Jian’s body gradually softened. She heaved a sigh of relief. It wasn’t what she had thought it would be. The anesthetic was injected into her body. It was an anesthetic that could make her completely dizzy.","Looking at the unconscious Ye Jian, hatred flashed past the eyes of the woman sitting side by side. She still wanted to torture this Chinese female soldier, but her companion in the car didn’t allow it. This made her very angry.","“Our boss still needs her to make deals. If you torture her to death, there’s only one outcome for you. Keep your grudges. Now is not the time to kill her.”","The man sitting in the passenger seat put the syringe back into the box and turned his body. He said to the dark-skinned woman with a slightly flat nose but pretty facial features, “We’re only responsible for sending her over. We can’t kill her directly.”","“But my brother died in the hands of the soldiers from their country. If my brother were still alive, I wouldn’t have been beaten up by my mother! All my current tragedies were caused by the soldiers from their country!”","The woman growled in a low voice. Her pretty features turned hideous instantly. “It’s their country that caused me to lose my brother. My entire family is in pain! I want to kill her. I want to kill her now!”","She was so agitated that the gun in her hand was pressed against Ye Jian’s head.","At this moment, Ye Jian couldn’t resist at all. Even the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who were following her, couldn’t help her.","Being captured meant that her life was in other people’s hands. No matter how powerful Ye Jian’s individual combat ability was, she had lost the ability to resist.","This was something Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to see the most. However, when he wasn’t around, Ye Jian chose to... be captured to cooperate with the border defense drug hunting team.","This was the first time Ye Jian was captured after she entered the military."]},{"number":3881,"title":"Chapter 3881: Oath","paragraphs":["Chapter 3881: Oath","Editor: Henyee Translations","A semicircular red mark appeared on Ye Jian’s temple. The woman, who was roaring in a low voice, had even hooked her finger through the trigger. One more step... and the bullet would pass through Ye Jian’s temple and enter her brain. Then, it would shoot out from her other temple.","The man behind the wheel braked abruptly. The woman with the hideous facial expressions was caught off guard and fell forward. The man on the passenger’s seat quickly snatched the gun from the woman’s hand.","“Dan Yi, if you kill her now, your entire family will be killed by the boss!” The man who snatched the gun reminded her calmly. They were all subordinates of Qin Maosheng. They used to serve in the Myanmar military unit. After they retired, they joined Qin Maosheng’s drug company.","Now, what their boss needed was a living Chinese female soldier, not a dead Chinese female soldier. If they ruined their boss’ plan because of their personal grudge, everyone would end up in a miserable state. Their families would be implicated too!","The car became quiet. The woman called Dan Yi woke up from her madness. She knew that she couldn’t kill the woman sitting beside her today, so she vented her anger and punched Ye Jian in the car.","This time, the two men sitting in front didn’t stop the woman from venting.","Ye Jian, whose body was injected with strong anesthesia, didn’t feel any pain at all. When she woke up again, Ye Jian felt as if she had been stuffed into a barrel. There were bruises all over her body, and her shoulders hurt terribly.","As the dizziness gradually disappeared, Ye Jian felt a dull pain in her chest, arms, and other parts of her body. There was even a burning pain at the corner of her mouth.","She had been beaten up badly!","She wanted to move her curled up body but realized that she didn’t have any space to move. After being beaten up, she was forcefully stuffed into an oval-shaped barrel. Her journey as a captive had just begun, and she felt that she would be treated even more cruelly.","The captive training she received in the past wasn’t enough. Just like what Commander Xu Yu said, she would never know what kind of predicament she would face after being captured.","Ye Jian’s mouth was stuffed with something to prevent her from making any sound. She couldn’t help but smile bitterly. Every time she faced a new challenge, she couldn’t help but recall what Captain Xia once said. He said that the training she was undergoing now was nothing. More difficult days were to come.","Captain Xia was right. When she faced a new predicament, she would know that the training she received in the past was nothing...","A captive. She was a captive now. She wondered what other dangerous things she would face in the future.","At this moment, Ye Jian was actually a little flustered. She knew that she was walking into a tiger’s den. She was mentally prepared, but she still felt uneasy at this moment.","If even she was like this, what about Yijin and the other female soldier?","Wouldn’t they be even more afraid?","Thinking about Zhou Yijin and the other female soldier, Ye Jian started to panic and gradually calmed down.","‘Best of luck, Ye Jian. You’re a special forces soldier! You’re going to save people and carry out a decapitation mission. There’s nothing to panic about!’","Ye Jian started cheering for herself and recited the oath she took when she entered the military.","She had already memorized it in her heart. She recited the oath repeatedly. The powerful, blood-thirsty, and heroic oath... The oath that scattered the panic in Ye Jian’s heart and made her calmer and more composed."]},{"number":3882,"title":"Chapter 3882: Mission","paragraphs":["Chapter 3882: Mission","Editor: Henyee Translations","She was a soldier. She was already prepared to make sacrifices when she wore her military uniform. There was nothing to be afraid of. That was right, there was nothing to be afraid of!","It was a bumpy ride along the river, but Ye Jian kept her spirits up. She moved her tightly tied hands and feet again. She didn’t find a way to untie them. She curled up quietly and held her breath. She used her ears to listen to where she was.","She heard the sound of running water and the sound of machinery. There were no other sounds. It was very likely that she was alone now.","The sound of water, the sound of machinery running, the ups and downs of the waves... She should be on a ship. Captain Xu told her that the kidnapped Yin Jin and the other female soldier left the country through the waterway too. She was in the same state now.","She just didn’t know if she was still in the country or if she had already left.","Ye Jian didn’t struggle. She thought about it quietly. Gradually, her eyes became heavy again. The space in the barrel was small, and the effects of anesthesia still lingered. After swaying for half an hour, Ye Jian fell asleep again.","The ship was still moving. Qin Maosheng still wanted to make a deal with the Chinese police, so Ye Jian was safe for the time being. Since she was safe for the time being, she might as well use the time to conserve her energy.","There was a satellite signal tracker on the soles of Ye Jian’s military boots. Even if the other party left the country without stopping, their whereabouts would be captured by the country’s armed police and the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade in Yun Province. They would also send a disguised assignment cargo ship to follow them.","Xu Yu was on the ship. He stared at the blinking signal. The wireless walkie-talkie in his hand had never left his hand since he boarded the ship. “The speed is too fast. Maintain a speed of ten knots.”","The speed of the other party’s ship was around 12 knots. The Chinese disguised cargo ship followed at a speed of ten knots. The distance between the two was neither too far nor too close. If something happened, they could immediately support Ye Jian without being suspected by the other party.","The river they were in flowed through the four countries of China, Lao, Myanmar, and Thailand. Now, the boat had entered the waters of the Golden Triangle and was about to enter Myanmar.","The ship that Ye Jian was on sailed out of the country at the highest speed. When the ship left the country, the tense expressions of the people on the small cargo ship relaxed.","Now, they were safe!","The disguised Chinese ship slowed down and didn’t follow them closely. After entering Myanmar, it was their turn to be careful.","It had been 36 hours since Ye Jian’s kidnapping.","Ye Jian didn’t know that she had been kidnapped for 36 hours. She felt dizzy after being injected with the strong anesthetic. Shortly after waking up, she would fall asleep again. During the time she was awake, she would listen to her surroundings. When she realized she was still on the ship, she would fall back asleep. By the time the strong anesthetic wore off, 38 hours had passed. It was 11:00 pm the next day.","Less than ten minutes after 11:00 pm, the cargo ship reached the shore. Ye Jian woke up with a start when the cargo ship reached the shore.","The cargo ship stopped. She heard countless footsteps and shouts from above. The people were walking around to move the goods on the ship. They took more than an hour to unload the goods. Ye Jian, who was curled up in the wooden barrel, heard the creaking sound of an iron plate being pulled up. Then, several people stepped on the iron ladder and came down. Gradually, the heavy footsteps got closer and closer. Finally, they stopped beside the wooden barrel."]},{"number":3883,"title":"Chapter 3883: Doesn’t Belong To You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3883: Doesn’t Belong To You","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian was caught off guard when someone pushed the wooden barrel over. The world spun. Amidst the crashing sounds, Ye Jian heard people talking loudly outside. They weren’t arguing. They were excited.","The wooden barrel finally stopped rolling in the corner. Before Ye Jian could catch her breath, the wooden barrel was kicked again. They treated the wooden barrel like a toy. Some people kicked it while others rolled it on the ground. Some people even laughed.","Ye Jian didn’t get a sip of water in the past 38 hours and was kicked around by them like a toy. She curled up completely and swallowed the bitter bile in her mouth several times.","These people did this on purpose to humiliate the Chinese soldier they caught. They were also using this method to satisfy their sense of accomplishment.","Usually, they were the ones avoiding the Chinese armed police. Now, they could finally hold their heads up high.","“If we can’t kill her, let’s have some fun first. Hahaha, a Chinese female soldier from the arts troupe. Did she think that she was very powerful? In the end, she fell into our hands. Hahaha, we can do whatever we want! Hahaha!”","Arrogant laughter kept floating into Ye Jian’s ears. The wooden barrel was still spinning. As long as it stopped, they would kick it immediately. Then, they would push the wooden barrel and roll it around for fun.","One of the guys had always been suppressed by the border defense armed police officers. He didn’t stop kicking the wooden barrel until he got bored of it.","The sound of tools prying could be heard from the lid of the wooden barrel. After a while, fresh air surged in from all directions. Ye Jian lowered her head and kept adjusting her breathing so that her oxygen-deprived brain would become clearer.","Ye Jian didn’t think they were scary after they treated her like this. She just wanted to let them be arrogant for now. She would have a chance to get back at them!","Someone grabbed her shoulder and pulled her out of the barrel in an extremely rough manner. Then, they threw her aside like trash.","The cloth covering Ye Jian’s eyes was released. A weak light entered her eyes. Ye Jian narrowed her eyes slightly and saw at least five people standing in front of her.","“Huh, this lady is very pretty.”","A smiling Burmese man said this meaningfully. There was a wretched smile in his eyes.","He bent down and grabbed Ye Jian’s chin with one hand. He looked around before staring at Ye Jian as if she was an object. He turned his head and asked his companions, “Don’t you have any other thoughts about such a beautiful female soldier?”","After he finished speaking, everyone laughed.","“You’d better not have any thoughts. The boss is still waiting for us to bring her over. If you play her badly, the boss will play you badly.”","“If you miss the touch of a woman, go outside and look for one. Don’t risk your life for this.”","The lustful man released his grip on Ye Jian’s chin after being persuaded by his companions. He said with a sense of pity, “She’s really beautiful. She’s prettier than the women I’ve seen in the past.”","“This beautiful lady doesn’t belong to you. Our boss might be able to enjoy her, though.”","“If our boss doesn’t like her, I might be able to touch her one day.” The lustful man clicked his tongue and stood up. Although he liked beautiful women, he cherished his life more.","Ye Jian didn’t understand what they were saying, but she could get a grasp on their conversation topic from their laughter."]},{"number":3884,"title":"Chapter 3884: Shut Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 3884: Shut Up","Editor: Henyee Translations","Her mouth was stuffed, so she couldn’t express her anger. So, Ye Jian used her eyes to express her anger. Although she wasn’t afraid despite her predicament, she had to express some of the emotions a person should have after being kidnapped.","She couldn’t just watch coldly from the sidelines and pretend to be calm.","Her glare caused the Myanmar criminals to laugh even louder.","A man and a woman walked into the cabin along the iron ladder. The woman saw a few men surrounding the Chinese female soldier while laughing loudly. A twisted ruthlessness flashed past her eyes. She said sarcastically from behind them, “If you want to play so much, why don’t you play with her? She’s in your hands now. You can do whatever you want.","“Why? Are you guys cowards? Don’t dare to play?”","The woman spoke sarcastically. She was trying to incite the men by looking down on them so that they would do something to the Chinese female soldier, whom she hated to the core.","“Dan Yi, it’s alright if you don’t care for your life, but don’t bring the rest of us down with you.” The man who came in with her spoke unhappily. He knew what the woman beside him wanted to do. Her brother was caught and executed by the Chinese armed police back then. She only wanted revenge now and wouldn’t think about other people’s lives.","Ye Jian’s gaze landed on the woman standing at the front. When her gaze landed on the woman’s flat abdomen, she seemed to have understood something. Her eyes were burning with anger.","She used her gaze to question the other party. Why did she pretend to be a pregnant woman and lie to her?","The woman welcomed Ye Jian’s angry gaze and walked closer step by step. Standing in front of Ye Jian, her facial features suddenly distorted. She raised her hand and slapped Ye Jian’s face ruthlessly.","“Just you wait! Staring at me? I’ll gouge out your eyeballs and feed them to the dogs!”","Her sinister voice was filled with hatred. The person who executed her brother wasn’t Ye Jian. However, she was venting her anger on Ye Jian now. She vented all her anger on Ye Jian. She wanted to cut Ye Jian into pieces.","Ye Jian started struggling again. Blood flowed out from the corner of her mouth. She made angry sounds from her throat. The more she struggled, the more excited the woman became. The flames of revenge in her eyes burned brighter.","“You’ll be in pain, and I’ll be happy. Just you wait, Chinese female soldier!” The woman seemed to be extremely satisfied with Ye Jian’s anger. She turned around and said to the men behind her, “You don’t know how to enjoy such a beautiful woman? I really look down on you.”","Sharp sounds filled the entire cabin.","“Dan Yi, shut up! You can risk your life and your entire family’s, but my family and I choose to live!”","The facial expression of the man who appeared with her was very cold. He saw that one of the fellows who was notorious for liking beautiful women was tempted by Dan Yi’s words. He immediately took out the knife from his waist and threw it beside the restless man. “If you don’t want your life, you can kill yourself now. Don’t implicate all of us.”","The lustful Burmese man lowered his head and looked at the knife that was thrown beside his toes. He swallowed his saliva with difficulty. In the end, he didn’t move anymore. Instead, he took a small step back.","He probably felt that it was a little embarrassing for him to take a step back. Hence, he took a step forward. He stared at Ye Jian, who was glaring at him, and chuckled. “Do you see this? Is this female soldier angry? We haven’t done anything to her, but she’s already angry. She’s pretty even if she’s angry. I like her even more!”","“Alright, alright. Hurry up and get off the ship! Don’t waste time!”"]},{"number":3885,"title":"Chapter 3885: Choose To Retaliate","paragraphs":["Chapter 3885: Choose To Retaliate","Editor: Henyee Translations","The woman, who wanted to fool the man, provoked him coldly, “I don’t believe that you don’t have any thoughts about this beautiful woman. Who are you lying to? You’re just lying to yourself.”","“What’s the use of thinking about it? Is a woman more important or is my life more important?”","Of course, his life was more important!","He didn’t fall for it. However, the lustful Burmese man wiped the corners of his mouth. He felt that it was a pity that he couldn’t get what he wanted.","Even if he couldn’t do anything else, he could at least touch her. He had just taken a step forward when he was pulled back by his companion. “What else do you want to do? Get to work!”","“You’re all people that women look down on! Ha, you’re only worthy of playing with those women who need money!” No one dared to really attack the female soldier they caught. In Dan Yi’s anger, she grabbed the hair on the back of Ye Jian’s head and forced Ye Jian to look up at her. “I won’t let you off so easily. Just you wait, Chinese female soldier!”","The moment her hair was pulled tightly by the woman, Ye Jian stopped secretly cutting the ropes. She understood the meaning behind their laughter. Ye Jian was actually preparing to escape...","“Ye Jian, if they violate your body, you don’t have to tolerate it. You can retaliate directly!” Xu Yu had reminded Ye Jian in the car.","Ye Jian’s eyes were burning with anger as she looked at the woman unwillingly. Blood flowed from the corner of her mouth, seeping into the corner of the cloth that was stuffed in her mouth. The taste of rust spread in her mouth.","Her glare made the woman named Dan Yi grit her teeth. In the end, she snorted heavily and released her grip on Ye Jian’s hair.","She didn’t want to die, and she couldn’t succeed in making other people do the deed for her. She could only choose to let go for the time being.","Ye Jian slowly clenched her tied hands. Her palms were already sweaty.","If they really wanted to do something to her just now, she would have chosen to retaliate.","Similarly, Commander Xia had reminded Xu Yu too.","Although they said that, no one knew if Ye Jian would be able to retaliate if they harassed her.","This was a mission filled with variables. Ye Jian, a female soldier, was entering the tiger’s den alone. There were countless possibilities. Even with the signal tracker on her body and even though her current location was known by the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade and the Yun Province Military District, they were still a distance away from Ye Jian. If something really happened, it would be too late.","Countless figures crawled slowly from the cold river to the shore. One by one, they climbed up and entered the dense forest silently like ghosts.","Their speed was very fast. Even if caterpillars fell on them, they didn’t stop moving. They used their fastest speed to approach the female soldier.","“Quick, quick, quick!” The person running at the front shouted in a low voice. He signaled his comrades behind him to follow as soon as possible. They couldn’t take the boat to approach the port where the female soldier was. They could only approach by foot. Now, the port was in front of them. They needed to find the best position to keep an eye on her.","The figures passed through the dense forest. The leaves rustled. It was very soft. It was like the wind blowing past the treetops without leaving any traces. Multiple figures passed by and approached the port.","The lights at the port ahead were lit up. The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who were hiding in the trees, raised their binoculars and observed the movements in front of them. They saw a crew moving the goods ashore in boxes. They communicated quickly with hand signals. Right on the heels of that, two members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade approached the truck parked in front of the port."]},{"number":3886,"title":"Chapter 3886: New Year","paragraphs":["Chapter 3886: New Year","Editor: Henyee Translations","Someone was walking back and forth with a gun. The two of them kicked their feet and jumped onto the truck that was filled with goods. They observed from the closest and most dangerous distance.","The female soldier who infiltrated the ship alone hadn’t gotten off. The signal didn’t move for a long time. They didn’t know what the situation was.","The facial expression of the team leader in charge of tracking was a little serious. It was already 1:00 am. There should be some movements.","At around 1:30 am, Ye Jian, whose hands were tied, appeared in front of the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade.","They saw the female soldier, Ye Jian, tied up with her hands behind her back. In order to prevent her from escaping, there was a rope tied to her feet that only allowed her to take one step at a time. There was a black hood on her head to prevent her from seeing her surroundings and knowing where she was.","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Team tightened their grip on the guns in their hands. Where would the female soldier be brought next? Would she be brought to the village where the other two female soldiers were already at?","“The people in the truck shouldn’t move. They might drive away in the truck.”","The scout reminded the team members who had already infiltrated the truck to observe. “They’re already walking toward the truck with the female soldier. Ten meters... eight meters... five meters... three meters...”","Ye Jian was pushed off the boat. She only knew that it was already nighttime because of the chirping of the insects. She didn’t know what time it was exactly, and she didn’t know how many hours she had been kidnapped.","The man who pushed her off the boat used his stiff Mandarin to warn her not to try to escape. They were surrounded by their men. She couldn’t escape.","Escape?","She only had the thought of escaping when she was in the cabin. Now, she didn’t have the thought of escaping!","“Two meters... Get ready to get in...”","While Ye Jian was pushed into the truck, the scout of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade sneaked down from the tree. The vehicle started, and the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade member continued moving forward.","“Inform Team 1 that the car is heading toward the southeast. We’ll follow them now. Ask them to keep an eye on things. The third female soldier is about to reach her destination.”","The other team was the one following Zhou Yijin and the other female soldier. At this moment, they had already infiltrated a village near a certain military unit in Myanmar. Zhou Yijin and the other female soldier were in the village now. They were temporarily safe.","Qin Maosheng never appeared. It was impossible to confirm if he was in the village.","The village was located deep in the borders of the three countries. It was close to a certain military unit of the Myanmar military, which was the backer of Qin Maosheng. With their protection, it made Qin Maosheng the most difficult drug dealer to catch.","Qin Maosheng wasn’t in the village. He had gone to the headquarters of the military unit to meet his backer.","He didn’t reveal his plan. He only said that there was an international drug dealer, Cobra, who wanted to meet with the backer. Qin Maosheng wanted to see if the backer had the time to meet.","Cobra wanted to meet the high-ranking official of the Myanmar military. When he suggested it, he thought that Qin Maosheng would reject him. Qin Maosheng was actually very generous and said that he could introduce him. Cobra was happy and immediately prepared a bank card with enough US dollars as a greeting gift to the high-ranking official of the Myanmar military.","At this moment, Cobra and Qin Maosheng’s backer were having a good conversation. They were even talking about their future cooperation. One was happy to find a considerable balance in the card, while the other was happy to find the Myanmar military for protection. Hence, both parties seemed very satisfied."]},{"number":3887,"title":"Chapter 3887: Safe, Prosperous, And Wishful","paragraphs":["Chapter 3887: Safe, Prosperous, And Wishful","Editor: Henyee Translations","The high-ranking officials of the Myanmar military even agreed to send people to escort Cobra into China’s territory. He didn’t need to be smuggled in.","Hence, Cobra expressed his deep gratitude.","He had always been cunning and suspicious, and he didn’t lower his guard because of this. According to his investigation, he knew that Qin Maosheng was someone who would do anything for his own benefit. Cobra was a little similar to him. A person like him wouldn’t suddenly become so generous. There must be a reason.","Before he could figure out the reason, his bodyguard received a call from Luke, who had infiltrated China.","Luke said that he and Xia were stopped without any warning. If Xia hadn’t reacted fast enough, they might have been detained by the Chinese armed police.","More importantly, the goods they were in charge of bringing over weren’t drugs. They looked like drugs, but they were just ordinary sugar!","At that moment, Cobra knew why Qin Maosheng was so generous!","As it turned out, Qin Maosheng wasn’t planning on having his subordinates infiltrate China to transport goods. He wanted to use Cobra’s two subordinates to divert the attention of the Chinese police so that it would be easier for Qin Maosheng to kidnap Chinese female soldiers and exchange them for the goods that were detained by the Chinese police.","This was a cunning and vicious wolf. His generosity was fake; his scheming was real.","Introducing him to the higher-up of the Myanmar military might seem like a generous offer on the surface, but what if... he wanted to kill him?","The bodyguard whispered a few words to Cobra beside his ear. Cobra knew what to do, so he controlled his anger and continued chatting happily with the higher-up of the Myanmar military until the end.","Qin Maosheng’s backer really wanted to cooperate with Cobra. After the conversation, he whispered to Qin Maosheng, “We can cooperate. His strength is far above yours. With him, I can earn more money.”","“I think so too. With him, our business will expand and we’ll earn more money.” Qin Maosheng smiled as he spoke. His eyes were gloomy.","He felt that the other party was better at earning money than him. Cobra was really impressive. No wonder Commander-in-chief Minlai had asked him to go out to do something just now. It turned out that he didn’t want Qin Maosheng to listen in.","Had they reached a deal that he didn’t know about?","The coldness in Qin Maosheng’s eyes got deeper and deeper. It seemed like he had miscalculated. He thought that no matter how powerful Cobra was, Cobra wouldn’t be able to make Commander-in-chief Minlai have the intention to cooperate immediately. In the end, after only one exchange, the commander-in-chief had the intention to cooperate. Qin Maosheng had underestimated Cobra!","What kind of person was Cobra?","He had been investigating for a few days, but there was still no news. He only knew that he was the international drug king. Other than that, there was no other information.","Should he... spread the word to the police that an international drug king was trying to infiltrate China?","Before the cooperation even started, the Chinese had already targeted Cobra. Based on the cautiousness of the commander-in-chief, he would definitely reconsider the cooperation with Cobra. Even if he chose to cooperate with Cobra in the end, he would still need Qin Maosheng.","Qin Maosheng, who didn’t want Cobra to snatch his backer, started thinking.","Outside, Cobra, who was waiting for Qin Maosheng to come out, was holding a cell phone with a blocked signal. His eyes were gloomy.","It had been a long time since he had a taste of being schemed against. Yes, the feeling of being schemed against was like drinking a cup of coffee that he hated the most. It filled his heart with a violent desire to kill.","Since the man dared to scheme against him, he would let Qin Maosheng know what the consequences would be.","“How are Luke and Xia now? Where are they?” Cobra asked in a low voice. “Have they been targeted by the Chinese?”"]},{"number":3888,"title":"Chapter 3888: Meeting","paragraphs":["Chapter 3888: Meeting","Editor: Henyee Translations","The bodyguard who received Luke’s call was expressionless. He replied seriously, “They’re temporarily free. We’re not sure if they’ve been targeted. Luke contacted us this afternoon. Fortunately, I left the military unit just now. If not, we wouldn’t have been able to receive all the information outside. If Qin Maosheng wants to attack us, it’ll be difficult for us to escape.”","Cobra had thought of this when he was talking to the higher-up of the Myanmar military. Hence, he chose to talk about the topic that he was interested in and maximize the benefits. He wanted to let the other party know that working with him would earn him more money. This money would provide more and more advanced weapons to his military unit.","He understood the politics of Myanmar and knew what topics would pique the interest of the high-ranking official.","“We don’t have to worry about our safety for the time being. I’m thinking about how Luke and Xia are doing now. If they are targeted...”","He pursed his lips as if he was making a very difficult decision. The bodyguard standing beside him stood quietly and waited for him to speak again.","“If they’re really targeted, there’s no need for the Chinese side to do anything. You can take care of them for me.”","It meant that he wanted to give up on Luke and Xia Jinyuan.","The bodyguard remained expressionless. He just nodded indifferently, indicating that he understood.","Cobra didn’t want to fight with the Chinese military. Their control over the border defense was so strong that even the higher-up of the Myanmar military had a serious expression when he talked about it. It could be seen that the military unit of that country was quite difficult to deal with. Cobra just wanted to look for his old friend in China and didn’t want to meet the military of that country.","No matter how capable Luke and Xia were, he didn’t want to have a conflict with the Chinese military because of them.","He had to give up when push came to shove.","Similarly, when it was time to take revenge, he would find an opportunity to do so.","He remembered Qin Maosheng’s plan.","The two people who were good at scheming had already started scheming against each other before they even succeeded in working together. They kept their thoughts in their hearts and smiled when they saw each other. They didn’t reveal their thoughts at all.","When Cobra left the military unit, it was already past three in the morning. He and Qin Maosheng entered the military unit at night. When they left, they avoided many Myanmar soldiers and rushed back to the village where they were staying.","Around four in the morning, Ye Jian was pushed out of the car. After walking for about ten minutes, she was shoved into a room with a small ventilation window. This was Qin Maosheng’s dungeon.","The moment she was pushed in, Ye Jian heard a rustling sound in the room. Ye Jian, who was pushed forcefully, started struggling. She used her voice to probe if there were other people around.","She heard a sobbing sound. It was so familiar that Ye Jian’s face lit up.","Yijin, it was Yijin!","42 hours after Ye Jian’s kidnapping, she finally met up with Zhou Yijin.","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who were watching outside, sent the latest news back to their country. When Xu Yu received the news, he collapsed in his chair. He had been tense for 42 hours. At this moment, his brain finally got a break.","Ye Jian finally met Zhou Yijin, who had been kidnapped for four days.","Zhou Yijin thought that her sixth cousin-in-law would come and save her but she didn’t expect her to do it in this way. Zhou Yijin, who was resting her head on Ye Jian’s shoulder, couldn’t control her tears at all. They flowed out instantly.","She used such a method to save her. Why was her sixth cousin-in-law so stupid?"]},{"number":3889,"title":"Chapter 3889: Touched","paragraphs":["Chapter 3889: Touched","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Yijin was actually the same as the rest of the Xia family members. She wasn’t someone who would be touched easily. She might seem carefree normally, but at critical moments, she was calm. She wouldn’t be touched easily.","This time, Ye Jian went to her rescue directly. No matter how calm Zhou Yijin was, her tears kept flowing like a broken dam.","She knew that her sixth cousin-in-law would definitely save her. She also knew that her sixth cousin-in-law would know that she was in danger and would immediately contact her third uncle, who could solve the problem. But she really didn’t expect her sixth cousin-in-law to save her in such a way.","If her sixth cousin-in-law got into danger, Zhou Yijin would never be able to risk her life to save her!","At this moment, Zhou Yijin understood why her sixth cousin, who had never fallen in love and whom everyone thought would be single for life, loved Ye Jian so much.","Her sixth cousin-in-law deserved the most beautiful and best love in the world!!","Listening to Ye Jian’s incoherent sounds of comfort, Zhou Yijin’s body, which had been tense for the past few days, relaxed instantly. The more she relaxed, the more she cried.","Sobbing sounds could be heard from her mouth. The other female soldier couldn’t help but cry too.","When this female soldier cried, Ye Jian, who was rubbing her head against Zhou Yijin’s head to comfort her, couldn’t help but be stunned. She had only been focused on comforting Yijin without thinking of comforting her comrade.","She turned her body and wrote a few words awkwardly with her fingers on Zhou Yijin’s palm. Zhou Yijin had cried until her headgear was wet. Zhou Yijin sniffled and moved closer to her comrade who was crying.","For the past few days, the two of them had been writing on each other’s hands to encourage each other. The other female soldier moved too. Soon, the two of them were back to back. Zhou Yijin wrote a few words on her palm.","Then, the female soldier cried even louder.","Ye Jian wasn’t kidnapped like her and Yijin. She was here to save them. That was good, that was good! They didn’t have to be so afraid anymore!","The female soldier cried tears of joy. Zhou Yijin was crying and laughing at the same time. Because her mouth was stuffed with cloth and it didn’t allow her to make a sound, her expression was very funny.","Fortunately, the three of them were wearing balaclavas, so none of them could see each other. It didn’t matter if they were ugly.","Besides, at this moment, no one cared about whether they were ugly or not. They were all happy.","Ye Jian was very happy too. Yijin and her comrade were fine, and they didn’t suffer any torture, Qin Maosheng’s subordinates were afraid that they would be discovered by the Chinese armed police, so they hurried on their way. They didn’t have any other motives.","It seemed that just like what Captain Xu said, they were planning to use them to complete a deal with the Chinese armed police.","As for her, she was waiting for Qin Maosheng to appear and complete her mission.","The leader of the Yun Province military district heaved a sigh of relief when he received Xu Yu’s call. Fortunately, everything went smoothly. Fortunately, nothing went wrong along the way...","Commander Xia, who had been waiting for news from the three juniors, received a call from the military district of Yun Province. He had been sleeping for only three to four hours every night in the past few days. He hung up the phone and washed his cold face.","The hardships in the early stages were finally over. Now, it was time for the next step of the plan.","There was news from Little Six that he had successfully snuck back to Myanmar. There was news from Little Six’s future wife that she had finally met Yijin and the other female soldier who was kidnapped. The four of them were fine."]},{"number":3890,"title":"Chapter 3890: Pursuit","paragraphs":["Chapter 3890: Pursuit","Editor: Henyee Translations","Commander Xia took a towel and wiped the water droplets off his face. When he hung up the towel, he heaved a long sigh.","He didn’t tell Little Ye that Little Six was in Myanmar too. He swallowed his words a few times and realized that he didn’t dare to say it at all. He was afraid that he would distract Little Ye.","Now, the two of them were in Myanmar. The fate of these two children... ran so deep that even the military couldn’t tear it apart!","Cobra had met Qin Maosheng, and Little Ye was in Qin Maosheng’s territory. She would meet the most wanted drug dealer of the Chinese anti-drug police at any time. He wondered if the two children would meet.","If they met, as Xia Jinyuan’s father, he would be happy about their fate.","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan didn’t know that they were so close to each other. One was already in Myanmar while the other was still ‘escaping’ from China and rushing into the dense forest with Luke.","Behind them were the Chinese police and the growling dogs.","They needed to put on a good show. Since they were targeted by the Chinese armed police, how could they escape so easily?","Moreover, the armed police officers chasing Xia Jinyuan didn’t know that one of the two people they were chasing was a soldier from China. They only knew that two drug dealers jumped off the car and escaped. Their agility was much better than the criminals they chased in the past. The complicated forest terrain couldn’t trap them at all. Even the dogs couldn’t catch up to them immediately.","“Over here. Hurry!”","“Surround! Surround!”","“We’re 11 kilometers away from the border. Don’t let them escape!”","“Speed up, assault team! Hurry, hurry, hurry!”","Behind them, the police officers, who didn’t know that they were chasing after a soldier from their country, ran after the two people who were escaping.","The olive-green figures seemed to have become one with the dense forest environment. The armed police officers wore helmets and held steel guns. They didn’t care about the skills of the people they were chasing and whether they had lethal weapons on them. They only knew that the two people who escaped were criminals who harmed the stability of their society. They could either capture them alive or kill them!","In order to prevent Luke from suspecting his identity, Xia Jinyuan only informed a small number of people from the enforcement departments in Yun Province to cooperate with him and Luke at the border defense checkpoints. He didn’t inform anyone else.","That was why he was really being chased now.","The two of them rushed through the dense forest in an extremely sorry state. They didn’t know whether they were going in the right direction at all. They fled wherever it was convenient.","“Xia, if this continues, neither of us will be able to escape. We need to split up! We have to split up! The Chinese armed police are too difficult to deal with. There are also the dogs. With the dogs around, we’ll be found no matter where we run!”","Luke pushed away the leaves that blocked his way and crawled into the dense forest. After his face was pricked several times by caterpillars hiding in the leaves, he touched his burning face and said with a gloomy gaze, “I suspect that all of this is Qin Maosheng’s scheme. But why did he scheme against us? Xia, I can’t understand.”","Xia Jinyuan, who didn’t know that Chinese female soldiers had been kidnapped, couldn’t understand it either. He didn’t understand why Qin Maosheng arranged this scheme. However, since it was a scheme, there must be a plan. It was just that he and Luke didn’t know about it."]},{"number":3891,"title":"Chapter 3891: Escape","paragraphs":["Chapter 3891: Escape","Editor: Henyee Translations","But now, he wasn’t thinking about what Qin Maosheng was scheming. He was thinking about how to escape.","If the two of them acted separately... No.","Based on Cobra’s suspicious personality, if he and Luke split up and both of them returned alive, Cobra would definitely suspect something. After all, if the journey was so dangerous, why were they still able to come back alive?","He wouldn’t voice his suspicions, but he would start to distrust them. It would cause the foundation that Xia Jinyuan had worked so hard to build for more than a year to collapse. He would return to square one.","Hence, it was not advisable to escape separately.","Luke was the bodyguard who Cobra trusted the most. It would be better if the two of them stayed together.","Thus, Xia Jinyuan said, “If we split up and escape, we’ll still be chased. If the two of us escape together, we can still help each other. Don’t talk so much nonsense. Hurry up and run! Run up the mountain. As long as we run out of China, they won’t dare to cross the borders to catch us!”","“I hate being chased by dogs. The feeling of being chased by dogs is too frustrating!” Luke didn’t insist that the two of them escape separately. He had only mentioned it casually. If they really escaped separately... who would manage to escape and who would be caught?","They would either be caught together or escape together.","“If it’s really Qin Maosheng’s scheme, I swear that I’ll find an opportunity to blow his head off when I go back.” Hearing the barking of the dogs getting closer, Luke plunged into the dense forest. His movements were agile.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t stop either. However, when he rushed into the dense forest, he used the defensive weapon in his hand... He used the small folding sharp knife to leave two new marks on a tree.","This meant that only the two of them were escaping and no one was coming to receive them.","The armed police didn’t understand the mark. They didn’t linger around and continued chasing after Xia Jinyuan and Luke.","They didn’t understand what it meant when they saw the two marks. Major General Yang, who had been paying attention to this matter, understood. He sighed softly and said to Xu Yu, “Tell your soldiers that no one has come to reinforce them so far. Only two people are escaping.","“You guys continue to chase after them. If there are three marks, it means that people are coming to reinforce them.”","As the leader of the drug hunting team, Xu Yu would definitely send a certain number of soldiers to cooperate with the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade to secretly protect Ye Jian, who had entered the tiger’s den. As for Xia Jinyuan, he needed to cooperate with the military too and couldn’t ask too much.","Besides Major General Yang and Commander Xia, only Xia Jinyuan’s comrades who went on missions overseas knew that Xia Jinyuan had infiltrated Cobra’s side. No one else knew.","After getting an explanation, Xu Yu vaguely felt that there were undercover agents on their side. There must be more than one person too. There were undercover agents on their side. If not, how would they know that Qin Maosheng planned to kidnap female soldiers and make a deal with China?","An informant was a spy. They had one, and the military... had one too.","The only thing he didn’t understand was that his soldiers were chasing two escaped drug dealers. Why did the military send undercover agents to pose as drug dealers? If the military sent people to pose as drug dealers... Things shouldn’t be so simple.","Xu Yu didn’t know about Cobra, so he didn’t understand the situation.","It was impossible for the military to reveal everything to Xu Yu. He just needed to know that one of the two drug dealers being chased by the armed police was a Chinese soldier."]},{"number":3892,"title":"Chapter 3892: Beautiful Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 3892: Beautiful Land","Editor: Henyee Translations","The morning light slightly shone through. The forest was still pitch-black. Xia Jinyuan and Luke, who had crossed the boundary of the two countries ten minutes ago, collapsed on the soft withered leaves. The two of them panted heavily, their chests heaving up and down. Neither of them wanted to speak. They took deep breaths to calm themselves down.","Xia Jinyuan, who was sniffing the rotten smell of the trees, glanced sideways. His gaze landed in the direction of China. The scenery there was charming. The mountains were like angry dragons meandering. It was so beautiful and majestic...","Xia Jinyuan looked in front of him and smiled.","He didn’t expect that one day, he would have to escape from his country in such a sorry state. He had to admit that the border defense armed police officers from China were very strong. They chased after him relentlessly without stopping. His comrades were like search dogs. No wonder they had become a thorn in the side of those international drug dealers.","If he and Luke were a little slower, the other party would have caught up to them.","Until now, he could still hear their barks. It was really scary.","The smile on Xia Jinyuan’s face got deeper. Although he was almost caught by the Chinese border defense armed police officers a few times, he was still very happy.","He was happy for his country’s border defense.","Xia Jinyuan retracted his reluctant gaze. He closed his eyes and took a deep breath. His mind was filled with the country’s beautiful landscape. He could still feel the sense of security in his country.","The Chinese border defense armed police officers stood in front of the boundary of the two countries and looked at the footprints on both sides. They held the steel guns in their hands tightly. They had let the other party escape!","The search dogs didn’t give up. They barked toward the borders of Myanmar. The officers in charge of taking care of them pulled the ropes tightly and dragged their loyal ‘comrades’ who refused to come back bit by bit. The dogs’ forelimbs were stretched straight.","“Line up!”","The squad leader gritted his teeth and ordered his comrades to gather and return the way they came.","The soldiers with solemn facial expressions looked deeply into the territory of Myanmar again. They left while feeling regretful that they didn’t manage to catch the two transnational ‘drug dealers’.","They couldn’t enter other countries’ territory, and they couldn’t enter other countries’ territory illegally with weapons. No matter how ferocious the search dogs were, they could only leave.","The barking from the mountain gradually disappeared. Luke, who was worried that the Chinese border defense armed police officers would enter the country with guns, finally relaxed completely. Xia Jinyuan could clearly hear him heaving a sigh of relief.","After resting for at least 20 minutes, Luke said, “I don’t think I’ll come a second time while I’m alive. Their armed police are like a wolf pack. They won’t give up their prey easily. God, thank you for letting me escape from the claws of the Chinese armed police.”","Although he had regained his breath, his voice was hoarse. He had been running for too long. His throat was dry and filled with blood. He was exhausted.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t say anything. He just waved his hand, indicating that he didn’t want to talk now. He just wanted to rest.","Luke laughed loudly. He raised his arm and patted Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder heavily. He said gratefully, “Xia, if it wasn’t for you, I would’ve been killed by the gun in the hands of the Chinese police. Thank you, Xia, for saving my life again.”"]},{"number":3893,"title":"Chapter 3893: What Do You Like","paragraphs":["Chapter 3893: What Do You Like","Editor: Henyee Translations","“I just want to lie down for a while, so shut your mouth.” Xia Jinyuan removed the hand on his shoulder. There was lingering fear in his indifferent expression.","Luke laughed softly. With one hand propped on a withered tree, he stood up first and reached out his hand to Xia Jinyuan, who was still lying on the ground. He didn’t want to get up. “Buddy, we should go back now. Although we’re already in Myanmar, I think we still need to find a way back to Cobra.”","Looking at his outstretched hand, Xia Jinyuan reached out his hand and was held tightly by Luke. Using his arm strength, Xia Jinyuan got up and patted off the withered leaves on his back. He said calmly, “Keep walking forward and contact Cobra. I think someone will come and fetch us.”","“That’s right! This is a good idea. Let’s go, my brother. When we go back, I’ll treat you to a drink to celebrate our survival today.”","“I don’t drink, thanks.”","“Oh, I forgot. In that case, let’s go to a bar and look for pretty women?”","“No thanks, I’m not interested in women.”","“God, do you like men, my brother Xia? Oh no, I think that women are still the best. They have big breasts and big buttocks. It feels so good to touch them!”","“Nope, I’m not interested in men.”","“Is it really as those guys said... Are you impotent?”","A fist was aimed at the back of Luke’s head. Luke dodged and turned his head. Laughing, he said, “Prove to me that you aren’t impotent, then. You aren’t interested in women or men. What are you interested in?”","“Money. I’m most interested in money.” Xia Jinyuan retracted his fist and exhaled. “If you mention any topics that I’m not interested in, I can tell you the consequences of making me unhappy.”","“Hahaha, I like money too.” Without the Chinese police chasing after him, Luke laughed even louder. Thank God that he met a good friend. If only... he really was a good friend, how good would that be?","The laughter didn’t stop. However, there was a dark look in the depths of Luke’s eyes. He heaved a long sigh in his heart. If Xia really was a good fellow, how good would that be?","The sky was already bright. The first rays of light pierced through the darkness and shone on the entire ground. Some places were bright while others were still dark. Just like this world, there was light and darkness.","Xia Jinyuan looked at Luke, who was laughing continuously. He used the knife in his hand to carve two more marks on the tree. These two marks were different from the ones he left for the armed police. It was an ‘X’.","About an hour later, a man wearing a jungle camouflage uniform whose nationality couldn’t be guessed squatted beside a tree that had carvings on it. He touched it lightly with his gloved hand and raised his hand to wave behind him. Several men wearing the same camouflage uniform and with dark green and brown paint on their faces came out of the forest.","“It’s left behind by Q King. It’s very fresh. Even the sap of the tree hasn’t dried. There’s no mistake,” G3 said in a low voice. His eyes were shining with excitement. “We can finally meet!”","Z7 reached out his hand and touched it too. He laughed and said, “At that time, he’ll be our enemy and we’ll be the emissaries of justice. In the past, I dreamed of competing with him. This time, my wish is going to be fulfilled. Hahaha!”"]},{"number":3894,"title":"Chapter 3894: Looking At The Entire Situation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3894: Looking At The Entire Situation","Editor: Henyee Translations","Han Zheng didn’t dare to laugh too loudly. His wolf-like eyes were as bright as the morning sun.","This was good. He could meet his brother-in-arms again!","They hadn’t seen each other for more than a year, and there was no news at all. The comrades in the brigade were all worried. Now, they were finally at ease!","T6, who was holding his gun horizontally, kicked Z7’s butt. His shoulders were shaking from laughing. He smiled and said, “You want to compete with Q King? You’ll probably need us to rescue you when the time comes!”","“How is that possible?” Han Zheng, who almost fell from the kick, stood up and raised his chin. He replied confidently, “Let’s wait and see who needs saving.”","The other comrades clicked their tongues. Even K7, who was in charge of guarding, clicked his tongue.","“Stop talking nonsense. Go go go, let’s go. Chase closely and don’t lose them! V8’s team should have arrived at the village where Cobra is hiding. We can’t fall too far behind!” G3 waved his hand and followed Xia Jinyuan. The seven Xueyu unit special forces soldiers had secretly infiltrated Myanmar and were following closely behind.","The traces left behind by Xia Jinyuan were disguised as the teeth marks of a beast.","Major General Yang was the one giving directives to the Xueyu unit. The 14 special forces soldiers split into two teams and entered Myanmar’s territory one after another. One team followed Xia Jinyuan secretly while the other team was led by V8 to the village that Xia Jinyuan reported when he entered China.","Now, G3’s team had already found the traces left behind by Xia Jinyuan. Major General Yang immediately knew about it and reported it to Commander Xia.","Commander Xia now knew the whereabouts of the Xueyu unit and the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade.","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade were in charge of rescuing the female soldiers and reinforcing Ye Jian’s retreat. The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit were mainly cooperating with Xia Jinyuan. Commander Xia and Major General Yang, who hadn’t returned home for a few days, sat in the conference room and discussed how to avoid Cobra if Cobra and Qin Maosheng were together and Ye Jian’s decapitation strike was successful.","Cobra couldn’t move now. The only person who could touch him was Xia Jinyuan.","Now, there was a problem...","Commander Xia said to Major General Yang in a low voice, “Contact the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade and tell them to evacuate immediately after saving the two female soldiers. They can’t stay any longer than that! This is to prevent conflict with the Xueyu unit!","“Inform Azure Bird individually and tell her that she might meet Q King. If she meets Q King, she needs to inform Q King to stop Cobra from entering China! Then, tell the Xueyu unit about the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade’s mission. They can take the opportunity to attack Cobra while secretly protecting the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade!","“If Q King doesn’t meet Azure Bird and Cobra isn’t with Qin Maosheng, the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade will act alone.”","Major General Yang added, “There’s another possibility. Cobra and Qin Maosheng might be together but Q King might not return to Cobra in time. In that case, the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade won’t have the chance to cooperate with the Xueyu unit.”","“That’s right. That’s a possibility.” Commander Xia nodded. “Hence, the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade’s mission and Azure Bird’s decapitation strike mission will continue as usual. The Xueyu unit’s special forces will continue according to Q King’s plan. There won’t be any conflict between the two military units.","“We’re just thinking ahead for if the two military units cross paths and Azure Bird and Q King meet. If that happens, the entire plan needs to be adjusted and Q King’s plan will be implemented in advance.","“And implementing Q King’s plan in advance is on the premise that Azure Bird can inform Q King and let him know about the existence of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade. Only then can the plan be implemented.”"]},{"number":3895,"title":"Chapter 3895: Incredible","paragraphs":["Chapter 3895: Incredible","Editor: Henyee Translations","Commander Xia was considering the entire situation. After considering everything, he directly implemented Xia Jinyuan’s plan in advance. Most importantly... as a father, he didn’t want his only son to take such a huge risk and even risk his life in exchange for Cobra’s trust.","If Xia Jinyuan helped Cobra escape from the battle that Qin Maosheng provoked, he could gain Cobra’s trust this way too!","Major General Yang understood Commander Xia’s painstaking efforts.","However, he still needed to get Xia Jinyuan’s ‘approval’. If Xia Jinyuan felt that it was unacceptable, Commander Xia’s arrangements would be in vain.","After the discussion with Major General Yang, Commander Xia, Xu Yu, the person-in-charge of the Yun Province military district, and the Yun Province drug-hunting team had a video conference. They didn’t mention Cobra and Xia Jinyuan. They only mentioned that there was another special forces team that was on a mission that would secretly help the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade to retreat.","This was good news for the military in the Yun Province. They no longer had to worry about Qin Maosheng’s side concentrating their firepower on them. Before, they were also worried that the Myanmar side would know that the Cloud Leopard commando had secretly infiltrated Myanmar, which may cause unnecessary trouble in the future.","Now, with the help of the special forces, the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade could accelerate their retreat after rescuing the female soldiers.","As for what mission the other special forces team was carrying out and why they appeared in the same village, Xu Yu didn’t ask Commander Xia about that. Since the major general and the commander-in-chief didn’t tell him the reason, he didn’t have to ask.","Everything was proceeding in an orderly manner. The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade and the special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit received the latest order from their superiors almost at the same time.","When the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando knew that there was another Chinese special forces team nearby, they were more or less puzzled. Since the higher-ups didn’t say anything, they couldn’t ask too much. They only knew that after they saved the female soldiers, they would retreat immediately.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit had known about the existence of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade from the start. Hence, they weren’t surprised. What surprised them was... Azure Bird.","“Azure Bird is here too? Are you sure you didn’t hear wrongly? How can Azure Bird be here too? Didn’t Q King say that he wanted to hide it from Azure Bird? But now the military wants Azure Bird to meet Q King and tell Q King to bring his plan forward? How coincidental is all of this?”","T6, who was hiding behind the leaves, said in disbelief. He even wondered if G3 had heard wrongly.","Didn’t they say that Azure Bird was studying in a grassroots company in the Nanguang Military District?","The Nanguang Military District was extremely far away from the Yun Province Military District. One was at the southwest border of the country and the other was in the south of the country. There were countless provinces between them. Azure Bird should be in Nanguang, but she appeared in Yun Province. T6 suspected that G3 had heard wrongly.","G3 didn’t believe it either, but it was the truth. Azure Bird was here, and she was one of the three female soldiers who got kidnapped.","When G3 said that Ye Jian was one of the three female soldiers who got kidnapped, T6 thought he heard it wrong. Even his other comrades thought so.","“Azure Bird was kidnapped? Do you think that’s possible?” Han Zheng asked G3.","G3 was silent for a while before sighing. “She got herself kidnapped on purpose to save the two female soldiers who were kidnapped first.”","G3 explained about the joint plan of the border defense armed police and the Yun Province Military District. As soon as he finished speaking, T6 cursed in a low voice. There was a vicious look in his eyes."]},{"number":3896,"title":"Chapter 3896: Deep Worry","paragraphs":["Chapter 3896: Deep Worry","Editor: Henyee Translations","T6 tightened his grip on the rifle in his hand and said in a low voice, “Is Azure Bird’s life not worth much in their eyes? Two female soldiers have already been kidnapped, and now, Azure Bird is the third!”","“After listening to the entire plan, I only have one thought—what a coincidence! What an extraordinary coincidence. How coincidental is it? It’s so coincidental that Azure Bird is with the two female soldiers who were kidnapped first!”","T6 couldn’t understand why Azure Bird agreed to such a risky plan.","Didn’t the Yun Province Military District and border defense know what would happen to a female soldier if she was captured? How dare they let Azure Bird take the risk? How dare they make such an arrangement?","T6 pursed his lips into a straight line.","“It’s not a coincidence. It should be said that Qin Maosheng is too confident and thinks that it’s impossible for the Chinese to find the kidnapped female soldiers. Also, gathering the three kidnapped female soldiers together will make things easier for them. Also, you have to believe in the ability of the border defense drug hunting team. Since they were able to arrange for Qin Maosheng’s subordinates to kidnap Azure Bird, they were confident that Azure Bird would gather with the other two female soldiers. Also...” G3 pursed his dry lips slightly, and his gaze turned serious.” One of the kidnapped female soldiers is Q King’s cousin. Our superiors gave the green light and agreed to let Azure Bird join us... I don’t have to say anything. You understand what I mean, right?”","G3’s words made T6 look up suddenly. Shock appeared in his eyes. One of the kidnapped female soldiers was Q King’s cousin!","“If not, the higher-ups wouldn’t have agreed to let Azure Bird join. Actually, it’s better for Q King now that Azure Bird is here. Azure Bird’s ability to fight alone will definitely allow Q King to carry out his mission in peace. He won’t be distracted by his cousin’s kidnapping.”","The comrades from the Xueyu unit fell silent. If that was the case, they could understand why the military let Azure Bird take the risk.","The comrades from the Xueyu unit felt a little heavy in their hearts. G3 looked at his comrades who were pressing their lips together and said in a low voice, “The most important thing now is to contact Q King. He needs to know the higher-ups’ arrangements before he can carry out his plan.”","That was right. Whether their plan could be brought forward or not, they had to contact Q King first.","They couldn’t contact Q King themselves. They couldn’t rely on their comrades led by V8 to contact Q King either.","There were still people around Q King. They couldn’t contact him.","They could only rely on Azure Bird.","However, how would Azure Bird know about the higher-ups’ arrangements?","Even if Azure Bird knew, could she really meet Q King?","Whether she could meet Q King depended on whether Cobra and Qin Maosheng would always be together. Once Cobra left Myanmar, the possibility of Azure Bird and Q King meeting was zero.","If Azure Bird couldn’t meet Q King, the missions carried out by the two military units would still be parallel. If they met, the two military units would cooperate for a short period of time.","Hence, it didn’t matter whether the two of them met or not. Besides the fact that Q King would be in greater danger in the future, nothing else would be affected.","G3 looked at the sky that was starting to turn bright. Then, he looked at the marks that had been disguised by his comrades again. His deep voice was slow, but he said with force, “The missions carried out by the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade and Azure Bird don’t conflict with us. Now, we just need to follow Q King. Let’s go! Let’s not fall too far behind!”","Whether Azure Bird and Q King would meet or not, the most important thing was whether they could successfully complete their mission. As for the rest, they wouldn’t consider it for the time being."]},{"number":3897,"title":"Chapter 3897: Lights Of Every House","paragraphs":["Chapter 3897: Lights Of Every House","Editor: Henyee Translations","Seven camouflaged figures walked through the dense forest. They were fighting for the heavy responsibility on their shoulders.","At this moment, it was the New Year’s celebrations in China. The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit followed their leader closely. They carried their guns, putting their lives at risk. Thousands of lights were behind them, and they existed for the people behind those thousands of lights.","Xia Jinyuan, who was advancing, knew that his comrades would definitely be following closely behind him. Hence, every time Luke wanted to stop and rest before leaving, he would urge him. Luke thought that the Chinese armed police were still chasing after them.","When they came out of the dense forest, they finally got a signal on their cell phones. Luke didn’t see any Chinese armed police officers either.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t give him any time to catch his breath. He asked him to hurry up and contact Cobra.","“I really admire you, Xia. We started running yesterday afternoon. Now...” Luke looked at the time on his cell phone. It was noon the next day. “It’s already noon. We’ve been running for a long time. Xia, listen to me. We really need to rest for a while.”","If they rested, they would be wasting the time of Xia Jinyuan’s comrades who were behind. Xia Jinyuan looked coldly at Luke, who had lowered his guard after entering Myanmar. He said calmly without any room for discussion, “Aren’t you worried that Qin Maosheng is scheming against Mr. Cobra?”","That sentence reminded Luke. His gaze turned dark. He lowered his eyes and shrugged helplessly. “Okay, thanks for the reminder. We need to return to Mr. Cobra’s side as soon as possible. If something happens to Mr. Cobra, I don’t think any of us can leave Myanmar.”","Luke, who had walked out of the forest, called Cobra. When he was talking to Cobra, Xia Jinyuan made a mark in a hidden place. The mark was a little complicated. Other than the comrades from the Xueyu unit, no one would be able to guess what it meant.","This was to tell his comrades that they would be leaving by means of transportation. Their destination would remain the same.","A few hours ago, Cobra returned to the neighboring village from the Myanmar military unit. When he came back, the sky had just turned bright. Knowing that he was being schemed against by Qin Maosheng, Cobra didn’t rest. Instead, he carried the drawing board and placed it in front of the village. He started painting.","Cobra was good at painting. Every painting was beautiful, but those who were familiar with him knew that he would only paint when he was in a bad mood.","The bodyguard beside him knew that his boss was in a bad mood. It was best not to go over and provoke him. Even Cobra’s personal bodyguard, whom he trusted very much, didn’t dare to disturb him.","Luke’s call made the bodyguard, who was usually in charge of answering Cobra’s calls, relax. Luke and Xia had already escaped from China and were now safely in Myanmar. There were no armed police following them.","Cobra, who was engrossed in painting, heard the bodyguard’s low voice and knew that his two capable subordinates had exhausted all their strength to escape from China. His facial expression was a little gloomy as he gestured for the bodyguard who was talking to Luke to pass the phone to him.","When Luke heard Cobra’s voice, he first greeted him before asking if Cobra had the time to listen to what he needed to say next.","Holding a paintbrush in one hand, Cobra used watercolors to paint the colors of the landscape. He shrugged and smiled. “Of course, I have time. What do you want to tell me?”"]},{"number":3898,"title":"Chapter 3898: Dispel Suspect","paragraphs":["Chapter 3898: Dispel Suspect","Editor: Henyee Translations","After knowing that his two subordinates had safely entered Myanmar, Cobra’s mood improved a lot. Hearing that Luke was concerned about his safety, he felt much better.","Having a loyal subordinate was a good thing for him.","“Sir, Qin Maosheng deliberately asked us to come to China to trade for him. Does he have other arrangements?” Luke continued in a deep voice, “All the goods in the car were crystal sugar. There were very, very small amounts of drugs. I don’t believe that he needed us to drive a truck into China for less than 50 grams of drugs. I’m worried that he has some schemes that we don’t know about.","“His scheming makes me very worried about your safety, sir.”","Cobra believed in Luke’s loyalty and accepted his words. The paintbrush in his hand gently drew the shadows of the mountains. His slightly narrowed eyes contained an extremely cold and sinister smile. “You’re right. He did make use of you and Xia. However, everything is fine now. You’ve returned safely. It’s time for us to leave.","“I’m very safe now. I won’t give him a chance to scheme against me. I’m sorry for what happened this time, Luke. I was too anxious to establish a cooperation with him and the Myanmar military behind him. I didn’t notice his scheme in time.”","He apologized very sincerely. Based on his tone, one wouldn’t be able to believe that he had instructed his personal bodyguard to kill Xia Jinyuan and Luke if they were watched closely by the Chinese.","Luke whispered a few more sentences and mentioned many times that if it wasn’t for Xia Jinyuan, they wouldn’t have been able to come back alive. Cobra, who was preparing to wash his paintbrush, nodded and praised Xia Jinyuan’s performance.","Before ending the call, Cobra asked Luke casually, “Were you always with Xia?”","“Yes, sir. We were always together. I suggested that we split up and escape, but Xia reminded me that if we did that, the other person wouldn’t be able to help out in time if anything were to happen.”","Only then did Cobra end the call. There was a happy smile on his thin face.","They were always together. Not bad.","Both of them were very capable. He believed that they had what it took to escape.","Next, it was time to have a good chat with Qin Maosheng, a friend who wasn’t very sincere.","The people around Cobra relaxed. Their boss finally smiled and asked them to put away the drawing board.","V8 and the other three had already been observing the entire process. They saw Cobra carrying a drawing board and painting gloomily. They also saw him laughing when he received the call and asking his subordinates to put away the drawing board. He then returned to the wooden house.","The bodyguard beside him looked around vigilantly before returning to the wooden house.","When the bodyguard looked around, V8 immediately hid behind a tree. He only heaved a sigh of relief when the other party only left two people guarding outside the wooden house.","Q King’s reminder was really important. He wanted to let them know how cautious Cobra was. Fortunately, they chose to keep a close eye on him from afar. If they kept a close eye on him, they might be discovered by the people around him.","To prevent themselves from being discovered by Cobra, V8 and the other three didn’t interact much. They just watched silently and waited for Xia Jinyuan to return.","Qin Maosheng didn’t have time to chat with Cobra. He came back from the military unit of the commander-in-chief of Myanmar and started planning to arrange for people to negotiate with the Chinese armed police."]},{"number":3899,"title":"Chapter 3899: Arrogant","paragraphs":["Chapter 3899: Arrogant","Editor: Henyee Translations","If he wanted the Chinese police to give in, he had to let them know that he had their missing female soldiers. After returning to his hiding spot, Qin Maosheng ordered his subordinates to take a photo of the three female soldiers and send it to the Chinese side to see how they would react.","“Take off their masks, make them kneel, and hold your guns to their heads. Tell the Chinese police that if they don’t cooperate, the three Chinese female soldiers can forget about returning to China alive.”","In order to get the drugs seized by the Chinese armed police as soon as possible, Qin Maosheng used this method to warn the Chinese.","Ye Jian and the other two female soldiers were quickly dragged out of the dungeon. Their legs were tied up, so they couldn’t walk properly. They were dragged out of the dungeon.","Ye Jian didn’t struggle. Her facial expression was exceptionally cold. Where were they taking them? What were they planning to do?","What about Zhou Yijin and the other female soldier, Liu Le?","Would they be separated?","Ye Jian didn’t have the time to worry about herself. She placed her focus on Zhou Yijin and Liu Le.","Then, she heard Liu Le struggling in fear and Zhou Yijin’s two muffled whimpers.","Ye Jian felt more at ease when she heard their voices.","She wasn’t the only one dragged out. The two of them were dragged out too.","Ye Jian couldn’t walk properly, so she left two drag marks on the ground. She felt that there were at least ten people walking beside her. She could even detect the smell of gun maintenance oil.","They were carrying guns while dragging them out...","Ye Jian’s heart dropped. Did they want to shoot their hostages?","No, that shouldn’t be likely.","They had not negotiated with the Chinese and had not made their request. It was unlikely that they would shoot the hostages directly.","If they really wanted to shoot the hostages, they wouldn’t have waited until now. They would have done it when they first kidnapped Yijin and the female soldier, Liu Le.","It could be seen that Qin Maosheng didn’t plan to use the bloodiest method to fight with the Chinese, at least not at the very start. If he really dared to shoot the Chinese soldiers, the Chinese would definitely send soldiers across the border to assassinate him. Qin Maosheng knew China’s strength. He wouldn’t dare to be so arrogant!","After thinking about it carefully, Ye Jian felt much calmer.","The surroundings were not very quiet. Some people were talking loudly while others were laughing wantonly. The sound of hitting could be heard everywhere. It was the sound of a gun butt hitting a wooden board.","When Liu Le heard their laughter, she felt as if a pack of wild beasts was surrounding her. She had nowhere to run. The fear in her heart surged up crazily. She started crying.","The Burmese man who was dragging her away laughed even more arrogantly.","His laughter was brutal. Liu Le was even more frightened.","Soon, the three of them were dragged into a wooden house. They heard the other party telling them to stand up straight in awkward Mandarin. Before they could catch their breath, something slammed into their knees and forced them to kneel down.","Their balaclavas were suddenly taken off. Ye Jian, who had been used to the darkness for a long time, narrowed her eyes when she saw the light in the wooden house. She wanted to size up her surroundings, so she narrowed her eyes. After some time, she could finally see her surroundings clearly."]},{"number":3900,"title":"Chapter 3900: Scared","paragraphs":["Chapter 3900: Scared","Editor: Henyee Translations","When she got off the boat, it was nighttime. Now, it was daytime.","Ye Jian, who had adapted to the darkness, took the time to size up her surroundings. From the distance to the sound of the ground, she knew that they had arrived at a house with an empty foundation. She quickly sized up the room that was made of wood. Then, she focused on the man in the room who was holding a gun.","There were four Burmese men with guns in front of her. All of them had fierce eyes, and their expressions were very cold as they stared at them. There were also two men with guns guarding the door to prevent them from escaping. Or rather, they were used to standing guard.","No wonder everyone said that the drug lords from Myanmar were retired soldiers from the military unit. From their habit of standing guard, Ye Jian knew that the rumors were true.","There wasn’t much time for Ye Jian to size up her surroundings. After she pulled her gaze away from the guard at the door, she immediately turned her head and looked to her side. The moment she looked over, she saw two Burmese men holding guns standing on her right. Black muzzles were pointing at her. At the same time, she saw two female soldiers who were tied up and kneeling on the ground. They were wearing the same military uniform as her. It was Zhou Yijin and Liu Le.","Zhou Yijin was still alright. She was calmer. Besides her eyes that were slightly red and swollen and her face that was a little pale, her expression was still alright.","Liu Le’s condition was worse. Her eyes were red and swollen, and her face was haggard. She was forced to kneel because of the gun, and her entire body was trembling. It was obvious that she was very frightened. Her mental state was on the verge of collapse.","If they didn’t save her in time, Liu Le might suffer!","Zhou Yijin looked at Ye Jian too. The two of them looked at each other and couldn’t help but purse their lips. Obviously, Zhou Yijin had also realized that Liu Le’s condition wasn’t good.","Footsteps came from outside. Ye Jian and Zhou Yijin turned their heads and looked at the door at the same time. They saw a Burmese woman walking in with a camera in her hand.","Dan Yi. The woman who walked in with the camera was called Dan Yi. She was the one who pretended to be pregnant. After that, she was very rude to Ye Jian. She would punch and kick Ye Jian to vent her hatred.","The moment she entered, she glanced at the three Chinese female soldiers with hatred in her eyes. She said a few cold words to the men with guns in the room. The next moment, the back of the female soldiers’ heads were hit by a cold and hard object.","They were being held at gunpoint.","Dan Yi saw that the three Chinese female soldiers were unable to resist her guns. She tightened her grip on the camera. If she could, she would rather change the camera to a gun. She would pretend that the gun went off accidentally and blow their heads up with bullets.","Dan Yi, who hated the Chinese soldiers to the core, held the camera like it was a pistol. However, Ye Jian wasn’t afraid. The appearance of the camera made her calmer.","As it turned out, they wanted to use photos to threaten China to achieve their goal.","After a few clicks, Ye Jian’s calm gaze landed on the camera. The photos would be sent to the hands of the Chinese border defense armed police officers.","When Liu Le saw that she was just taking photos, her extremely tense nerves relaxed instantly. At that moment, she broke down entirely. Tears fell from her eyes like rolling pearls. If it wasn’t for the fact that there was something stuffed in her mouth, she might have cried loudly.","Zhou Yijin, who was relatively calm, relaxed her tense back too."]}]);
